hadiths[600]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1201","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Muhammad bin Amr al-vaaqifii ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Muhammad al-Ansari se, un ke chacha Abdullah bin Zaid se, ke Unhon ne khwab mein azan dekhi, to woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur is ka zikr kiya unhon ne kaha: To Bilal ne azan di unhon ne kaha: Aur mere chacha Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main khwab dekhta hun aur Bilal azan dete hain! Aap ne farmaya: To tum iqamat kaho unhon ne kaha: To mere chacha ne iqamat kahi"
"1202","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Mu'awiyah bin al-Hakam as-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se shaguna ke bare mein poocha to Aap ne farmaya: Woh aisi cheez hai jo tum apne seenon mein pate ho, to woh tumhen na roke. main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kuch log kahinon ke paas jate hain! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un ke paas na jao"
"1203","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Harb bin Shaddad aur Aban bin Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Hilal Ibn Abi Maimunah se, Ata bin Yasar se, Mu'awiyah bin al-Hakam as-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhi to mere pahlu wale shakhs ko chheenk aai, to main ne kaha: Yarhamukallah! To log mujhe ghoorne lage, to main ne kaha: Meri walidah mujhe khoye, tumhen Kya hua ke tum mujhe dekhte ho jabke main namaz padh raha hun! To woh mujhe Khamosh karane ke liye apni raanon par hath marne lage, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz poori ki — mere walidah-baap Aap par qurban, Main ne Aap se pahle na baad mein Aap se behtar sikhane wala koi nahin dekha; Allah ki qasam, na Aap ne mujhe jhirakaa na bura di na mara, lekin mujh se kaha: hamari is namaz mein logon ki baton mein se kuch durust nahin; yeh to namaz, tasbih, tahamiida aur Quran ki tilawat hai — ya jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya aur meri bakriyan Uhud aur al-javvaaniyaa ke darmiyan caratii thin mein meri ek laundi thi, ek din Main ne dekha to bhediya mein se ek bakri le gaya tha, aur main gai Adam mein se hun, afsos karta hun jaise woh afsos karte hain, to Main ne hath uthaye use ek thappad mara, phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr kiya, to Aap ne Ise mujh par bada jana, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya main Ise aazad na karun? Aap ne farmaya: Ise bulao to Main ne Ise dawat unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne is se farmaya: Allah kahan hai? Is ne kaha: Aasman mein farmaya: Main kaun hun? Is ne kaha: Aap Allah ke Rasulullah hain to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ise aazad karo, kyunke yeh mominaa hai main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mein kuch log lakeeren kheenche hain! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ambiya mein se ek Nabi lakeer khiincataa tha, to jo us ki lakeer ko pa le to Wahy hai main ne kaha: Mein kuch log shaguna lete hain farmaya: Woh aisi cheez hai jo woh apne seenon mein pate hain, lekin woh unhen na roke. main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mein kuch log kahinon ke paas jate hain to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: To un ke paas na jao"
"1204","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hashraj bin Nubatah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sa'id bin Jumhan ne ham se bayan kiya, Safinah se — Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aazad-karda — unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen khutba diya aur farmaya: Koi Nabi aisa na tha Jis ne apni ummat ko Dajjal se na daraya ho; Khabardar, woh baaeen aankh se kana hai, aur dayan aankh par khilaya jaalaa hai, us ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan kafir likha hai — ya'ni likha hua: Kaafa, faa, raa — aur us ke sath do vaadiyaan nikalengii, ek jannat aur doosri aag nazar pahunchegi, to us ki aag jannat hai aur us ki jannat aag hai Dajjal logon se kehta: Kya main tumhara Rabb nahin, zinda karta aur marte hun? Aur us ke sath ambiya mein se do Nabi honge, main un ke naam aur un ke baapon ke naam janta hun, agar chaahun to un ke naam batao dun, ek us ke daayen aur doosra us ke baaen. to woh kehta: Kya main tumhara Rabb nahin, zinda karta aur marte hun? To ek kehta: Tu ne jhoot kaha — lekin logon mein se us ke sathi ke siwa koi Ise na sune — aur doosra kehta: Tu ne sach kaha — aur log Ise sunenge aur woh fitna hai phir woh chaloge yahan tak ke Madinah aayega aur kehta: Yeh us shakhs ki basti hai, lekin Ise us mein dakhil ki ijazat na hogi phir chaloge yahan tak ke Sham aayega, to Allah Ise Aqabah afiiqa ke paas halaak karega"
"1205","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hashraj bin Nubatah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sa'id bin Jumhan ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Safinah ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen khutba diya aur farmaya: Meri ummat mein khilafat tees saal hai, phir badshahat hogi phir Safinah ne kaha: Gino; Abu Bakr ki khilafat, aur Umar ki khilafat barah saal chhe mahine, aur Usman ki khilafat barah saal, phir Ali ki khilafat se tees ki tamam hai main ne kaha: To Mu'awiyah? Unhon ne kaha: Woh sab pehla Badshah tha"
"1206","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman at-taaifii ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Usman bin Abdullah bin Aws bin Huzaifah as-Saqafi ne ham se bayan kiya, apne dada Aws se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Saqeef ke wafd ke taur par Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae; haleef Mughirah bin Shu'bah ke paas thehre aur Unhon ne maalikiyon ko apne kheme mein qarar unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aakhri Isha ke baad hamare paas aate aur ham se baat karte yahan tak ke lamba qiyam se pair badalte, aur kasrat jo ham se bayan karte woh Quraish ki shikayat thi; farmate: Ham Makkah mein zaleel aur kamzor the, phir jab ham Madinah aae to logon se barabar hue, aur jang ki bari ham par aur hamare liye thi ek raat Aap ham se us waqt se ruk gae jis waqt aate the, phir hamare paas aae, to ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aaj raat Aap ham se us waqt se ruk gae jis waqt aate the! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh par Quran ka ek hizba taarii hua, to Main ne chaha ke Ise padhe baghair na nikaluun — ya kaha: Poora kiye baghair unhon ne kaha: Jab subah hui to Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba se Quran ke Ahzab ke bare mein poocha: Tum Ise kaise taqseem karte ho? To unhon ne kaha: Teen, paanch, saat, nau, gyarah, terah, aur Mufassal ka hizba."
"1207","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, an-Nu'man bin Salim se, bin Aws se — aur Aws un ke dada the — unhon ne kaha: Mere dada ne mujhe ishara kiya ke namaz mein unhen un ki jootiyan dun, to Main ne unhen din aur Unhon ne namaz mein pahne li, phir jab namaz padh chuke to kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apni jootiyon mein namaz padhte dekha"
"1208","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, an-Nu'man bin Salim se, Aws bin Aws as-Saqafi se — aur woh wafd mein the — unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath kheme mein tha aur qaum mein mere siwa koi jagata na tha, to ek shakhs aaya aur Aap se sargoshi ki to Aap ne farmaya: Jao Ise qatl karo phir Ise bulaya aur farmaya: Kya woh gawahi nahin deta ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin aur main Allah ka Rasulullah hun? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke logon se laruun yahan tak ke woh gawahi den ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin aur main Allah ka Rasulullah hun; jab woh is ki gawahi den to Unhon ne apne khoon aur maal mujh se bacha liye — ya kaha: Gunjaish gae — magar is ke haq ke sath"
"1209","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, an-Nu'man bin Salim se, bin Aws se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap ne teen martaba pani undelaa. main ne kaha: Teen martaba pani undelanaa Kya hai? Kaha: Apne hath par teen martaba pani diya"
"1210","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Umair bin Abdullah se, Abdul-Malik bin al-Mughirah at-taaifii se, Aws as-Saqafi se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Saqeef ke wafd mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur Aap paas aadha Maheena thehre, to Main ne Aap daayen aur baayen mudte dekha"
"1211","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, Aws as-Saqafi se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya aur apni jootiyon par masah kiya"
"1212","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Ma'shar ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Qais se, Muhammad bin Sa'id al-Azdi se, Aws Ibn Abi Aws as-Saqafi se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Jume ke din ghusl karae aur ghusl kare aur savere aae aur jaldi pahunche aur paidal chale aur sawar na ho, use har qadam par saal bhar ke roze aur qiyam ka sawab milta"
"1213","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Umari aur bin Nafi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) fath-Makkah ke din Kaabe mein dakhil hue aur darwaza band kiya, aur Aap sath Fazl Ibn Abbas, Usman bin Talha, Usamah bin Zaid aur Bilal dakhil hue jab woh nikle to main logon se daudaya aur sab aage badh gaya, to Bilal se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kahan namaz padhi? Kaha: Agle do sutoonon ke darmiyan nishan ke saamane."
"1214","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hakam ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Ibn Abi Laila ko bayan karte suna ke Bilal ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mouzon aur amame par masah karte the, aur is hadees ko A'mash ne Hakam se, Ibn Abi Laila se, Ka'b bin Ujrah se, Bilal se riwayat kiya"
"1215","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Muslim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Tariq bin Shihab ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke mu'azzin Bilal se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Hamen sirf suraj nikalne se pahle ki namaz se mana kiya gaya; kyunke woh shaitan ke do seengon ke darmiyan nikalta hai — ya kaha: Do seengon par"
"1216","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Ash'as as-sanaaanii se, Shaddad bin Aws se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha to Aap ek pichhne nikalwane wale ke paas se guzre, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pichhne lagane wale aur nikalwane wale ka roza toot gaya"
"1217","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Ash'as as-sanaaanii se, Shaddad bin Aws se, unhon ne kaha: Do khaslatein Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yaad ki, farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall har cheez mein ehsan ko pasand karta hai; to jab zabah karo to achcha zabah karo, aur jab qatl karo to achcha qatl karo, apni chhuri tez kare phir apni zabeehe ko qailula de"
"1218","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdul-Hameed bin baharaama ne ham se bayan kiya, Shahr bin Haushab se, Shaddad bin Aws se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo dikhaave ke liye namaz padhe Us ne shirk kiya, aur jo dikhaave ke liye roza rakhe Us ne shirk kiya, aur jo dikhaave ke liye Sadqa kare Us ne shirk kiya to Auf bin Malik ne kaha: Kya Allah us mein se jo us ke liye tha use lekar qabool nahin karega aur baqi chhod nahin dega? Unhon ne kaha: To Shaddad ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne kaha: Main sab behtar Shareek hun; jo mere sath shirk kare to us ka amal, thoda aur zyada, mere Shareek ke liye hai aur main us se bari hun"
"1219","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdul-Hameed bin baharaama ne ham se bayan kiya, Shahr bin Haushab ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: bin ghanma ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Shaddad bin Aws ne unhen bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen bayan kiya: Is ummat ke badtareen log apne se pahle walon ki hargiz waisi hi pairwi karenge jaise joote ka tasma tasme ke barabar hota hai"
"1220","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Bakr Ibn Abi Maryam ne ham se bayan kiya, Damrah bin Habib se, Shaddad bin Aws se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aqalmand woh hai jo apne nafs ka muhaasabaa kare aur maut ke baad ke liye amal kare, aur aajiz woh hai jo apne nafs ko us ki Khwahish ke peeche lagae aur Allah par ummiiden rakhe"
"1221","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Khalid bin sumaira ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Bashir bin nuhaika ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Bashir — Bashir bin al-khasaasiyaa — ne mujhe bayan kiya, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ka naam Bashir rakha tha, jabke is se pahle un ka naam Zahm tha"
"1222","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Khalid bin sumaira ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Bashir bin nuhaika ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Bashir — Bashir bin al-khasaasiyaa — ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ek martaba main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath chal raha tha — Aapka hath pakde hue — ya kaha: Mera hath pakde hue — ke Aap ne mujh se kaha: Aey bin al-khasaasiyaa, aaj subah Allah se tumhen Kya shikayat hai? Aaj subah tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath chal rahe ho unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Mujhe Allah se kisi cheez ki shikayat nahin, mere walidah-baap Aap par fida hon; Allah ne mere sath tamam bhalai ki, Allah ne mere sath tamam bhalai ki unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mushrikon ki qabron par aae aur farmaya: Yeh bahut bhalai se rah gae, yeh bahut bhalai se rah gaye phir Musalmanon ki qabron par aae aur farmaya: Inhon ne bahut bhalai pa, Inhon ne bahut bhalai paya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek nazar dali to ek aadmi qabron ke darmiyan jootiyan pahne chal raha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey do chamde ki jootiyon wale, apni jootiyan utar de jab Us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha to unhen phenk diya"
"1223","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ubaidullah bin Iyadh bin Laqit as-saduusii ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Bashir bin al-khasaasiyaa ki biwi Laila se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne do din musalsal roza rakhne ka irada kiya, to is ka zikr Bashir se kiya to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is se mana kiya aur farmaya: Yeh Yahudi karte hain, lekin roza rakho aur jab raat ho to iftar karo"
"1224","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sallam bin Sulaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas baithe the ke ek aurat aai aur us ke sath us ka ek ladka ya us ke do ladke the jinhein woh uthae thi aur ek aur chhota beta, unhon ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai woh hamla thi, unhon ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai Us ne us din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kuch na manga magar Aap ne use diya, phir jab woh peeth pherakara gayi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamal uthane wali, janne wali, raham karne wali aurten, agar woh apne shauharon ke sath waisa na kartin to mein se namaz padhne wali jannat mein dakhil theen"
"1225","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ismail bin Ayyash ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shurahbil bin Muslim al-Khaulani ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Umamah ko kehte suna: Main Hajjat-Wada mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hazir tha aur Aap farmate suna: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne har haqdar ko us ka haq diya, to waris ke liye koi wasiyat nahin; bachcha bistar ka hai aur zani ke liye pathar hai; un ka hisab Allah par hai jo apne baap ke siwa kisi ki taraf da'wa kare ya apne maalikon ke siwa kisi ki taraf nisbat kare to us par qayamat ke din tak Allah ki musalsal lanat hai Khabardar, aurat ke liye apne shauhar ke maal mein se kuch dena halal nahin magar us ki ijazat se to ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, khana bhi nahin? Farmaya: Woh hamara sab behtar maal hai"
"1226","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ismail bin Ayyash ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shurahbil bin Muslim al-Khaulani ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Umamah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qarz ada kiya jaega, aur qarz li hui cheez ne jaegi, aur faayade ke liye di hui cheez wapas ki jaegi, aur zamanat denadaara hai"
"1227","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Shahr bin Haushab se, Abu Umamah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wuzu us se pahle ke gunahon ka kaffara hai aur namaz nafl ho jati hai, to kaha gaya: Kya Aap ne Ise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna? Unhon ne kaha: Ek martaba nahin, do martaba nahin, teen martaba nahin, chaar martaba nahin aur paanch martaba nahin"
"1228","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ja'far bin az-Zubair al-Hanafi ne ham se bayan kiya, Qasim se, Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne makhlooq ko paida kiya aur faisla farmaya aur ambiya se ahd liya jabke us ka Arsh pani par tha; to jannat wale us ke Ahl hain, aur aag wale us ke Ahl hain"
"1229","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ja'far ne ham se bayan kiya, Qasim se, Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Na walidain ka nafarman jannat mein dakhil hoga, na ehsan jataane wala aur na taqdeer ka inkar karne chhae"
"1230","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Aiman se, Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Tooba hai us ke liye Jis ne mujhe dekha aur mujh par iman laya, aur saat martaba Tooba hai us ke liye Jis ne mujhe na dekha aur mujh par iman laya"
"1231","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Lais Ibn Abi Sulaim se, Ubaidullah bin zahra se, Qasim se, Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere han sab zyada rashk ke laeq logon mein se woh banda hai jise namaz ka hissa mila, apne Rabb ki ita'at ki aur kar ibadat zyada ki, aur us ki taraf ungliyon se ishara na kiya jata tha, aur woh logon mein gumanaama tha, aur us ki rizq guzare laeq thi, us ki maut jaldi aai aur us ki virasat thodi aur us ke rone wale kam hue"
"1232","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Faraj bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Yazid se, Qasim bin Abdur Rahman se — Yazid bin Mu'awiyah ke aazad-karda — Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne mujhe jahanon ke liye hidayat aur rehmat bana bheja, aur mujhe hukm diya ke baaje, baansuriyan, but, saleeben aur Jahiliyat ke kaam mitaun, aur mere Rabb ne apni izzat aur jalal ki qasam khayi: Mera koi banda duniya mein jaan-kar sharab ka ek ghoont nahin piye magar main qayamat ke din us ki jagah use peep pilaunga, chahe maghfirat-shuda ho ya azab-shuda, aur woh kisi kamzor chhote Musalman ko nahin pilaega magar main qayamat ke din us ki jagah use peep pilaunga, chahe maghfirat-shuda ho ya azab-shuda, aur jo mere dar se Ise choregaa use main Quds ke baade mein pilaauungaa. un ka bechna halal nahin, na khareedna, na mein tijarat, aur un ki qeemat haram hai"
"1233","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu ghalib se, Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Musalman wuzu kare aur achcha wuzu kare to agar baithe bakhsha hua baithe, aur agar namaz padhe to us ke liye fazeelat hogi, to un se kaha gaya: Ya imamat? Unhon ne kaha: Navaafila to sirf Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye thin"
"1234","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu ghalib se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Umamah ke sath tha, to Khariji ke saron mein se kuch sara jane gae aur damishqa ki seedhiyon par rakhe gae, to unhon ne kaha: Jahannam ke kutte — Ise teen martaba kaha — aasman ke sae tale maare gae logon mein sab bure maqtool; sab behtar maqtool woh hai jise Unhon ne qatl kiya aur Jis ne unhen qatl kiya — Ise teen martaba kaha main ne kaha: Koi cheez jo Aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni, ya koi cheez jo Aap apni rae se kehte hain? To unhon ne kaha: Waqt to main bada jurratamanda hounga, waqt to main bada jurratamanda hounga, lekin koi cheez jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni"
"1235","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ja'far bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Farqad se, Asim bin Amr al-Bajali se, Abu Umamah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Is ummat ki ek qaum khane-peene, khel-tamaashe aur ki-bajaane par raat guzaaregii, phir subah karegi is haal mein ke bandar aur suar bana diye gae honge; aur un par zaroor dhansanaa aur pathar barasanaa aayega yahan tak ke log subah kahenge: Aaj raat falan qabeela ko dhansaayaa gaya, aur aaj raat falan ke ghar ko dhansaayaa gaya; aur un par zaroor aasman se patthron wali hawa bheji jaegi jaisi Lut ki qaum par bheji gayi thi — mein se kuch qabilon par aur kuch gharon par — aur un par zaroor baanjh hawa bheji jaegi Jis ne aada ko halaak kiya tha — mein se kuch qabilon par aur kuch gharon par — un ke sharab peene, resham pahanne, ki vaaliyaan apanaane, sood khane aur rishtedari todne ki wajah se — aur ek khasalata jise Ja'far bhool gaye"
"1236","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ja'far bin az-Zubair ne ham se bayan kiya, Qasim se, Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jang-ne-Tabuk mein teen din apne paon mein mouze chhore rakhe"
"1237","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, ek shaikh se, Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bakh, bakh; paanch cheezen kitni bhaari hain: Allah, Allah, La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar, aur nek aulaad jo mare to us ka walid sawab ki ummeed rakhe"
"1238","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Faraj bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Luqman bin Amir se, Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Aap mamle ki aaghaaz Kya thi? Farmaya: Mere walid Ibrahim ki dua aur Isa bin Maryam ki khushkhabri, aur meri walida ne dekha ke un se ek Noor nikla jis se Sham ke mahal raushan hue"
"1239","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ja'far bin az-Zubair al-Hanafi ne ham se bayan kiya, Qasim se, Abu Umamah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek aadmi ko jannat ke darwaze ki taraf le kiya gaya, to Us ne apna sar uthaya to jannat ke darwaze par likha tha: Sadqa das gunaa hai, aur ek qarz attharah gunaa; kyunke qarz lene wala tumhare paas nahin aata magar mohtaj kar, aur Sadqa kabhi ghani par bhi rakh diya jata hai"
"1240","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabi'ah ko apne walid se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete suna jabke Aap farma rahe the: Koi banda mujh par salat nahin bhejta magar farishte us par salat bhejte hain jab tak woh mujh par salat bhejta rahe, to banda kam kare ya zyada"
"1241","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Asim bin Ubaidullah ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabi'ah ko apne walid se bayan karte suna ke Fazarah ki ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya gayi Jis ne ek aadmi se do jootiyon par nikah kiya tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tum apne nafs aur maal ke badle do jootiyon par razi huin? Us ne kaha: Ji Haan — to Aap ne Ise jaiz rakha"
"1242","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan as-Sauri ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabi'ah se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main gin nahin sakta — ya kaha: Kitni martaba — Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko roze ki haalat mein miswak karte dekha"
"1243","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ash'as bin Sa'id Abu ar-Rabi aur Umar bin Qais ne kaha: Asim bin Ubaidullah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabi'ah se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ek martaba andhera hua jabke ham safar mein the aur qibla ham par mushtabaha hua, to mein se har aadmi ne apni taraf namaz padhi, phir jab saaf hua to mein se kuch ne ghair-qible ki taraf namaz padhi thi aur kuch ne qible ki taraf namaz padhi thi, to is ka zikr Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari namaz ho gayi, aur nazil hui: {To tum jidhar bhi munh phero udhar hi Allah ka chehra hai}."
"1244","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Umar bin Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabi'ah se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main tawaf mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha, to Aapka joote ka tasma toot gaya, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe den durust karun! Farmaya: Yeh tarjeeh hai, aur main tarjeeh ko pasand nahin karta"
"1245","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir ko apne walid se bayan karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamesha ke roze ke bare mein farmaya: Na Us ne roza rakha na iftar kiya"
"1246","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Mutarrif se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap padh rahe the {kasrat ki hora ne tumhen ghafil kiya}, aur Aap farma rahe the: Aur Adam ka beta kehta hai mera maal mera maal, aur Aey Adam ke bete, Tere maal mein se Tere liye siwae us ke Kya hai jo Tu ne khaya to fanaa kiya ya pahna to purana kiya ya Sadqa kiya to aage bheja!."
"1247","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu al-Judi ash-Shami ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Sa'id bin al-Muhajir ko Miqdam bin maadiikariba se — aur un ki sohbat thi — bayan karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi aadmi aisa nahin jo kisi qaum ka mehmaan bane phir mehmaan subah mahrum uthe magar har Musalman par us ki madad lazim hai yahan tak ke woh apni raat ki jinhon un ki kheti aur maal se le"
"1248","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, budaila se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali Ibn Abi Talha ko Rashid bin Sa'd se, Abu Amir al-hauzanii se, Miqdam se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte suna, farmaya: Jo maal chhore woh us ke warison ke liye hai, aur jo bojh chhore woh hamari taraf hai — unhon ne kaha: Aur kabhi kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ki taraf — aur main us ka waris hun jis ka koi waris na ho, us ki taraf se diyat dunga aur us ka waris banuungaa, aur maamuun us ka waris hai jis ka koi waris na ho, us ki taraf se dega aur us ka waris banegaa."
"1249","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ash-Sha'bi ko Abu Karimah se bayan karte suna, Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Mehmaan ki raat har Musalman par haq hai; jis ke aangana mein mehmaan subah kare to woh us ke zimme haq hai — ya kaha: Qarz — agar chahe vasuula kare aur agar chahe chhod"
"1250","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdul-Jalla bin atiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Shahr bin Haushab se, Amr bin abasaa as-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Islam mein — ya kaha: Allah ki raah mein — ek safed baal jane, qayamat ke din us ke liye Noor hoga jab tak woh Ise range nahin ya ukhaare nahin Main ne Shahr se kaha: Woh zard rangate aur mehndi se khizab karte hain? Kaha: Ji Haan; unhon ne kaha: Goya un ka matlab kala tha"
"1251","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Rabi' bin Subaih ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qais bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Sham ke fuqaha mein se ek aadmi se, Amr bin abasaa se, unhon ne kaha: Tum ne mujhe dekha jabke main Islam ka cauthaa tha; main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, is mamle mein Aap pairwi Kis ne ki? Farmaya: Ek aazad aur ek ghulam; ya'ni Abu Bakr aur bilaala."
"1252","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, maadaana Ibn Abi Talha al-yaamarii se, Abu Najeeh as-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Taif ke qile ka muhasra kiya, to Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Allah ki raah mein ek teer maare to us ke liye ek aazad-karda ke barabar hai, to us din Main ne solah teer maare, phir Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Allah Azza-wa Jall ki raah mein ek teer chalaye to us ke liye jannat mein ek darja hai, aur jo Islam mein ek safed baal jane qayamat ke din us ke liye Noor hoga, aur jo Musalman aadmi kisi Musalman aadmi ko aazad kare to Allah Azza-wa Jall us ki har haddi ke badle aag se aazad haddi banata, aur jo Musalman aurat kisi Musalman aurat ko aazad kare to Allah Azza-wa Jall us ki har haddi ke badle us ki haddiyon mein se aag se aazad haddi banata"
"1253","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu al-faiza ash-Shami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sulaim bin Amir ko kehte suna: Mu'awiyah aur ruumiyon ke darmiyan ahd tha, to woh un ke mulkon mein chalte rahe, yahan tak ke jab ahd khatm hua to un par hamla kiya, aur ek aadmi sawari par — ya ghode par — kaho raha tha: Allahu Akbar, wafa hai, ghadra nahin — do martaba — aur woh Amr bin abasaa as-Sulami the, to Mu'awiyah ne un se kaha: tum Kya kehte ho? To Amr ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jis ke aur kisi qaum ke darmiyan ahd ho to woh koi girah na khole aur na bandhe yahan tak ke us ki muddat guzar jae ya unhen baraabarii par wapas kar de to Mu'awiyah logon ko lekar wapas aaye"
"1254","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Yazid ko apne walid se, ashtara se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Ammar aur Khalid bin al-Waleed ke darmiyan baat hui, to Ammar ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se shikayat ki, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Aey Khalid, jo Ammar se dushmani rakhe Allah us se dushmani rakhta hai, aur jo us se bughz rakhe Allah us se bughz rakhta hai, aur jo Ammar ko bura de Allah use bura deta hai Salamah ne yeh ya is ke jaisa kaha"
"1255","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Abu Najeeh se, Khalid bin Hakim se, Khalid bin al-Waleed se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din sab sakht azab wale log woh hain jo duniya mein logon ko sab sakht azab dete the"
"1256","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Warqa ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Hammam bin al-Haris se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki masjid mein baithe the ke ek qaum aai jo Usman ki sana kar rahi thi aur un ki tareef kar rahi thi, jabke Miqdad masjid ke ek ko mein the; jab Unhon ne unhen tareef karte suna to khade hue aur kankariyan li aur un ke chehron par mitti lage, to Usman ne kaha: Yeh Kya hai? To unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab tum tareef karne walon ko dekho to un ke chehron par — ya kaha: Un ke munhon mein — mitti kankariyon — ya kaha: Kankariyaan."
"1257","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Maimun Ibn Abi Shabeeb se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Usman ke ek ladke ki tareef karne laga, unhon ne kaha: To Miqdad ne qasda kiya aur us ke chehre par mitti mitti lage, to Usman ne un se kaha: yeh Kya hai? To unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab tum tareef karne walon ko dekho to un ke chehron par mitti daalein"
"1258","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Laila se, unhon ne kaha: Miqdad bin al-Aswad ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main aur mere do sathi aae jin ki sunne aur dekhne ki taqat maal se jati rahi thi, to ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ke samne nafs ko pesh karne lage, koi hamen qabool na karta tha, yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen apne dere par le gae, aur Aal-Muhammad ki teen bakriyan thin jin ka woh doodh dohate the; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mein doodh karte the, aur ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka hissa utha rakhte the, to Aap aate aur aisa salam karte jo jagte ko sunaataa aur sote ko na jagaataa. to shaitan ne mujh se kaha: kaash tum yeh ghoont pi lo! Kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ansar ke paas jate hain to woh Aap tohfe dete hain woh musalsal kehta raha yahan tak ke Main ne Ise pi liya, phir jab Main ne Ise piya to Us ne mujhe sharmindaa kiya aur kaha: Tum ne Kya kiya? Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aayenge aur apna mashroob na payenge to tum par dua karenge aur tum halaak ho jaaoge. mere do sahaba ne to apne mashroob piye aur so gae, lekin mujhe neend na aai, aur mere paas meri ek chadar thi jise agar sar par rakhta to pair nange hote aur agar pairon par rakhta to sar nanga hota Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae jaisa aate the, jitni Allah ne chaha namaz padhi, phir apne mashroob ki taraf dekha aur kuch na dekha, to apna hath uthe main ne kaha: Ab mujh par dua karenge aur main halaak aur! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah, jo mujhe khilaya use khilaa aur jo mujhe pilaye use pilaa. to Main ne chhuri aur chadar li aur bakriyon ki taraf gaya unhen tatolane ke kaun sab mota hai taake Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye zabah karun, to dekha sab phaad thanon wali thin to Main ne Aal-Muhammad ka ek bartan liya jis mein dohane ki woh ummeed na rakhte the, aur dohaa yahan tak ke jhag upar aa gaya, phir Ise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya — Aap ne piya, phir mujhe diya to Main ne piya, phir Aap diya to Aap ne piya, phir mujhe diya to Main ne piya, phir main hansne yahan tak ke zameen par gir hua to Aap ne mujh se kaha: tumhari ek burayi, Aey miqadaada. to Main ne Aap dikhana shuru kiya jo Main ne kiya tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Yeh to Allah ki taraf se rehmat thi; kaash tum apne do sahaba ko jagaa lete to woh bhi is mein se pate! To main ne kaha: Us ki qasam Jis ne Aap haq ke sath bheja, mujhe parwah nahin, jab Aap ne Ise paya aur Main ne Aapka bacha hua paya, to logon mein se kise na mila"
"1259","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Aban bin Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Zaid bin Sallam se, Abu Sallam se, Haris al-Ash'ari se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne Yahya bin zakariyyaa ki taraf paanch kalimaat ki Wahy ki ke un par amal karen aur gai Isra'il ko hukm den ke un par amal karen, to goya Unhon ne mein der ki, to Allah Azza-wa Jall ne Isa ki taraf Wahy ki ke ya to woh unhen pahuncaaen ya tum pahuncaao. to Isa un ke paas aae aur kaha: Allah ne Aap paanch kalimaat ka hukm diya ke un par amal karen aur gai Isra'il ko hukm den ke un par amal karen, to ya to Aap unhen khabar den ya main unhen khabar dun! To unhon ne kaha: Aey ruuhullaaha, aisa na karo; kyunke mujhe dar hai agar tum mujh se pahle unhen le gae to mujhe dhansaayaa jaega ya azab diya jaega! Unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne gai Isra'il ko baitul-Maqdis mein jama kiya yahan tak ke masjid bhar gayi aur woh chajjon par baithe, phir unhen khutba diya aur kaha: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne meri taraf paanch kalimaat ki Wahy ki aur gai Isra'il ko hukm diya ke un par amal karen; pehla: Allah ke sath kuch shirk na karen, kyunke jo Allah ke sath shirk kare us ki misaal aise aadmi jaisi hai Jis ne apne khalis maal se sone ya chandi se ek ghulam khareeda phir use ek ghar mein thahraya aur kaha: Kaam kar aur mujhe de, to ghulam apne sardar ke siwa kisi aur ko dene laga; tum se kaun razi hoga ke us ka ghulam aisa ho? Allah Azza-wa Jall ne tumhen paida kiya aur rizq di to us ke sath kuch shirk na karo, aur jab namaz ke liye khade ho to idhar-udhar na dekho, kyunke Allah Azza-wa Jall apne chehre se apne bande ke chehre ki taraf mutawajjah hota hai jab tak woh idhar-udhar na dekhe, aur tumhen roze ka hukm diya, aur us ki misaal aise aadmi jaisi hai jo ek giroh mein ho jis ke paas mushk ki thaili ho aur sab chahte hon ke us ki khushbu paen, aur rozedar ke munh ki bu Allah ke han mushk ki khushbu se zyada pakeezah hai, aur tumhen sadqe ka hukm diya, aur us ki misaal aise aadmi jaisi hai jise dushman ne qaid kiya aur us ki gardan se bandha ya use qareeb kiya taake us ki gardan karen, to woh un se kehne laga: Kya tumhen yeh pasand hai ke main tum apna fidya dun, to woh thoda aur zyada dene laga yahan tak ke Us ne apna fidya diya, aur tumhen Allah ke zikr ki kasrat ka hukm diya, aur us ki misaal aise aadmi jaisi hai jis ke peeche dushman tez se us ke nishan par laga ho yahan tak ke woh ek mazboot qile mein aaya aur nafs ko us mein mahfooz kiya, aur isi tarah banda shaitan se nahin bachta magar Allah ke zikr se"
"1260","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Aban ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Zaid bin Sallam se, Abu Sallam se, Haris se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur main tumhen paanch ka hukm deta hun jin ka Allah Azza-wa Jall ne mujhe hukm diya: Jama'at, sunne aur ita'at, hijrat, aur Allah ki raah mein jihad — jo jama'at se balisht bhar alag hua Us ne Islam ki rassi — ya iman ki — apni gardan se utar dekha — ya iman ko apne sar se — jab tak woh wapas na aae, aur jo Jahiliyat ki pukarte pukare woh jahannam ke dheron mein se hai kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, chahe roza rakhe aur namaz padhe? Farmaya: Chahe roza rakhe aur namaz padhe; Allah ki pukarte se pukaro jis se Us ne tumhara naam rakha: Musalman, mo'min, Allah ke bande."
"1261","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham Woh-dastuvaaii ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim se, Khalid bin maadaana se, irabaaza bin saariyaa se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne agli saf ke liye teen martaba aur doosri ke liye ek martaba bakhshish mangi"
"1262","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Abdullah bin Salamah ko Safwan bin Assal al-Muradi se bayan karte suna ke Ahle-Kitab mein se do aadmiyon mein se ek ne apne sathi se kaha: Chalo hamen is Nabi ke paas le chalo, to us ne kaha: Yeh na sune ke us ke chaar aankhen ho jaen, to woh donon un ke paas aae aur un se nau wazeh nishaniyon ke bare mein poocha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke sath kuch shirk na karo, na qatl karo, na chori karo, na zina karo, na jadu karo, na sood khao, na daman aurat par tohmat lagao, na pada se bhaago, na kisi aisi ko hakim ke paas le jao taake use qatl karo ya halaak karo, aur tum par khaas taur par, Aey yahuudiyo, Hafta mein hadd se na barho. to Unhon ne Aap hath-pair diya aur kaha: Ham gawahi dete hain ke Aap Nabi hain, farmaya: To tumhen meri pairwi se Kya rokta hai? To unhon ne kaha: Dawud ne dua ki thi ke un ki aulaad mein hamesha Nabi rahe, aur hamen dar hai agar Ham ne Aap pairwi ki to Yahudi hamen qatl kar denge! Aur Abu Dawud ne ek martaba kaha: Na daman aurat par tohmat lagao ya pada se na bhaago; Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ko shak hua"
"1263","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah, Hammad bin Zaid, Hammam aur Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat bin Hubaish se, unhon ne kaha: Main subah Safwan bin Assal al-Muradi ke paas gaya to unhon ne kaha: Aey riwayat, tumhen Kya laya? Main ne kaha: Ilm ki tijarat, to unhon ne kaha: Kya main tumhen khushkhabri na dun? Abu Dawud ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne Ise kaha, aur mein se kisi ne Ise na kaha, aur hadees ko marfu' bayan kiya: Farishte ilm ke Talib ke liye apne par bichhate hain, us ki tijarat se razi hote hue"
"1264","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah, Hammad bin Zaid, Hammam aur Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, unhon ne kaha: Main subah Safwan bin Assal ke paas gaya aur kaha: Mouzon par masah ke bare mein mere dil mein kuch khatakataa hai, to Kya Aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein kuch suna? Unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar mein the — ya musafir the — to Aap ne hamen hukm diya ke hajat, peshab aur neend ki wajah se teen din aur un ki raaten un par masah karen, siwae janabat ke"
"1265","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah, Hammad bin Salamah, Hammad bin Zaid aur Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Safwan bin Assal se kaha: Kya Aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se muhabbat ke bare mein kuch suna? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan, ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath kisi safar ya ghazwa mein the, to ek dehati ne buland awaz mein Aap pukara aur kaha: Aey Muhammad, Aey Muhammad, Aey Muhammad, to us se kaha gaya: Afsos tum par, apni awaz aahista kar, tumhein awaz buland karne se mana kiya gaya hai! Woh isi tarah pukarta raha yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use khayal hi awaz mein jawab diya aur kaha: Hazir hun unhon ne kaha: Us aadmi ke bare mein Kya khayal hai jo kisi qaum se muhabbat rakhe lekin un se mila na ho! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi us ke sath hai jis se woh muhabbat rakhe"
"1266","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah, Hammad bin Salamah, Hammad bin Zaid aur Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat bin Hubaish se, unhon ne kaha: Safwan mujhe bayan karte rahe yahan tak ke Unhon ne Maghrib ki taraf Tauba ke darwaze ka zikr kiya, jis ki cauraaii chalis saal ya chalis saal ki musafat hai, woh chhat rahega yahan tak ke suraj us ki taraf se nikle, aur Wahy us ka qaul hai: {Jis din tumhare Rabb ki kuch nishaniyan aaengii, kisi jaan ko us ka iman nafa na dega jo pahle iman na laya ho ya apne iman mein bhalai na kamai ho}."
"1267","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Abbad bin Shurahbil se, unhon ne kaha: Main Madinah aaya jabke mujhe sakht bhook lagi thi, to main ek bagh mein dakhil hua aur ek bali li aur us mein se khaya aur apne kapde mein rakha, to bagh ka Malik aaya aur mujhe mara aur jo mere kapde mein tha le liya, unhon ne kaha: To ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gae aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Na Tum ne use sikhaya jab woh jahil tha, na use khilaya jab woh bhooka tha to mere liye aadha wasq jau ka hukm diya"
"1268","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan se, Amr bin Taghlib se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se ek baat kahi jis ke badle mujhe surkh oont bhi pasand nahin: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas qaidi jane gae to Aap ne ek qaum ko diya aur ek qaum ko na diya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham ek qaum ko dete hain un ke ghabaraane aur laqis hone ke dar se, aur ek qaum ko us iman ke ki karte hain jo Allah ne un ke dilon mein rakha hai, mein se Amr bin Taghlib hain"
"1269","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Aur Amr bin Taghlib ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke tum ek aisi qaum se laroge jin ki jootiyan balon ki hongi, aur qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke tum ek aisi qaum se laroge jin ke chehre jaise kot ki hui dhaalen hon, aur qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke tajir badh jaenge aur qalam zahir hoga"
"1270","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Rabi'ah bin Ka'b al-Aslami ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas raat guzarta tha aur raat mein Aap wuzu ka pani deta tha, to raat bhar Aap kehte sunta: Allah ne us ki sun li Jis ne us ki tareef ki, aur raat bhar Aap kehte sunta: Sab tareef Allah ke liye jo jahanon ka Rabb hai"
"1271","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mubarak bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-jaunii se, Rabi'ah bin Ka'b se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki paas karta tha, to ek din farmaya: Aey Rabi'ah, Kya tum ihsan nahin karoge? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ki qasam, mere paas woh nahin jis se aurat ka guzara ho, aur mujhe pasand nahin ke Aap paas se koi cheez mujhe mashghool kare phir doosre din mujh se kaha: Aey Rabi'ah, Kya tum ihsan nahin karoge? To Main ne un se waisa hi kaha, unhon ne kaha: Phir Main ne apne dil mein kaha: Allah ki qasam, Rasulullah duniya-aakhirat ke mere mamle mein mere maroof ko mujh se behtar jante hain, aur Allah ki qasam, agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se teesri martaba kaha to main zaroor Haan kahuungaa. to teesri martaba mujh se farmaya: Aey Rabi'ah, Kya tum ihsan nahin karoge? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Rasulullah jo chahen karen to farmaya: Falan ke gharwalon ke paas jao — Ansar mein se log — aur kaho: Rasulullah ne mujhe bheja hai, salam pahunchate hain aur tumhen hukm dete hain ke falan se mera nikah kar do to main un ke paas aaya aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tumhen hukm dete hain ke falan se mera nikah kar do to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah ko khush aur Rasulullah ke Rasulullah ko khush, Allah ki qasam, aaj Rasulullah ka Rasulullah apni hajat ke baghair na aate unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne mera nikah kar diya aur meri izzat ki, phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ne mujhe ghumgeen-ghamgin dekha, to farmaya: Tumhen Kya hua, Aey Rabi'ah? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main izzat wale logon ke paas aaya to Unhon ne meri izzat ki aur mera nikah kar diya, lekin mere paas meher nahin! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Buraidah al-Aslami, mere liye khajoor ki guthli ke wazan ke barabar Sona jama karo to Unhon ne mere liye is mein jama kiya, to farmaya: Ise lekar un ke paas jao to main un ke paas aaya aur Unhon ne Ise mujh se qabool kiya aur khush hue phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ne mujhe ghumgeen dekha, to farmaya: Tumhen Kya hua, Aey Rabi'ah? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main izzat wale logon ke paas aaya to Unhon ne Ise mujh se qabool kiya aur khush hue, lekin mere paas waleeme ke liye kuch nahin! Farmaya: Aey Buraidah, us ke liye mendhe ki qeemat jama karo to Unhon ne mere liye ek bade mendhe ki qeemat jama ki, phir kaha: A'ishah ke paas jao aur un se kaho: Rasulullah tum kehte hain: Use woh khana de do to main un ke paas aaya aur unhon ne kaha: Yeh tokri lo, Allah ki qasam, hamare paas is ke siwa kuch nahin unhon ne kaha: To Main ne Ise liya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya — to farmaya: Ise lekar un ke paas jao; yeh un ke paas roti bane aur yeh un ke paas gosht tazhu to main Ise un ke paas laya, to unhon ne kaha: Roti to ham tumhen kafi honge, aur tum hamen gosht kafi ho to main mendhe ko lekar apne sahaba mein se kuch logon ke paas gaya aur Ham ne milne Ise kiya, phir is se farigh hue, aur Ise lekar gaya aur waleema kiya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bulaya to Aap ne meri dawat qabool ki"
"1272","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mubarak bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-jaunii se, Rabi'ah bin Ka'b al-Aslami se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe zameen di aur Abu Bakr ko zameen di unhon ne kaha: To hamara ek uskhool — ya'ni khajoor — mein ikhtilaf hua; main ne kaha: Yeh meri zameen mein se hai! Aur Abu Bakr ne kaha: Yeh meri zameen mein se hai! To kaha: Aey Abu Bakr, Kya tum nahin dekhte? Dekho, Kya tum nahin dekhte? Yeh meri zameen mein se hai! Lekin Unhon ne inkar kiya, aur mujh se ek baat kahi jis par sharmindaa hue, to kaha: Aey Rabi'ah, mujh se waisa hi kaho jaisa Main ne tum kaha taake badla ho! Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: To kaha: Allah ki qasam, waqt main tum par fariyaada karunga! Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Tum! Han to woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf chale aur main un ke peeche chala, aur meri qaum ke log aae aur kaha: Allah Abu Bakr par raham kare, Wahy hai Jis ne tum woh kaha aur tum par fariyaada karta hai! To woh mere sath chale, to Main ne un se kaha: Kya tum jante ho yeh kaun hai? Yeh Abu Bakr as-Siddiq hain, do mein se doosre jabke woh ghaara mein the; woh Rasulullah ke paas gusse mein aate hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke gusse ke liye gussa honge aur Allah Azza-wa Jall apne Rasulullah ke gusse ke liye gussa hoga aur Rabi'ah halaak hoga; wapas jao! To Main ne unhen diya aur chala, jabke woh mujh se pahle Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunch chuke the aur Aap se bayan kar chuke the jab main aaya to Aap ne mujh se kaha: Aey Rabi'ah, tumhen Siddiq se Kya? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Unhon ne mujh se kuch kaha, aur mujh se kaha: waisa hi kaho jaisa Main ne tum kaha taake badla ho, to main ne kaha: Main tum waisa nahin kahunga jaisa Tum ne mujh se kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan, to us se waisa na kaho jaisa Us ne tum kaha, lekin kaho: Allah tumhen muaf kare, Aey Abu bakra. to main ne kaha: Allah tumhen muaf kare, Abu Bakr; Allah tumhen muaf kare, Abu bakra. unhon ne kaha: To Abu Bakr samne hue peeth pherakara gaye"
"1273","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Hamzah al-Aslami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se safar mein roze ke bare mein poocha? To farmaya: Agar chaho to roza rakho aur agar chaho to iftar karo"
"1274","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Malik bin Anas ne ham se bayan kiya, Salim Abu an-Nazr se, bin jarhada se, jarhada se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke paas se guzre jabke Unhon ne apni raan khole thi, to farmaya: Aey jarhada, apni raan dhaanpo kyunke woh satar mein se hai"
"1275","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Buraida Ibn Abi Maryam as-saluulii ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Abu al-hauraa as-Sa'di ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hasan bin Ali se kaha: Aap Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Kya yaad hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne sadqe ki khajooron mein se ek khajoor li aur apne munh mein dali, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ise is ke luaaba par nikali aur khajooron mein phenkta to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ek bachche ki khajoor! To farmaya: Ham Aal-Muhammad hain, hamare liye Sadqa halal nahin"
"1276","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Buraida Ibn Abi Maryam ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Abu al-hauraa ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hasan bin Ali se kaha: Aap Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Kya yaad hai? Unhon ne kaha: Aap farmate the: Jo tumhen shak mein phenke use chhodo us ki taraf jo tumhen shak mein na phenke, kyunke sach itminan hai aur jhoot shak hai"
"1277","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Buraida ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Abu al-hauraa ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hasan bin Ali se kaha: Aap Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Kya yaad hai? Unhon ne kaha: Woh hamen yeh dua sikhate the: Aey Allah, mujhe mein hidayat de jinhein Tu ne hidayat di, aur mujhe mein afiyat de jinhein Tu ne afiyat di, aur mujhe mein dost bana jinhein Tu ne dost banaya, aur mujhe us burayi se bacha jo Tu ne faisla ki; Beshak Tu faisla karta hai aur tum par faisla nahin kiya jata; Beshak woh zaleel nahin hota jis se Tu dost rakhe; barkat wala hai Tu, hamare Rabb, aur buland hai tuu."
"1278","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin sarajisa ko suna — aur Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna tha — unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab safar ka irada karte to farmate: Main Allah ki panah mangta hun safar ki mashaqqat se, wapasi ki udaasii se, izafe ke baad ghatata se, mazloom ki dua se, aur maal aur gharwalon mein bure manzar se"
"1279","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ash-Sha'bi ko Muhammad bin Safwan se bayan karte suna ke Unhon ne ek khargosh ka shikar kiya aur Ise cakamaka se zabah kiya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, to Aap ne unhen Ise khane ka hukm diya"
"1280","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hafsah bint Sireen ko rabaaba se, Salman bin Amir se bayan karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek roza rakhe to khajoor par iftar kare, aur agar na pae to pani par kyunke woh pak karne wala hai"
"1281","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Khalid bin Qariz se, Sa'id bin al-Musayyab se, Abdur Rahman bin Usman se, unhon ne kaha: Ek tabeeb ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mendak ke bare mein poocha jise woh dawa mein karta tha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use is ke qatl se mana kiya"
"1282","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim at-Taimi se, Sa'id bin al-Musayyab se, Ma'mar bin Abdullah bin nazlaa se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zakhira sirf gunahgar karta hai"
"1283","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mansoor Ibn Abi al-Aswad ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mujaalida ne ham se bayan kiya, ash-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap farmate suna: Quraish ko dekho, un ki baat suno aur un ka kaam chhod"
"1284","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hajjaj se, Muhammad Abu Sahl se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad bin Maslamah ko chhat ke upar se ek aurat ko dekhte hue dekha, to Main ne un se kaha: Kya Aap yeh karte hain jabke Aap Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se hain? To unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab Allah Azza-wa Jall tum se ek ke dil mein kisi aurat ko paigham dene ki baat phenke to use dekhne mein koi harj nahin"
"1285","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, muaiqiiba se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kankriyon ko barabar karne ke bare mein poocha, to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Ek martaba, ya chhod do"
"1286","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zubair bin Sa'id ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Ali se, apne walid se, apne dada se Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur Main ne Makkah mein ek shaikh ko suna aur kaha: Abdullah bin Ali ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' bin Ujair se, Rukanah bin Abd Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Mere paas suhaiyaa naam ki ek biwi thi, to Main ne use hamesha ke liye talaq di to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne suhaiyaa ko hamesha ke liye talaq di, aur Allah ki qasam Main ne sirf ek ka irada kiya tha! Farmaya: Allah ki qasam, Kya Tum ne sirf ek ka irada kiya tha? Main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Main ne sirf ek ka irada kiya tha! Farmaya: Allah ki qasam, Kya Tum ne sirf ek ka irada kiya tha? Main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Main ne sirf ek ka irada kiya tha! To Aap ne use ek par mujh par wapas diya"
"1287","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sakan bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, Waleed Ibn Abi Hisham se, Farqad Abu Talha se, Abdur Rahman bin Khabbab se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko tangi ke lashkar ke liye dene ki taraghiiba dete suna, to Usman bin Affan khade hue aur kaha: Allah ki raah mein sau oont un ke kajaavon aur kaathiyon sameta. phir doosri martaba taraghiiba di, to Usman khade hue aur kaha: Allah ki raah mein do sau oont un ke kajaavon aur kaathiyon sameta. phir teesri martaba taraghiiba di, to Usman khade hue aur kaha: Allah ki raah mein teen sau oont un ke kajaavon aur kaathiyon sameta. unhon ne kaha: To Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mimbar se utarte dekha jabke Aap farma rahe the: Aaj ke baad Usman jo kare use nuqsan na dega, do ya teen martaba"
"1288","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ash'as Ibn Abi ash-riwayat se, apni phuphi se, apne chacha se, unhon ne kaha: Main chal raha tha jabke meri ek Burdah chadar thi jise main ghasiitataa tha, to ek aadmi ne kaha: Apna kapda uthao kyunke woh zyada taqwa wala aur zyada baqi rehne wala hai to Main ne dekha to woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) the to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yeh to Habarah Burdah hai! To farmaya: Kya mere andar tumhare liye namuna nahin? To Main ne dekha to Aapka izaar aadhi pindli tak tha"
"1289","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin Maimun ko Abdullah bin Rabi'ah se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ubaid bin Khalid ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do aadmiyon ke darmiyan bhai karaya; ek qatl hua aur doosra baqi raha, phir woh mara aur Unhon ne us par namaz padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne Kya kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Allah se dua ki ke use muaf kare aur us par raham kare aur use us ke sathi se milaae. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: To us ki namaz ke baad us ki namaz kahan? Aur us ke amal ke baad us ka amal kahan? Aur mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Aur us ke roze ke baad us ka roza kahan? Us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, donon ke darmiyan aasman-zameen ke darmiyan se zyada doori hai Amr bin Maimun ne kaha: Yeh hadees mujhe liye achchi lagi kyunke yeh mujh tak sanad se pahunchi"
"1290","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Suwaid bin Qais se, unhon ne kaha: Main aur makharafaa Hajar se kapda jane, to Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko shalwar becha, aur wahan ek taulane wala tha jo ujrat par taulataa tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taulo aur zyada do"
"1291","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Safwan Malik bin Umair ko kehte suna: Main ne hijrat se pahle Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko shalwaren ka ek paayancaa teen dirham mein becha, to Aap ne mere liye taula aur zyada diya"
"1292","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad bin Hatib ko kehte suna: Handii mere hath par giri aur jal gaya, to meri walida mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas le gayin, to Aap us par thuukane lage aur farmate: Takleef door kar, Aey logon ke Rabb; aur mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Aur shifa de, Tu hi Shaafi hai"
"1293","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Simak bin Harb ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Sa'labah bin al-Hakam al-Laisi ko kehte suna: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the ke bakriyan luuta li gayin, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is se mana kiya aur handiyaan ulat di gaen"
"1294","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko bin Labid se — Ansar mein se ek aadmi — bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh ilm ke jane ka waqt hai — ya: Yeh ilm ke katane ka waqt hai to bin Labid ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaise, jabke hamare darmiyan Allah ki Kitab hai, ham Ise apne beton ko sikhate hain aur hamare bete Ise apne beton ko sikhaaenge? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhari walidah tumhen khoye, Aey bin Labid, main to tumhen Madinah ka sab aqalmand aadmi samajhta tha; Kya Yahudi aur Nasara ko Taurat-Injeel nahin di gayi thi, phir unhen is se kuch nafa na hua?."
"1295","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Qilabah se, unhon ne kaha: Sabit bin az-Dahhak al-Ansari ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mo'min par us cheez mein Nazr nahin jis ki woh Malik nahin; aur mo'min par lanat use qatl karne jaisi hai, aur jo apne nafs ko kisi cheez se qatl kare qayamat ke din usi se azab diya jaega, aur jo Islam ke siwa kisi deen ki jhooti qasam khae to woh waisa hi hai jaisa Us ne kaha"
"1296","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko suna, Shurahbil bin as-simta se, unhon ne kaha: Ka'b bin Murrah ya Murrah bin Ka'b al-bahazii se kaha gaya: Hamen koi hadees bayan karo jo Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni ho, Allah tumhare baap ko izzat de, aur hoshiyaara raho! Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Musalman aadmi kisi Musalman aadmi ko aazad kare woh aag se us ka fidya hai; us ki haddiyon ki har haddi ke badle us ki haddiyon mein se haddi ka badla liye, aur jo Musalman aadmi do Musalman aurton ko aazad kare woh aag se us ka fidya hain; un ki haddiyon ki har do haddiyon ke badle us ki haddiyon mein se haddi ka badla liye, aur jo Musalman aurat kisi Musalman aurat ko aazad kare woh aag se us ka fidya hai; us ki haddiyon ki har haddi ke badle us ki haddiyon mein se haddi ka badla milta"
"1297","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salim ko suna, Shurahbil bin as-simta se, Ka'b bin Murrah se — ya Murrah bin Ka'b se — unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muzar par dua ki, to main Aap paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ne Aap madad ki, Aap diya aur Aap suni, lekin Aap qaum halaak hui, to Allah se un ke liye dua karen! Unhon ne kaha: To farmaya: Aey Allah, hamen fariyaada sunne wali, khushagavaara, phal, chaane wali, khub, jaldi aane wali, der na karne wali, nafaabakhsha, nuqsan na dene wali baarish de unhon ne kaha: Agli Jumua ya is ke qareeb na aaya tha ke ham par baarish hui"
"1298","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, ke Ka'b bin Murrah ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main Aap paas aisi qaum ke paas se aaya hun jin ke oont un ke liye hilate nahin aur jin ka charwaha un ke liye Tosha nahin leta"
"1299","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Hilal bin Yasaf ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin Rashid ko suna, Wabisah bin Ma'bad se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko saf mein akela namaz padhte dekha to use namaz dohrane ka hukm diya"
"1300","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Burdah ko bayan karte suna ke Unhon ne Juhainah mein se Agharr ek ek aadmi ko Ibn Umar se bayan karte suna ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aey logo, apne Rabb ki taraf Tauba karo, kyunke main din mein sau martaba us ki taraf Tauba karta hun"
"1301","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Warqa ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Hilal bin Yasaf se, Khalid bin arfajaa al-Ashja'i se, unhon ne kaha: Woh Salim bin Ubaid al-Ashja'i ke sath chal rahe the ke ek aadmi ko chheenk aai aur kaha: Assalamu alaikum! To Salim ne kaha: Wa alaika aur Teri walidah par! Phir thodi der chale, phir us aadmi se kaha: Shayad tumhen bura laga jo Main ne tum kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Main chahta tha ke Tum ne meri walidah ka zikr bhalai ya burayi mein na kiya hota! To unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen Wahy bayan karta hun jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se dekha; Aap samne ek aadmi ko chheenk aai aur kaha: Assalamu alaikum! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wa alaika aur Teri walidah par; jab tum se ek ko chheenk aae to kahe: Alahamdulillaahi rabbil-Aalameen, ya Allah ala woh haal; aur us ka bhai us se kahe: Yarhamukallah; aur woh kahe: Allah mujhe aur tumhen muaf kare"
"1302","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Qais Ibn Abi gharazaa se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bazaar mein hamare paas aae jabke ham naap bech rahe the, aur ham nafs ko dallal kehte the, to Aap ne hamen us se behtar naam diya jo Ham ne nafs ko diya tha"
"1303","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, Abu Wa'il se, Qais Ibn Abi gharazaa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya: Aey taajiron ki jama'at, tumhare is bazaar mein bekaara baat aur qasmen mil jati hain, to Ise sadqe se milao ya sadqe mein se kisi cheez se"
"1304","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ziraghaamaa bin ulaibaa bin Harmalah al-Anbari ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main qabeela ke sawaron mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ne hamen Fajr ki namaz padhai, to main apne pahlu wale ko dekhne laga, aur use shayad hi pahchanta tha — ya'ni andhere ki wajah se"
"1305","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qurrah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ziraghaamaa ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main qabeela ke sawaron mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya, phir jab Main ne laut ka irada kiya to kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe wasiyat karen! Farmaya: Allah se daro, aur jab tum kisi majlis mein ho aur un se Utho phir unhen woh kehte suno jo tumhen achcha lage to us mein aao, aur jab unhen woh kehte suno jo tum napasand karo to us mein na Donon"
"1306","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qurrah bin Musa ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir bin Sulaim al-Hujaimi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunchi jabke Aap apni Burdah mein ghutne samete baithe the, goya main is ki kinare Aap pairon par dekh raha hun, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe wasiyat karen! Farmaya: Allah se daro, aur neki mein se kisi cheez ko haqeer na jano, chahe apni dol se pani mangne wale ke bartan mein dalne ho, aur apne bhai se milanaa jabke tumhara chehra us ki taraf khilaa ho, aur izaar latkane se bacho, kyunke izaar latakaanaa takabbur mein se hai aur Allah Ise pasand nahin karta, aur agar koi aadmi tumhen bura de aur tumhen aisi baat se ta'na de jo tum hai to use aisi baat se ta'na na dilao jo us mein hai, aur use chhod do, us ka vabaala usi par hoga aur us ka ajr tumhare liye, aur kisi cheez ko bura na do unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qaul ke baad Main ne na kisi janwar ko bura di na insan ko"
"1307","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Azraq bin Qais se, asaasa bin salaamaa se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek safar mein the aur apne sahaba mein se ek aadmi ko na paya, to use laya gaya aur us ne kaha: Main ne apne Rabb ki ibadat mein akela rehne aur logon se alag hone ka irada kiya! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na karo, aur tum se koi aisa na kare — Ise teen martaba kaha — Musalmanon ke kuch morcon mein ek ghadi sabr karna akele chalis saal ki ibadat se behtar hai"
"1308","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Waleed bin Saree se, Amr bin main se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche Fajr padhi to Aap ne {jab suraj tilawat jae} padha, phir jab is aayat par aae: {Aur raat ki jab woh ghalib aur subah ki jab woh saans le} to Main ne apne dil mein kaha: Raat jab ghalib aur subah jab saans le Kya hai?."
"1309","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Qasim bin mukhaimiraa se, Amr bin Shurahbil se, Qais bin Sa'd bin Ubadah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Aashura ka roza rakhte the aur Fitr ki zakat dete the is se pahle ke ham par Ramazan ka roza aur zakat nazil ho; phir jab woh nazil hue to hamen un ka na hukm diya gaya na un se mana kiya gaya, aur ham unhen karte the"
"1310","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Ishaq ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Aswad bin Yazid ko kehte suna: Main ne Ali Ibn Abi Talib aur Abu Musa se wa Aashura ke roze ka hukm dene wala koi nahin dekha"
"1311","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zam'ah bin Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah bin az-Zubair se, Abu Humaid as-Sa'idi se Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur bin Fuzalah ne mujhe khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Abu Humaid as-Sa'idi se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne asda mein se ek aadmi ko kisi kaam par — ya kaha: Sadqe par — bheja, phir jab woh aaya to do maal lekar aaya aur kaha: Yeh tumhara maal hai, aur yeh hadiya hai jo mujhe diya gaya to yeh baat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pahunchee to Aap khateeb kar khade hue, phir kaha: Un logon ka Kya haal hai jinhein ham us mein se bhejte hain jo Allah ne hamen saunpa, phir woh do maal lekar aata hai aur kehta hai: Yeh tumhara maal hai aur yeh hadiya hai jo mujhe diya gaya; Kya woh apne baap ke ghar ya apni walidah ke ghar nahin baitha rehta, dekhta ke use hadiya diya jata hai ya nahin? Us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, is maal mein se koi kuch nahin leta haq magar qayamat ke din aayega use apni gardan par uthae hue; agar oont tha to dakaraataa hua aayega, aur agar gae thi to ranbhaatii hui pahunchegi, aur agar bakri thi to mimiya hui aaegii. phir kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha — apne hath uthae yahan tak ke Main ne Aap baghlon ki safedi dekhi, phir kaha: Aey Allah, Kya Main ne pahunchi diya? Aey Allah, gawah rehna Abu Humaid ne kaha: Meri aankhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se dekha aur mere kaanon ne suna, aur is par gawah Zaid bin Sabit hain, mera ghutanaa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas un ka ghutanaa chhuta tha"
"1312","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sa'id bin Abdul-Aziz ne ham se bayan kiya, Sulaiman bin Musa se, Abu sayyaaraa al-mutaii se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas shehed ki makkhiyaan hain! Farmaya: Ushra ada karo unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, is ka pahaad mere liye mahfooz kar den! To Aap ne use mere liye mahfooz kiya"
"1313","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Uqbah al-Hazrami se, Muhammad bin Zaid bin Qunfuz se, unhon ne kaha: Umair ne mujhe bayan kiya — Aabi al-Lahm ke aazad-karda — aur woh Ghifar ka ek qabeela hai — unhon ne kaha: Main apne sardar ke sath Khaibar mein hazir hua, phir jab fath hui to Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se manga ke mere liye taqseem karen, to Aap ne mere liye taqseem karne se inkar kiya aur mujhe ghar ke ghatiya saaman mein se diya"
"1314","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu al-Ushara se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya zakat sirf seene ke oopri hisse ya halaq mein hoti hai? Farmaya: Agar tum us ki raan mein marte to tumhare liye kafi hota Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ya'ni kuen mein giri hui ke bare mein"
"1315","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Shahr bin Haushab se, Amr bin Kharijah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki untni ki gardan ke neeche tha jabke woh jugaalii ugala rahi thi, aur us ka luaaba mere kandhon ke darmiyan beh raha tha, to Main ne Aap farmate suna: Allah ne har haqdar ko us ka haq diya, aur waris ke liye koi wasiyat jaiz nahin bachcha bistar ka hai aur zani ke liye pathar hai, aur jo apne baap ke siwa kisi ki taraf da'wa kare ya apne maalikon ke siwa kisi ki taraf nisbat kare to us par Allah, farishton aur sab logon ki lanat hai; us se na nafl qabool hoga na farza."
"1316","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim at-Taimi se, Abu Abdullah al-Jadali se, Khuzaimah bin Sabit al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne musafir ke liye teen din masah rakha, aur agar ham zyada mangte to hamen zyada dete"
"1317","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam aur Hammad se, Ibrahim se, Abu Abdullah al-Jadali se, Khuzaimah bin Sabit al-Ansari se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke Aap ne mouzon par masah ke bare mein farmaya: Muqeem ke liye ek din-raat aur musafir ke liye teen din aur un ki raaten."
"1318","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Zaid bin Wahb se, Bara bin Azib se, Sabit bin vadiiaa se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas goh laya gayi to farmaya: Ek ummat thi jis ka masakha hua, aur Allah behtar janta hai"
"1319","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amir bin Sa'd al-Bajali ko kehte suna: Main Sabit bin vadiiaa aur qarazaa bin Ka'b al-Ansari ke sath ek ihsan mein hazir tha, aur Gaana ho raha tha, to Main ne un se is ke bare mein kaha, to unhon ne kaha: Ihsan mein ki aur nauha ke baghair miyyat par rone ki ruksat di gayi hai"
"1320","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Yazid Ibn Abi Ziyad ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Zaid bin Wahb al-Juhani ko Sabit bin vadiiaa se bayan karte suna ke ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas goh lekar aaya aur Aap samne rakha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek ummat thi jis ka masakha hua, aur main nahin janta shayad yeh mein se ho"
"1321","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid ar-rishka se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne muaazaa ko Hisham bin Amir al-Ansari se — Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se — bayan karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman ke liye apne bhai se teen se zyada kataa-hijr halal nahin; donon haq se hue hue hain jab tak apne kataa-hijr par hon, aur jo pahle aae us ka laut mein sabaqata us ke liye kaffara hogi, aur agar Us ne use salam kiya aur Us ne us ka salam qabool na kiya aur us ke salam ka jawab diya to farishte us par karte hain aur doosre par shaitan karta hai; phir agar donon apne kataa-hijr par hon to jannat mein dakhil na honge — ya kaha: Jannat mein kabhi jama na honge"
"1322","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, arfajaa ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Fitne honge aur fitne honge, to jo is ummat ke mamle ko todna chahe jabke woh jama ho, us ki gardan talwar se maro, woh jo bhi ho"
"1323","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas bin Sireen se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdul-Malik bin al-Minhal ko suna, apne walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) chand ki terah-chaudah-pandrah ke rozon ka hukm dete the aur farmate: Woh hamesha ke roze hain"
"1324","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nasr bin Abdur Rahman ko apne dada se bayan karte suna ke Unhon ne Mu'az bin afaraa ke sath Asr ke baad — ya Fajr ke baad — Baitullah ka tawaf kiya aur namaz na padhi, to main ne kaha: Kya tum namaz nahin parhte? To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Asr ke baad suraj doobne tak, aur Fajr ke baad suraj nikalne tak namaz se mana kiya hai"
"1325","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah bin Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Sa'labah se, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid bin Jariyah se, apne chacha Mujammi se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maryam ka beta Dajjal ko ludda ke darwaze par qatl karega"
"1326","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah bin Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, Ibn Abbas se, Abu Talha se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahin hote jis mein kutta ya tasweer ho"
"1327","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, Ibn Abbas se, Sa'b bin Jassamah al-Laisi se, ke Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko shikar ka gosht tohfe mein diya jabke Aap muhrim the, to Aap ne Ise wapas diya, aur Unhon ne Aap chehre par pasandeedgi dekhi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhen lautaanaa hamara maqasuuda nahin, lekin ham muhrim hain"
"1328","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, Sa'b bin Jassamah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ke siwa koi hima nahin"
"1329","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abdur Rahman bin maaza al-aamirii se, Sufyan bin Abdullah as-Saqafi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe kisi aisi baat ki khabar den jise main mazboot se thaamuun! Farmaya: Kaho: Main Allah par iman laya, phir seedha rehna unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujh par sab zyada kis cheez ka dar hai? Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne apne hath se apni zaban ki taraf ishara kiya"
"1330","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Usamah bin Shareek ko kehte suna: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap sahaba aise the goya un ke siron par parinde hon, aur dehati Aap paas chaaron taraf se aae aur Aap se aisi cheezon ke bare mein poocha mein koi harj nahin, to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya ham par falan mein tangi hai, Kya ham par falan mein tangi hai! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah ke bando, Allah ne tangi rakh di — ya kaha: Allah ne tangi utha di — siwae us aadmi ke jo kisi aadmi ki izzat zulm se luute; Wahy gunahgar aur halaak hone wala hai aur Unhon ne Aap se dawa ke bare mein poocha to farmaya: Aey Allah ke bando, ilaaj karo; kyunke Allah Azza-wa Jall ne koi beemari nahin rakhi magar us ki dawa rakhi, siwae ek beemari ke: Budhapa Usamah boodhe ho chuke the, to unhon ne kaha: Kya mere liye koi dawa dekhte ho?."
"1331","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, Usamah bin Shareek se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya: Logon ko di gayi sab behtar cheez Kya hai? Farmaya: Achcha akhlaq"
"1332","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khubaib bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Mas'ud bin niyaara ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Sahl Ibn Abi Hasmah hamari majlis mein aae aur bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum fasala ka andaza lagao to tihai chhod do, aur agar tihai na chhodo to chauthai chhod do"
"1333","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Isra'il al-jushamii ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne hai ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jabke ek aadmi Aap khwab suna raha tha, to Aap ne ek mote aadmi ko dekha aur apne hath ki kisi cheez se us ka pet godne lage aur farmate: Agar is mein se kuch kahin aur hota to tumhare liye behtar hota"
"1334","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Isra'il se, hai se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas hazir tha jabke ek aadmi laya gaya, to kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Is ne Aap qatl karne ka irada kiya tha! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Tum dare nahin, tum dare nahin; agar Tum ne is ka irada kiya hota to Allah tumhen mere qatl par qadir na karta"
"1335","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Naufal bin Mu'awiyah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo namaz chhore goya us ke ghar aur maal chheen liye gaye"
"1336","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ma'bad bin Khalid se, Harisah bin Wahb se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Kya main tumhen jannat walon ki khabar na dun? Har kamzor dabaa hua Jis ne Allah par qasam khayi to Allah use poora kare aur kaha: Aag wale har sakht badakhalaaqa takabbur karne wale hain"
"1337","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ma'bad bin Khalid se, Harisah bin Wahb ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Sadqa karo, kyunke qareeb hai aadmi apna Sadqa lekar chale aur woh jise woh jane kahe: Agar kal hamare paas bhejte to qabool karta; ab to mujhe is mein koi hajat nahin! To woh koi na paega jo Ise qabool kare"
"1338","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Harisah bin Wahb al-hain ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen Mina mein do rak'aten padhain jabke ham sab zyada aur sab aman mein the"
"1339","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhri ko suna, Mahmud bin ar-Rabi se, itbaana bin Malik as-saalimii se, unhon ne kaha: Main apni qaum gai Salim ki imamat karta tha, aur jab sailab aate to mere liye apne aur masjid ke darmiyan ki wadi arz karna mushkil hota, to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere liye Ise arz karna mushkil hai; agar Aap qasam samjhen to mere paas aayenge aur mere ghar mein namaz padhe, ek jagah jise main namaz ki jagah banaun! Farmaya: Karunga to agle din mere paas aae, to Main ne unhen khazeerah par roka; jab dakhil hue to baithe nahin yahan tak ke kaha: Tum apne ghar mein kahan pasand karte ho ke main namaz padhuun? To Main ne us jagah ki taraf ishara kiya jahan main namaz padhta tha, to Aap ne do rak'aten padhin phir Ansar ke kuch aadmiyon ne suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere ghar mein hain, to woh aane lage yahan tak ke bahut ho gaye to gharwalon mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Malik bin Woh-dukhashuma ne Kya kiya? To gharwalon mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Woh munafiq hai jo Allah-Rasulullah se muhabbat nahin rakhta! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya woh La ilaha illallah nahin kehta? Unhon ne kaha: Allah-Rasulullah behtar jante hain; ham to us ki koi muhabbat ya baat Munafiqon ki taraf ke siwa nahin dekhte! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne aag ko haram kiya us par jo La ilaha illallah kahe, is se Allah ka chehra chahte hue Mahmud ne kaha: To Main ne yeh hadees ek majlis mein bayan ki jis mein Room ki zameen mein Yazid bin Mu'awiyah ke ghazwa mein Abu Ayyub al-Ansari the, to Abu Ayyub ne mujh par is ka inkar kiya aur kaha: Main nahin samajhta Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh kabhi kaha ho Mahmud ne kaha: To Main ne qasam khayi ke agar Allah mujhe durust-Salim kare to main itbaana bin Malik se is hadees ke bare mein un ki qaum ki masjid mein piye agar woh zinda hue to Main ne iiliyaa se umrah ka ehram bandha, phir Madinah aaya aur itbaana ko ek boodhe nabina shaikh paya jo apni qaum ki imamat karte the to Main ne unhen apna nasab khabar aur Unhon ne mujhe pahchana — ya kaha: Main ne un se is hadees ke bare mein poocha, unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne mujhe isi hi bayan kiya jaise pehli martaba bayan kiya tha Zuhri ne kaha: Aur ham samajhte hain ke yeh farz karne wale zyada nazil hone se pahle tha, kyunke ek muamla nazil hua; Ham ne ulama ko paya aur woh aisa samajhte the; tum se jo dhoka na kha sake woh dhoka na khae; hamen dar hai muamla usi par aa gaya ho; Allah Azza-wa Jall ne is kalimat walon par mamle farz kiye hain, hamen dar hai muamla usi par aa gaya ho"
"1340","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Mahmud bin ar-Rabi se, ke unhen yaad hai ek kulli jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke ghar mein thuukii thi"
"1341","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Hasan se, Amrah bin Qatadah se, Salamah bin al-Muhabbiq al-Huzali se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chamde ki dabaghat us ki zakat hai"
"1342","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu al-faiza se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Murrah ko Abu Sa'd az-Zurqi se bayan karte suna ke Ashja' mein se ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se azl ke bare mein poocha, farmaya: Jo raham mein muqaddar hoga Wahy hoga"
"1343","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, ayazaara bin main se, Urwah bin al-Ja'd se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein qayamat ke din tak bhalai hui hai"
"1344","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ya'la bin Ata ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Umarah bin hadiida ko Sakhr al-ghaamidii se bayan karte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah, meri ummat ke liye us ki subah mein barkat de unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab koi dasta bhejte to din ke shuru mein bhejte the aur Sakhr ek tajir aadmi the, apne bachchon ko din ke shuru mein bhejte the, to un ka maal farma yahan tak ke unhen na ma'loom hota tha kahan rakhen"
"1345","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Yazid bin al-Aswad as-suvaaii ko apne walid se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen Mina mein Masjid-khaifa mein Fajr ki namaz padhai, phir jab apni namaz se farigh hue to masjid ke pichhle hisse mein do aadmi the jinhon logon ke sath namaz na padhi thi, to donon ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya jabke un ke pahlu kaanp rahe the to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhen hamare sath namaz padhne se Kya roka? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Ham ne apne deron mein namaz padhi thi! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na karo; jab tum apne deron mein namaz padho phir imam ke paas aao jabke woh namaz padh raha ho to us ke sath namaz padho, kyunke woh tumhare liye nafl ya tatoa hai"
"1346","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Yazid bin al-Aswad ko apne walid se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap Masjid-khaifa mein the, to Main ne Aapka hath pakda aur woh mushk ki khushbu se zyada khushbudar aur barf se zyada thandak tha"
"1347","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah aur Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, donon ne Sa'id al-Jurairi se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq al-Uqaili se, Abdullah bin hawala al-Azdi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap ek bade pera ke sae mein the aur ek katib Aap likhavaa raha tha, to farmaya: Aey bin hawala, Kya main tumhen na likhuun? Main ne kaha: Jo Allah aur us ke Rasulullah mere liye pasand karen! Woh likhavaate rahe aur likhavaate rahe, unhon ne kaha: Aur Main ne dekha to Abu Bakr aur Umar ke naam the, to main samjha ke woh bhalai ke siwa na likha jayenge unhon ne kaha: Mujh se kaha: Aey bin hawala: Kya main tumhen na likhuun? Main ne kaha: Ji Haan, Ya Rasulullah! Phir kaha: Aey bin hawala, tumhara Kya haal hoga jab fitna uthega jis mein baitha khade se behtar hai aur khada chalne wale se behtar hai aur chalne wala daurane wale se behtar hai? Main ne kaha: Jo Allah aur us ke Rasulullah mere liye pasand karen phir kaha: Aey bin hawala, tumhara Kya haal hoga jab doosra uthega, jis se pahle wala khargosh ki chheenk jaisa hoga goya woh gae ke seeng hon? Main ne kaha: Jo Allah aur us ke Rasulullah mere liye pasand karen unhon ne kaha: Aur ek munh dhaanpe aadmi guzra, to farmaya: Yeh aur us ke sathi us din haq par hain! To main us ke paas gaya aur us ka kandhaa pakda aur us ka chehra Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf phera aur kaha: Yeh, Ya Rasulullah? Farmaya: Yaha. to woh Usman bin Affan the"
"1348","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah aur Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Jurairi se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se, Abdullah bin hawala se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek din farmaya: Tum ek aadmi par jao jo Burdah samete jannat walon mein se logon se bai'at le raha hoga unhon ne kaha: To ham Usman bin Affan par aae, Burdah samete logon se bai'at le rahe the"
"1349","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ghassaana bin burziina ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sayyar bin salaamaa ar-riyaahii ne ham se bayan kiya — gai Tameem mein se — Bara as-saliitii se, gai Abs mein se, nuqaadaa al-Asadi se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen ek aadmi ke paas bheja ke us ki untni par sawari mangne, to Us ne inkar kiya to woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur Aap khabar di, to Aap ne unhen doosre aadmi ke paas bheja ke us se sawari mangne, to Us ne use ek untni bheji to nuqaadaa use lekar aae, aur jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ise dekha to farmaya: Allah is mein aur Jis ne Ise bheja us mein barkat de nuqaadaa ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aur jo Ise laya us mein? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur jo Ise laya usamen. unhon ne kaha: To Ise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne kiya gaya aur dohaa gaya aur bahut doodh diya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah, falan ka maal aur aulaad farma — pehla inkar karne wala — aur untni wale se kaha: Aey Allah, falan ki rizq din-ba-din karo"
"1350","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim al-Raziyallahu se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu haajiba ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi se bayan karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aurat ke wuzu ke bache pani se wuzu karne se mana kiya Abu Dawud ne hamen aise hi bayan kiya aur abdussamada bin Abdul-waris ne kaha: Shu'bah se, Asim se, Abu haajiba se, Hakam bin Amr se"
"1351","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Nasr bin Asim se, Malik bin al-Huwairis se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne hath uthate the jab namaz shuru karte aur jab ruku karte aur jab ruku se sar uthate"
"1352","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far bin Amr bin Umayyah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mouzon par masah karte dekha"
"1353","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far bin Amr bin Umayyah az-Zamri ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bakri ke shaane se gosht katwae dekha, phir namaz padhi aur wuzu na kiya"
"1354","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad bin Ilaqah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne qutbaa bin Malik ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche Fajr padhi to Aap ne Qaf padhi, padha: {Aur lambi khajur}. Mas'udi ne apni hadees mein kaha: Jab Unhon ne {aur lambi khajur} padha to Main ne apne dil mein kaha: Un ki tool Kya hai?."
"1355","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ash'as Ibn Abi ash-riwayat se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aswad bin Hilal ko gai Sa'labah bin Yarbu mein se ek aadmi se bayan karte suna ke mein se kuch log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae — aur gai Sa'labah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi ko mara tha — to ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yeh gai Sa'labah bin Yarbu ne falan ko qatl kiya! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi jaan doosri par zulm nahin karti aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sadqe ka zikr kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dene wale ka hath upar hai; apni walidah aur apne baap, aur apni bahan aur apne bhai, phir jo qareeb to qareeb Shu'bah ne aise hi kaha: Gai Sa'labah mein se ek aadmi se; aur Sauri ne kaha: Sa'labah bin zahadama se"
"1356","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-ashahaba ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Tarafah se, apne dada arfajaa bin asaada se, ke Jahiliyat mein kulaaba ke din un ki naak zakhmi hui thi, to Unhon ne chandi ki naak banai lekin woh un par badbudar hui, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen sone ki naak banane ka hukm diya"
"1357","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran al-Qattan ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu mijlaza se, Jundub bin Abdullah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aadmi jhande tale mara jae, giroh ki madad karte hue aur giroh ke liye gussa karte hue, to us ka qatl Jahiliyat ka hai"
"1358","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir ko Hakim bin Qais bin Asim se bayan karte suna ke un ke walid ne wasiyat ki aur kaha: Jab main chahun to mujh par nauha na karna, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nauha nahin kiya gaya"
"1359","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hafsah bint Sireen ko rabaaba se, Salman bin Amir se bayan karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek roza rakhe to khajoor par iftar kare, aur agar na pae to pani par kyunke woh pak karne wala hai"
"1360","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran al-Qattan ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Nasr bin Asim al-Laisi se, Mu'awiyah al-Laisi se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log subah qahat mein karenge, phir Allah un ke paas apni taraf se rizq pahunchayega, phir woh subah mushrik karenge aur kahenge: Hamen falan-falan naksatra se baarish di gayi"
"1361","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin al-Munkadir ne mujh se kaha: tumhara naam Kya hai? Main ne kaha: Shuabaa. unhon ne kaha: Abu Shu'bah ne mujhe bayan kiya — aur woh Narmi the — Suwaid bin Muqarrin se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne apne ladke ko — ya kisi insan ko — thappad mara, to Suwaid ne kaha: Kya tum nahin jante the ke chehra haram hai? Main ne nafs ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein saat bhaiyon mein saatavaan dekha, hamare paas ek ke siwa koi khadim na tha, to mein se ek ne use thappad mara, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use aazad karne ka hukm diya"
"1362","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hamzah se, Main ne Hilal al-Mazini ko kehte suna: Main ne Suwaid bin Muqarrin ko kehte suna: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek ghada lekar aaya jis mein nabeez banai gayi thi, to Main ne Aap se is ke bare mein poocha aur Aap ne mujhe mana kiya, to Main ne ghada tod diya"
"1363","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, ek aadmi se, Hanzhalah al-Ansari se, ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko salam kiya lekin Aap ne jawab na diya yahan tak ke mitti se ponchha aur farmaya: Mujhe tumhen jawab dene se sirf Is ne roka ke main baavuzuu na tha — ya kaha: Unhon ne jawab na diya yahan tak ke mitti se ponchha phir jawab diya"
"1364","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khubaib bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hafs bin Asim ko Abu Sa'id bin al-muallaa se bayan karte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid mein the jabke main namaz padh raha tha, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne mujhe bulaya, unhon ne kaha: To Main ne namaz padhi phir aaya, to farmaya: Tumhen jawab dene se Kya roka jab Main ne tumhen bulaya? Kya Tum ne Allah Tabaraka-wa Ta'ala ko farmate nahin suna: {Aey iman walon, Allah aur Rasulullah ko jawab do jab woh tumhen us cheez ki taraf bulaye jo tumhen zinda kare}? Main tumhen masjid se nikalne se pahle Quran ki sab bade surat zaroor sikhaauungaa. unhon ne kaha: To main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath chala yahan tak ke ham masjid ke darwaze ke qareeb pahunche, to main ne kaha: Bhool gae! To Main ne yaad dilaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne mujh se aisa-aisa kaha tha! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: {Sab tareef Allah ke liye jo jahanon ka Rabb hai} — saat dohrai jane wali aur bada Quran jo mujhe diya gaya"
"1365","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safwan bin Amr as-Saksaki ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu al-Musanna al-Mulaiki se, Utbah bin Abd as-Sulami se — aur un ki sohbat thi — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maqtool teen hain: Ek mo'min aadmi jo apne nafs aur maal lekar nikla aur dushman se mila aur ladai yahan tak ke mara gaya, to woh Allah ke kheme mein us ke Arsh ke neeche aazmaya hua hai, jise ambiya ke siwa koi fazeelat nahin rakhta siwae nubuwwat ke darje ke; aur ek mo'min aadmi Jis ne apne nafs par gunahon-khaton ka bojh dala, dushman se mila aur ladai yahan tak ke mara gaya, to woh dhone wali hai Jis ne us ke gunah-khatayen mita din; talwar khaton ko mitaane wali hai, aur us se kaha jaega: Jannat ke aath darwazon mein se jis se chaho dakhil ho, kyunke woh aath darwaze hain, aur jahannam ke saat darwaze hain, kuch kuch se behtar; aur ek munafiq aadmi jo apne nafs aur maal lekar nikla aur ladai yahan tak ke mara gaya, to woh aag mein hai; talwar nifaq ko nahin mitaatii."
"1366","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Mujahid se, Hakam ya Abu al-Hakam se — Saqeef mein se ek aadmi — apne walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya aur apni sharmgah par chhidka lagaye"
"1367","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Husain se, unhon ne kaha: Umarah bin ruvaibaa ne — aur un ki sohbat thi — Bishr bin Marwan ko dua mein hath uthate dekha — ya'ni Jume ke din Shu'bah ne kaha: To Unhon ne use bura di ya us ki burayi ki; aur Zaidah ne kaha: Allah in donon hathon ko bura kare; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is se zyada na karte the aur Abu Dawud ne shahadat ki ungli se ishara kiya"
"1368","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, Amr bin ash-Shuraid as-Saqafi se, apne walid se, ke ek Juzami Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas bai'at ke liye aaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us se kaho wapas jae kyunke Main ne us se bai'at kar li hai"
"1369","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Ya'la at-taaifii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur Amr bin ash-Shuraid ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se Umayyah Ibn Abi as-Salt ke sheir ke sau qaafiye sunaane ko kaha; jab bhi main Aap ek qaafiyaa sunaataa to farmate: Aur karo phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qareeb tha ke woh apne sheir mein Musalman ho jata"
"1370","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin ash-Shuraid se, apne walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi apne sehan ka zyada haqdar hai unhon ne kaha: To Main ne Amr se kaha: Us ka sehan Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Us ka shufaaa."
"1371","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, khilaasa se, Abdullah bin Utbah se, unhon ne kaha: bin Mas'ud se ek aurat ke bare mein poocha gaya jis ka shauhar us se humbistari kiye aur us ke liye meher muqarrar kiye baghair mar gaya, to Unhon ne is ke bare mein kuch kehne se inkar kiya, phir mahine baad un se is ke bare mein poocha gaya to kaha: Main is mein kehta hun: Aey Allah, agar durust ho to Teri taraf se aur agar ghalat ho to meri taraf se; use us ki aurton mein se ek ka meher liye, use virasat milogi aur us par iddat hai to Ashja' mein se ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mein baravaa bint Washiq ke bare mein aisa hi faisla kiya to kaha: Is par do gawah lao! To Abu Sinan aur Jarrah ne gawahi di; Ashja' mein se do aadmi"
"1372","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne mujhe likha, aur Main ne unhen kar sunaya, aur mujh se kaha: jab main tumhen likhuun to Main ne tumhen bayan kiya to kaha: Main ne Hilal bin Yasaf ko suna, Salamah bin Qais al-Ashja'i se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Jab wuzu karo to naak jhaaro, aur jab kankriyon se paki karo to taaq karo"
"1373","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah, Warqa, Sallam aur Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, sab ne Mansoor se, Rib'i bin Hirash se, Tariq se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jab tum namaz mein ho to apne chehre ki taraf na thuuko aur na apne daayen, lekin apne baayen thuuko agar khali ho, warna apne qadam ke niice. aur Qais ne kaha: Baaeen taraf"
"1374","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid bin Hilal se, Khalid bin Umair se, unhon ne kaha: Utbah bin ghazavaana ne hamen khutba diya aur apne khutbe mein kaha: Khabardar, Main ne nafs ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath saat mein saatavaan dekha, hamare paas qareeb mahine tak pera ke patton ke siwa koi khana na tha yahan tak ke un se hamare munh ke kinare zakhmi ho gaye"
"1375","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah as-suvaaii ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete suna jabke Aap farma rahe the: Qayamat se pahle kazzab honge phir ek baat kahi jo main na samjha, to Main ne apne walid se kaha: Unhon ne Kya kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Un se hoshiyaara Hazrat"
"1376","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete suna jabke Aap farma rahe the: Khabardar, Islam barah khalifa tak Aziz jata phir ek baat kahi jo main na samjha, to Main ne apne walid se kaha: Unhon ne Kya kaha? To unhon ne kaha: Sab Quraish mein se hain"
"1377","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Khumair se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Busr as-Sulami ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas aae to meri walida ne Aap liye qatiifaa bichaaii aur Aap us par baithe, phir Aap paas khajoor din aur Aap khane lage aur guthli se aise kehte — aur Abu Dawud ne apni do ungliyan moriin, shahadat wali aur darmiyan wali — jaise guthli ko ungli ke upar se kankariyon hain phir mashroob mangwaya aur piya phir apne daayen wale ko pilaya to meri walida ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah se hamare liye dua karen! To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah, unhen us mein barkat de jo Tu ne unhen rizq di, aur unhen muaf kar aur un par raham karo"
"1378","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Muslim se, Tariq bin Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, aur Abu Bakr ki khilafat mein daston aur ghair mein ghazwa kiye"
"1379","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mukhariq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Tariq bin Shihab ko kehte suna: Bajilah ka wafd Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya to farmaya: Ahamasiyon se shuru karo aur hamare liye dua ki"
"1380","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi as-safar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ash-Sha'bi ko Urwah bin Mudarris bin Aws bin Lam se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jama mein aaya aur kaha: Kya mere liye Hajj hai? To farmaya: Jo hamare sath yeh namaz padhe aur hamare sath is mauqifa mein thehre yahan tak ke aae — is se pahle Arafat se raat ya din mein wapas ho — us ka Hajj poora hua aur Us ne apna tafasa poora kiya"
"1381","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se Ibn Abi al-jadaaa ek ek aadmi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Meri ummat mein se ek aadmi ki shafa'at se gai Tameem se zyada log jannat mein dakhil honge"
"1382","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair se, atiyah al-Qurazi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Quraizah ke qaidiyon mein tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke Jis ne baal ugaye hon use qatl kiya jae; main mein tha jin ke baal na uge the, to chhod diya gaya"
"1383","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Aban ne ham se bayan kiya, suddii se, Rifa'ah bin Shaddad se, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin al-hamiqa ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab ek aadmi doosre aadmi ko us ke nafs ki amaana de phir use qatl kare to main qatil se bari hun, chahe maqtool kafir ho"
"1384","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair se, Rifa'ah bin Shaddad se, unhon ne kaha: Main mukhtaara — ya'ni kazzab — ka sab qareeb tha, unhon ne kaha: Ek din main us ke paas dakhil hua to us ne kaha: Tum dakhil hue jabke Jibreel abhi is kursi se uthe hain unhon ne kaha: To Main ne apni talwar ki muutha ki taraf hath badhaya aur kaha: Main mard intezar kar raha hun ke is ke sar aur mukammal ke darmiyan caluun, yahan tak ke mujhe ek hadees yaad aai jo Amr bin al-hamiqa ne mujhe bayan ki thi ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab ek aadmi doosre aadmi ko us ke khoon ki amaana de phir use qatl kare to qayamat ke din us ke liye ghadra ka jhanda uthaya jayega to main us se ruk gaya"
"1385","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan bin Imran se, bin Abdur Rahman bin Abza se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche namaz padhi, aur Aap takbir poori na karte the"
"1386","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wasallam bin Shaddad ne mujhe khabar di, Abdullah bin Yasar se, unhon ne kaha: Main Sulaiman bin Surad aur Khalid bin urfutaa ke paas baitha tha aur Unhon ne ek aadmi ka zikr kiya jo pet mein mara tha aur us ke janaze mein hazir hona chahte the, to ek ne doosre se kaha: Kya Unhon ne nahin kaha — ya Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate nahin suna: Jise us ka pet maare use qabr mein azab na hoga? To doosre ne kaha: Ji Han"
"1387","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sulaiman bin Surad ko suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahzab ke din farmaya: Ab ham un par hamla karenge aur woh ham par hamla na karenge"
"1388","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah bin az-Zubair se, kurza bin Alqamah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya Islam ki koi muddat ya muntahaa hai jis par woh pahunche? Farmaya: Haan; Allah ki qasam, Arab-ajama ka koi ghar nahin jis ka Allah hidayat chahe magar un par Islam dakhil kare unhon ne kaha: Phir Kya? Farmaya: Phir fitne parenge goya andhere hon to us aadmi ne kaha: Hargiz nahin, inshaaallaaha. to farmaya: Haan; us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, tum siyahi saanp kar lautoge, ek-doosre ki gardenen marte hue"
"1389","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham Woh-dastuvaaii ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Hilal Ibn Abi Maimunah se, Ata bin Yasar se, Rifa'ah bin arraabaa al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the yahan tak ke jab ham Kadeed mein the — ya kaha: Qudaid mein — to mein se kuch aadmi apne gharwalon ke paas jane ki ijazat mangne lage aur Aap ne unhen ijazat di; phir Allah ki tareef ki aur chahiye baat kahi, phir kaha: Us pera ke us hisse ka Kya haal hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qareeb hai, woh tumhen doosre hisse se zyada napasand kyun hai? To us waqt qaum mein se rone wale ke siwa koi na dekha gaya to ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, is ke baad jo Aap se ijazat mange woh bewaqoof hai unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne Allah ki tareef ki aur chahiye baat kahi, aur kaha: Main Allah ke samne gawahi deta hun ke koi banda nahin marta jo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasulullah hain, apne dil se sach ke sath, phir seedha rahe, magar jannat mein le kiya jayega aur kaha: Mere Rabb ne mujh se wa'da kiya hai ke meri ummat mein se sattar hazaar ko jannat mein dakhil karega jin par na hisab hoga na azab, aur mujhe ummeed hai ke woh is mein dakhil na honge yahan tak ke tum aur tumhari biwiyon-aulaad mein se nek log jannat mein ghar bana lo"
"1390","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Hilal Ibn Abi Maimunah se, Ata bin Yasar se, Rifa'ah al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab raat ka tihai — ya kaha: Do tihai — guzar jae to Allah Azza-wa Jall duniya ke aasman par nazil hota hai aur farmata hai: Main apne bandon ke bare mein apne siwa kisi se nahin poochta; kaun hai jo mujh se bakhshish mange ke main use muaf karun? Kaun hai jo mujhe pukare ke main use jawab dun? Kaun hai jo mujh se mange ke main use dun? Yahan tak ke Fajr nikle"
"1391","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Laila se, Abdullah bin ukaima se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka khat hamen kar sunaya gaya jabke ham Juhainah ki zameen mein the: Murdaara se kisi cheez se nafa na uthao, na khaal se na patthe se"
"1392","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musanna bin Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Yazid bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, Abu Muslim al-jazamii se, Jarud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ki gumshuda cheez aag ka iindhana hai"
"1393","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se, Raja se, Mihjan se, unhon ne kaha: Mihjan ne mera hath pakda yahan tak ke ham Basrah ki masjid pahunche, to Buraidah al-Aslami masjid ke darwazon mein se ek darwaze par baithe the, aur masjid mein sukbaa ek ek aadmi lambi namaz padh raha tha unhon ne kaha: Aur Buraidah mein mazaq tha Buraidah ne kaha: Aey Mihjan, Kya tum sukbaa jaisi namaz nahin parhte? To Mihjan ne unhen kuch jawab na diya, aur Mihjan ne mujh se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mera hath pakda yahan tak ke ham Uhud par chadhe aur Madinah par nazar dali aur farmaya: Is basti par afsos, is ke rehne wale Ise sab aabad haal mein karenge; Dajjal aayega aur is ke har darwaze par ke talwar wala farishta paega, to is mein dakhil na hoga"
"1394","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se, Raja se, Mihjan se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mera hath pakda yahan tak ke ham masjid ke sehan pahunche, to ek aadmi ruku-sajdah, ruku-sajdah kar raha tha, to Aap ne mujh se kaha: yeh kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Yeh falan hai, aur main us ki tareef karne laga aur kehne laga: Yeh yeh! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Use na sunaao ke use halaak kar do phir mujhe lekar chale yahan tak ke ek hujre ke darwaze pahunche, phir apna hath mere hath se chhudaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare deen mein sab behtar us ka aasan tariina hai — Ise teen martaba kaha"
"1395","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu shimra ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aaiz bin Amr al-Muzani ko — Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi — kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumbe, lakdi, naqeer aur roghan lage bartan se mana kiya unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se? To unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se"
"1396","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ismail Ibn Abi Khalid se, Qais Ibn Abi Hazim se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba de rahe the, to mere walid ko dhoop mein dekha aur unhen hukm diya — ya un ki taraf ishara kiya — ke sae ke qareeb Donon"
"1397","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, Nafi' bin Jubair bin Mut'im ko suna, Bishr bin suhaima se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke Mina mein elan karen: Jannat mein sirf Musalman jaan dakhil hogi, aur yeh khane-peene ke din hain"
"1398","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair bin Muhammad at-Tamimi ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Sa'id al-Ansari se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim al-Qurashi se, ke Abu hadarada ne nikah mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se madad mangi, to farmaya: Kitna meher diya? Unhon ne kaha: Do sau dirham farmaya: Agar tum buthaana se raha to zyada na karte"
"1399","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, us se Jis ne Urwah bin az-Zubair ko Hajjaj bin al-Hajjaj al-Aslami se bayan karte suna, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, razat ki malamat mujh se Kya door kare? Farmaya: Ghurran; ghulam ya baandii."
"1400","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin as-Sa'ib se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se koi apne sathi ka saaman na le, na mazaq mein na sanjeedgi mein; aur jab tum se ek apne sathi ki lathi le to use wapas de Abu Bishr ne kaha: Meri Kitab mein Abu Dawud se aise hi hai, jabke log kehte hain: Ibn Abi Zi'b se, Abdullah bin as-Sa'ib se, apne walid se, apne dada se"
"1401","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Ahwas ko kehte suna: Mere walid Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae — aur kabhi kaha: Apne walid se ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae — to Aap ne unhen mein-kucaile haal mein dekha aur farmaya: Kya tumhare paas maal hai? Main ne kaha: Ji Han farmaya: Kis maal mein se? Main ne kaha: Har maal mein se; oonton, ghulamon, ghodon aur bakriyon mein se farmaya: Jab Allah tumhen maal de to us ka asar tum par nazar aaye phir kaha: Kya tumhare gharwalon ki untniyan durust kaanon wali paida hoti hain, phir tum chhuri lekar un ke kaan katwae ho aur kehte ho yeh bahiiraa hai, aur unhen ciirate ho ya un ki khalen ciirate ho aur kehte ho yeh sarama hai, aur unhen apne aur apne gharwalon par haram karte ho? To sara maal jo Allah ne tumhen diya tumhare liye halal hai Shu'bah ne kaha: Ise kabhi kehte hain, aur kabhi nahin kehte: Aur Allah ki chhuri tumhari chhuri se tez hai, aur Allah ka bazu tumhare bazuon se mazboot hai — aur kabhi kaha: Aur Allah ki chhuri tez hai, aur Allah ka bazu mazboot hai"
"1402","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu al-Ahwas se, apne walid se, ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ek aadmi — main us ke paas tarah lekin Us ne meri izzat na ki, na jinhon ki, na mujhe khilaya; phir woh mere paas tarah; Kya main badla lun ya use khilata? Farmaya: Lekin use khilaao."
"1403","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaid bin al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Ma'qil ko Abdullah bin Busr se, Muzainah az-zaahiraa ke logon se bayan karte suna ke abjara — ya bin abjara — ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere maal mein se mere gadhon ke siwa kuch na bacha! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne gharwalon ko apne mote maal se khilao, kyunke Main ne un ke liye basti ke aavaaraa janwar napasand kiye"
"1404","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mu'az ne ham se bayan kiya, Imran bin Muslim se, Yazid bin Murrah se, Salamah bin Yazid al-Ju'fi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur kaha: Meri walida mar gayin, aur woh mehmaan ki izzat karti thin, padosi-yateem ko khilatin thin, aur Jahiliyat mein zinda dafanaatii thin, aur mere paas maal ki kushadgi hai; Kya unhen nafa dega ke main un ki taraf se Sadqa karun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam sirf use nafa deta hai jo use pae; woh aur jo Us ne dafan aag mein hain unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne dekha ke yeh mujh par bhaari guzra, to farmaya: Aur Muhammad ki walida us ke sath hain; donon mein koi bhalai nahin"
"1405","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, Yazid bin Murrah se, Salamah bin Yazid al-Ju'fi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Allah Tabaraka-wa Ta'ala ke qaul ke bare mein farmate suna: {Beshak Ham ne unhen naya paida kiya, to unhen kunwari banaya, muhabbat karne wali, jawan}: Byaahii aur ghair-byaahii mein se"
"1406","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, nahhaaza bin judaiya al-Ju'fi se, Sinan bin Salamah se, ke Unhon ne unhen apne walid se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the, to Aap ne handiyon ka hukm diya aur woh ulat di gayin, aur mein paaltu gadhon ke gosht the"
"1407","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Bukair bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Ya'mur ko kehte suna: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas hazir tha, farma rahe the: Hajj Arafah hai; Hajj Arafat hai; jo Fajr nikalne se pahle Arafah pae Us ne Hajj paya ya us ka Hajj poora hua"
"1408","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Bukair bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Ya'mur ko kehte suna: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas hazir tha, farma rahe the: Mina ke din teen din hain; jo do din mein jaldi kare us par koi gunah nahin, aur jo der kare us par koi gunah nahin"
"1409","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Bishr bin Hazn an-nasarii se, unhon ne kaha: Oonton aur bakriyon walon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne fakhr kiya, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dawud bheje gae jabke woh bakriyon ke charwahe the; aur Musa bheje gae jabke woh bakriyon ke charwahe the; aur main bheja gaya jabke main jiyaada mein apne gharwalon ki bakriyan charata tha"
"1410","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, Hakim Ibn Abi Yazid se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon ko chhodo ke ek-doosre se nafa nahin; phir jab tum se ek apne bhai se mashwara kare to use sachchi nasihat kare"
"1411","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Naufal Ibn Abi akraba se, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se roze ke bare mein poocha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mahine mein ek din roza rakho unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe farma den, mujhe farma den! Farmaya: Mahine mein ek din roza rakho unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe farma den, mujhe farma den! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mahine mein ek din roza rakho unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujh mein taqat hai to mujhe farma den! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mahine mein do din roza rakho unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujh mein taqat hai to mujhe farma den! Yahan tak ke Main ne samjha ke woh unhen na barhaaenge, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mahine mein teen din roza rakho"
"1412","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin al-Fazl al-Hashimi ne ham se bayan kiya, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Ubaidullah bin Adi bin al-Khiyar se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Room se aae, phir jab ham himsa ke qareeb hue to ham ne kaha: Kaash ham vahashii ke paas se guzren aur us se Hamzah ke qatl ke bare mein poochhein to hamen ek aadmi mila aur Ham ne is ka zikr us se kiya, to us ne kaha: Woh aisa aadmi hai jis par sharab ghalib hai; agar tum use hosh mein pao to us se kisi cheez ke bare mein na poochhoge magar woh tumhen bataaegaa, aur agar tum use peete hue pao to us se na poocho to ham chale yahan tak ke us ke paas pahunche, us ke darwaze par us ke liye kuch bichaayaa gaya tha aur woh hosh mein baitha tha to us ne kaha: bin al-Khiyar? Main ne kaha: Ji Haan; Main ne tumhen waqt se nahin dekha jab tumhari walida tumhen Zu-Tuwa mein mere paas din, jab Unhon ne tumhen rakha aur Main ne tumhare pair dekhe aur unhen pahacaanaa. unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ham tumhare paas Hamzah ke qatl ke bare mein poochne aae hain! To us ne kaha: Main tumhen isi hi bayan karunga jaise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bayan kiya tha jab Aap ne mujh se poocha tha main Aal-Mut'im ka ghulam tha, to Mut'im ke bhai ke bete ne mujh se kaha: agar Tum ne mere chacha ke badle Hamzah ko qatl kiya to tum aazad ho! To main Uhud ke din apni bhala lekar chala, aur main Habsha ka aadmi hun jo use un ke khel ki tarah khelta hai us din main nikla, kisi ko qatl karne ya ladne ka irada na tha siwae Hamzah ke to main nikla aur Hamzah ko dekha goya surkh oont ho; koi us ke samne na karta tha magar woh use talwar se dabaa deta tha, to main us se daraa. aur sibaaa ki aulaad mein se ek aadmi us ki taraf farma, to Main ne Hamzah ko kehte suna: Meri taraf aa, Aey bazuura katne wali ke bete! To Us ne us par hamla kiya aur use qatl kiya aur main us se bachta raha, ek pera ki parda li aur mere paas mera bhala tha, yahan tak ke jab main us par qaboo paya to bhala harkat yahan tak ke us se razi hua, phir phenka aur woh us ke donon thanon ke darmiyan laga; woh chadhne laga lekin na Utho saka, to Main ne use qatl kiya, phir apna bhala liya Main ne kisi aur ko na qatl kiya na laraa. jab main us ke paas aaya to aazad hua jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae to Main ne un se bhaagakara Sham jane ka irada kiya, to ek aadmi mere paas aaya aur kaha: Afsos tum par, Aey vahashii; Allah ki qasam, koi Muhammad ke paas nahin aata aur haq ki gawahi deta magar woh use chhod deta hai! To main chala, aur unhen meri khabar na hui siwae is ke ke main un ke sar par khada haq ki gawahi de raha tha to farmaya: Kya vahashii? Main ne kaha: Ji Haan, vahashii. farmaya: Afsos tum par, mujhe Hamzah ke qatl ke bare mein bayan karo to Main ne unhen bayan karna shuru kiya jaisa tumhen bayan kiya tha to farmaya: Afsos tum par, Aey vahashii, apna chehra mujh se chhupa ke main tumhen na dekhuun. to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke dekhne se bachta tha aur Allah ne apne Nabi ko wafat di jab musailimaa ke mamle mein woh hua jo hua aur us ki taraf lashkar bheja gaya to main us ke sath nikla aur apna bhala liya ham mile aur main aur Ansar mein se ek aadmi us ki taraf ho; tumhara Rabb behtar janta hai mein se Kis ne use qatl kiya agar Main ne use qatl kiya to Main ne behtareen logon aur badtareen logon ko qatl kiya Sulaiman bin Yasar ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Main us din lashkar mein tha, aur Main ne ek kehne wale ko musailimaa ke bare mein kehte suna: Siyahi ghulam ne use qatl kiya"
"1413","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Laila se, Suhaib se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh aayat padhi {bhalai karne walon ke liye bhalai aur zyada hai}. farmaya: Jab jannat wale jannat mein dakhil honge to pukaarne wala pukaarega: Aey jannat walon, Beshak tumhare liye Allah ke paas ek wa'da hai! To woh kahenge: Woh Kya hai? Kya Us ne hamare chehre safed nahin kiye, hamare meezan bhaari nahin kiye aur hamen jannat mein dakhil nahin kiya? To un se yeh teen martaba kaha jayega unhon ne kaha: To woh Tabaraka-wa Ta'ala un ke samne zahir hoga aur woh us ki taraf dekhenge, aur woh un ke han us se bada hoga jo unhen diya gaya"
"1414","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salih Abu al-Khaleel ko Abdullah bin al-Haris se, Hakim bin Hizam se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Donon bechne walon ko juda hone tak ikhtiyar hai; agar sach bolen aur kholen to un ke bechne mein barkat hogi, aur agar jhoot bolen aur chhupayen to un ke bechne ki barkat mita jayegi"
"1415","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Salih se, Abdullah bin al-Haris se, Hakim se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, aisa Hum"
"1416","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur Hammam ne kaha: Abu at-Tayyah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin al-Haris ko Hakim bin Hizam se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte suna, aisa Hum"
"1417","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Muslim bin Jundub se, Hakim bin Hizam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se manga aur mangne mein isaraara kiya, to farmaya: Aey Hakim, tumhare mangne par Kya inkar! Yeh maal meetha hara hai, logon ke hathon ka mail hai; aur Allah ka hath upar hai, aur dene wale ka hath lene wale se upar hai, aur hathon mein sab neeche lene wale ka hath hai"
"1418","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Yusuf bin Mahak se, Abdullah bin Ismah se, Hakim bin Hizam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main bai khareedega hun; mein se mere liye Kya halal hai aur mujh par Kya haram hai? To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Jab koi Saudah becho to use na becho yahan tak ke qabzaa karo"
"1419","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Malih al-Huzali ko apne walid se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek ghar mein tha, to Main ne Aap farmate suna: Allah Tabaraka-wa Ta'ala baghair taharat namaz qabool nahin karta aur na Ghulool ke sadqe ko"
"1420","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad bin Mansoor ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu al-Malih al-Huzali se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath baarish ke din safar mein the, to Aap ne pukaarne wale ko hukm diya aur Us ne pukara: Deron mein namaz"
"1421","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Zurarah ko Ubayy bin Malik se bayan karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne walidain ya ek ko pae phir aag mein dakhil ho, Allah use door kare"
"1422","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zurarah ko apni qaum ke ek aadmi se bayan karte suna jise Malik ya Abu Malik ya bin Malik kaha jata hai, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jo Musalmanon ke darmiyan kisi yateem ko apne khane-peene mein shamil kare yahan tak ke woh us se ghani ho jae, us ke liye jannat zaroor wajib hui; aur jo apne walidain ya ek ko pae phir aag mein dakhil ho, Allah use door kare; aur jo Musalman kisi Musalman gardan ko aazad kare woh aag se us ka fidya hogi"
"1423","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Ata se, Ya'la bin munabbiha se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko dekha jis par jubba tha jis par khaluq ya zardi ka nishan tha, to farmaya: Ise utar do, aur apne umrah mein Wahy karo jo apne Hajj mein karte ho Qatadah ne kaha: Aur Main ne Ata se kaha: Ham sunte the ke kaha: Ise phaara do unhon ne kaha: Yeh fasad hai, aur Allah fasad ko pasand nahin karta"
"1424","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Mujahid se, Ya'la bin munabbiha se — ya bin Umayyah se — unhon ne kaha: Do aadmi lade aur ek ne doosre ko kata, to Us ne apna hath us ke munh se kheencha aur us ka samne ka dant ukhaara diya, to Us ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ka faisla chaha, to farmaya: Tum se ek apne bhai ko raha hai jaise jawan oont raha hai, to Aap ne Ise batil kiya Hakam ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho Ise batil kiya Kya hai? Main ne kaha: Ise radd kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han"
"1425","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu al-Malih al-Huzali se, Abu izzaa se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande ki rooh kisi zameen mein qabz karna chahe to us ke liye wahan koi hajat bana deta hai"
"1426","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sadqa bin Musa ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Imran al-jaunii ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Qais se — ya Qais bin Zaid se — do shaharon ke Qazi Shuraih se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakr se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Tabaraka-wa Ta'ala qayamat ke din qarz ko bulaaegaa aur farmata: Aey Adam ke bete, Tum ne logon ke haq kahan zaya kiye? Un ke maal kahan ganvaae? To woh kehta: Aey Rabb, Main ne Ise par nahin, lekin mujhe ya to duubanaa ya jalanaa pesh aaya to woh Azza-wa Jall farmata: Aaj tumhari taraf se ada karne ka main sab zyada haqdar hun to us ki nekiyan us ki buraiyon par bhaari hongi aur use jannat ka hukm diya jayega"
"1427","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah aur Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Raziyallahu bin anhu al-usaidii se, Kinanah bin Nu'aim al-Adawi se, Qabeesah bin Mukhariq al-Hilali se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne hamaalaa uthai, to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se is mein manga, to farmaya: Thehro, Aey Qabeesah, yahan tak ke hamare paas Sadqa aae to ham tumhare liye is ka hukm den phir kaha: Aey Qabeesah, mangna sirf teen mein se ek ke liye halal hai: Ek aadmi Jis ne hamaalaa uthai aur is mein mange yahan tak ke use pae phir ruk jae; aur ek aadmi jise aafat pahunchee Jis ne us ka maal tabaah kiya, to mange yahan tak ke guzare ki puurti pae — ya kaha: Guzare ka sahara — phir ruk jae; aur ek aadmi jise sakht hajat pahunchee aur us ki qaum mein se aql wale teen aadmi khade hue aur kaha: Falan ko faqa ya sakht hajat pahunchee hai, to mange yahan tak ke guzare ki puurti pae — ya guzare ka sahara — phir ruk jae aur Aap siwa mangna suhta hai jise us ka karne wala suhta khata hai — Ise do ya teen martaba kaha"
"1428","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Malik al-Ashja'i se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne walid se kaha: Aey abba, Kya Aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche, Abu Bakr ke peeche aur Umar ke peeche namaz nahin padhi? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han to main ne kaha: Kya woh Fajr mein qunut padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Aey mere bete, yeh nai baat hai"
"1429","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ali ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim al-Ghifari se, unhon ne kaha: Mere sardar Abu ruhma ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main aur mera bhai Hunain mein hazir hue aur hamare sath do ghode the, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamare liye chaar hisse nikale, mere aur mere bhai ke liye do-do hisse; to Ham ne Hunain ke do hisse do jawan oonton se beche"
"1430","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, Busr bin Sa'id se, Zaid bin Khalid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein kisi ghaazii ko tayyar kare Us ne jang kiya, aur jo us ke gharwalon mein us ka qaayamamuqaama bane Us ne jang kiya"
"1431","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair bin Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Zaid bin Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo achcha wuzu kare phir do rak'aten padhe aur mein ghafil na ho use muaf kiya jayega"
"1432","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, Zaid bin Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas hazir tha, Aap ne us ke bare mein faisla kiya Jis ne zina kiya aur shadishuda na tha: Sau kode aur saal bhar ki jilaavatanii."
"1433","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b aur Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, Zaid bin Khalid al-Juhani se, aur Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Do aadmiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se faisla chaha, to ek ne kaha: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun ke hamare darmiyan Allah ki Kitab se faisla karo unhon ne kaha: To us ka fareeq khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mera beta is ke paas mazdoor tha — ya'ni khadim — aur Us ne us ki biwi se zina kiya, to Main ne us se sau bakriyon aur ek khadim se fidya diya jab Main ne ilm walon se poocha to Unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke mere bete par sau kode aur saal bhar ki jilawatni hai aur is aadmi ki biwi par rajm hai! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, main tumhare darmiyan Allah ki Kitab se zaroor faisla karunga; sau bakriyan aur khadim to tumhen kare jate hain, aur tumhare bete par sau kode aur saal bhar ki jilawatni hai, aur jao, Aey Unais, is ki biwi ke paas; agar iqrar kare to use rajm karo to woh subah us ke paas gaya aur us se poocha aur Us ne iqrar kiya, to use rajm kiya"
"1434","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, Zaid bin Khalid al-Juhani se, aur Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se kisi ki bandi zina kare to use kode maare; phir agar aae to use kode maare; phir agar aae to use kode maare; phir chauthi martaba aae to use bech de chahe rassi ke badle"
"1435","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Salih se — Tau'amah ke aazad-karda — Zaid bin Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Maghrib padhte the phir bazaar aate the; agar ham teer nikalte to un ki girne ki jagah dekhte"
"1436","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr al-hannaata ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Hani bin Urwah bin qiaasa ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Huzaifah se, Abdul-Malik bin Alqamah Abu Alqamah as-Saqafi se, ke Saqeef ka wafd Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap hadiya diya, to farmaya: Sadqa hai ya hadiya? Kyunke sadqe se Allah ka chehra chaha jata hai, aur tohfe se Rasulullah ka chehra aur hajat poori karna chaha jata hai to Unhon ne Aap se poocha, aur poochte rahe yahan tak ke Unhon ne Zuhr Asr ke sath hi padhi"
"1437","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Uqbah bin al-Haris se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein Abu Ihab ki beti se nikah kiya, phir ek kali bandi aai aur zikr kiya ke Us ne ham donon ko doodh pilaya hai to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, woh jhooti hai! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaise, jabke kaha ja chuka phir Main ne doosri martaba Aap se dohraya aur Aap ne waisa hi kaha, phir Main ne teesri martaba dohraya aur farmaya: Use chhod do"
"1438","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aiman bin naabila al-Makki ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Qudamah bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Qurbani ke din surkh untni par Jamrah marte dekha; na maarne na hankana aur na hat-hato."
"1439","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Haris bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ke paas the, to Abdullah bin takhafaa al-Ghifari aae, to Abu Salamah ne un se kaha: hamen apne walid ki hadees bayan karo! To unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan; mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas mehmaan bahut hue, to ek aadmi apne mehmaan ka hath pakarane laga, aur doosra aadmi apne mehmaan ka hath pakarane wahan to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen apne dere par le gae aur farmaya: Aey A'ishah, tumhare paas kuch hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan; hais hai jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye banai hai farmaya: To aao unhon ne kaha: To laya gayi, aur Ham ne khaya yahan tak ke us ki taraf na dekhte the! Phir kaha: Aey A'ishah, tumhare paas koi mashroob hai jo hamen pilao? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye thoda doodh hai to woh hamare paas din aur Ham ne piya yahan tak ke us ki taraf na dekhte the! Unhon ne kaha: Phir ham soe, phir jab subah hui — ya jab Ham ne subah ki — to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen jagaane lage, aur aise hi karte the unhon ne kaha: To mere paas aae jabke main munh ke bal so raha tha aur farmaya: Yeh kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Main hun, Aey Allah ke farmaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh aisa irada hai jise Allah Azza-wa Jall napasand karta hai"
"1440","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id Ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi se, Abu Shuraih al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam iman nahin laya, Allah ki qasam iman nahin laya, Allah ki qasam iman nahin laya; woh jis ki sharaaraton se us ka padosi aman mein na ho unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ki sharaaraten Kya hain? Farmaya: Us ki buraaii."
"1441","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan Ibn Abi Ja'far ne ham se bayan kiya, Ismail bin Kaseer al-Makki se, Asim bin Laqit bin Sabirah se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main apni qaum ke wafd ke taur par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se wuzu ke bare mein poocha, to farmaya: Jab wuzu karo to ungliyon mein khilal karo aur naak mein zor se pani carhaao jab tak rozedar na ho, aur apni biwi ko na maro jaise apni bandi ko marte ho"
"1442","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Safwan bin Sulaim se, Nafi' bin Jubair se, Sahl Ibn Abi Hasmah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum se ek namaz padhe to apne qible ke qareeb ho, taake shaitan us ki namaz na kaam"
"1443","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Safwan se, ummuddaradaa se, Ka'b bin Asim se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Safar mein roza neki mein se nahin"
"1444","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hafs bin Asim ko bin Buhainah se bayan karte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko Fajr ki do rak'aten padhte dekha jabke namaz khadi ho chuki thi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya Fajr chaar! Kya Fajr chaar!."
"1445","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Yazid bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, Hanzhalah al-usaiyyadii se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum isi hote jaise mere paas hote ho to farishte tum par apne paron se saya karte"
"1446","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhri ne ham se bayan kiya, Sinan Ibn Abi Sinan Woh-dualii se, Abu Waqid al-Laisi se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hunain mein the jabke ham kufr se nae the, to ham ek pera ke paas se guzre jis par mushrik apne hathyar rakhte the, jise zaatu-anavaata kaha jata tha, to ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare liye bhi zaatu-anavaata bana den jaise un ka zaatu-anavaata hai! To farmaya: Allahu Akbar, Tum ne waisa kaha jaisa Ahle-Kitab ne Musa se kaha {hamare liye ma'bood bana jaise un ke ma'bood hain}. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum zaroor un logon ke tariiqon par caloge jo tum pahle the"
"1447","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Warqa ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Mujahid se, Abu Ayyash az-Zurqi se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Usfan mein the, to namaz ka waqt aaya, Zuhr ki namaz, jabke mushrikon ke sawaron par Khalid bin al-Waleed tha unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba ke sath Zuhr padhi, to mushrikon ne kaha: Un ke liye is ke baad ek namaz hai jo unhen apne beton, maal aur janon se zyada karti hai — ya'ni Asr ki namaz to Jibreel Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par Zuhr-Asr ke darmiyan nazil hue aur Aap khabar di, aur yeh aayat nazil hui: {Aur jab tum mein ho aur un ke liye namaz khadi karo} aayat ke anta tak phir Asr aai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba ko do safon mein kiya jabke un par hathyar the, aur takbir kahi, aur dushman Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne tha; sab takbir kahi aur sab ruku kiya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sajdah kiya aur woh saf jo Aap se mili thi, aur doosre khade un ki hifazat karte rahe jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farigh hue to doosri rak'at ke liye khade hue aur doosron ne sajdah kiya, phir yeh inakii jaghon par aage ho aur woh inakii jaghon par peeche hue, aur Aap ne unhen ek aur rak'at padhai aur sab ruku kiya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sajdah kiya aur woh saf jo Aap se mili thi, aur doosre khade un ki hifazat karte rahe jab woh farigh hue to Inhon ne sajdah kiya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne salam phera Abu Ayyash ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh namaz do martaba padhi; ek martaba Usfan mein, aur ek martaba gai Sulaim ki zameen mein"
"1448","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair se, Umar bin Abdur Rahman bin al-Haris bin Hisham al-Makhzumi se, ke Abu Basrah Abu Hurairah se mile jabke woh aa rahe the, to kaha: Kahan se aae? Unhon ne kaha: Toor se aaya hun; us mein namaz padhi unhon ne kaha: Khabardar, agar main tumhen pata to tum na jate; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Kajave sirf teen masajid ki taraf kapde jate hain; meri yeh masjid, Masjid-haram, aur Masjid-aqasaa."
"1449","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aun bin Abdullah bin Utbah ko Umm-Salamah se, Abu Salamah se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi banda nahin jise museebat pahunche aur woh kahe: Beshak ham Allah ke hain aur usi ki taraf laut wale hain; Aey Allah, Tere paas main apni museebat ka sawab chahta hun, to mujhe is mein ajr de aur mujhe is se behtar Ata kar — magar Allah use woh deta hai unhon ne kaha: Jab Abu Salamah ki wafat hui to main ne kaha: Aey Allah, mujhe meri museebat mein ajr de; aur main kehna chahti thi: Aur mujhe is se behtar Ata kar, to main ne kaha: Abu Salamah se behtar kaun hai? Phir Main ne Ise kaha, aur mujhe ummeed hai ke Allah ne mujhe meri museebat mein ajr diya aur mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ata hue"
"1450","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu hurraa ne ham se bayan kiya, Hasan se, Abdur Rahman bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Aur main Ise Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hi janta hun, farmaya: Jo Jume ke din wuzu kare to usi se, aur Kya bahut; aur jo ghusl kare to ghusl afzal hai"
"1451","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ko Abdur Rahman bin Samurah se bayan karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam khae phir us se behtar dekhe to woh kare jo behtar hai, phir apni qasam ka kaffara de"
"1452","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jisr bin Farqad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saleet bin Abdullah bin Yasar ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere dada ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bai'at ki"
"1453","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah aur Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid bin Hilal se, Abu Qatadah al-Adawi se, Ubadah bin qursa se — aur Sulaiman ne kaha: bin qurta, aur un ki sohbat thi — unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, tum aise kaam karte ho jo tumhari nazar mein baal se baariika hain; ham unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein halaak karne walon mein samajhte the"
"1454","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Amir al-Raziyallahu se, makahuula se, Ibn Abi Mahzurah se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe unnis kalimon mein azan sikhai Abu Bishr ne kaha: Aur Unhon ne zikr kiya ke woh makahuula se, bin Juraij se, Ibn Abi Mahzurah se, apne walid se hai"
"1455","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ko Abu Usaid al-Ansari se bayan karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ansar ke gharon mein sab behtar Bani an-najjaara hain, phir Bani Abdul-ashahala, phir Bani al-Haris bin al-khazaraja aur Bani Sa'idah; aur Ansar ke sab gharon mein bhalai hai unhon ne kaha: To kaha gaya: Unhon ne ham par fazeelat di? Unhon ne kaha: To kaha gaya: Unhon ne tumhen ziyada par fazeelat di hai"
"1456","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid Ibn Abi Usman ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub bin Abdullah bin Yasar se, Ibn Abi akraba se, Attab bin Usaid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne us kaam mein jis se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe lagaya tha, do naqshadaara burdon ke siwa kuch na paya jo Main ne apne aazad-karda Kaisan ko pahanaae."
"1457","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Faraj bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Sa'd ash-Shami ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Wasilah bin al-Asqa ko dekha — aur un ki sohbat thi — damishqa ki masjid mein jootiyan pahne namaz padhte hue, to Unhon ne apne baayen qadam ke neeche thuukaa phir use zameen par ragra jab namaz padh chuke to main ne kaha: Kya Aap yeh karte hain jabke Aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se hain? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko aise hi karte dekha"
"1458","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, Abu vajazaa se, Umar Ibn Abi Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ka naam lo — ya'ni khane par — aur apne daayen hath se khao, aur jo tumhare samne ho us mein se khao"
"1459","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ja'far bin Iyas ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yusuf bin Mahak ko Hakim bin Hizam se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aadmi mujh se Saudah mangta hai jo mere paas nahin; Kya main us ke liye khariiduun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tumhare paas nahin use na bech"
"1460","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, unhon ne kaha: Yusuf bin Mahak ko Hakim bin Hizam se bayan karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bai'at ki ke main na giruungaa magar khada"
"1461","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kudaira az-Dabbi ko suna — Abu Ishaq ne kaha: Aur Main ne un se pachaas saal pahle suna tha Shu'bah ne kaha: Aur Main ne Abu Ishaq se chalis saal ya zyada pahle suna Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur Main ne Shu'bah se paintalis ya chhiyalis saal pahle suna Abu Bishr ne kaha: Aur Main ne Abu Dawud se pachaas saal se zyada pahle suna Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Aur Main ne Yunus se sattar saal pahle suna shaikh Abu Nu'aim ne kaha: Main ne chhihattar saal pahle suna — unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe kisi aise amal ki khabar den jo mujhe jannat mein dakhil kare! Farmaya: Adl kaho aur maal do unhon ne kaha: Agar main is ki taqat na rakhun? Farmaya: To khana khilao aur salam phailao unhon ne kaha: Agar main is ki taqat na rakhun ya na kar rakhun? Farmaya: Kya tumhare paas oont hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han farmaya: To apne oonton mein se ek oont aur mashkiizaa dekho, aur aise ghar dekho jo pani ek din chhodkar hi peete hon, to unhen pilao; kyunke shayad tumhara oont na mare aur tumhara mashkiizaa na Shaqqat yahan tak ke tumhare liye jannat wajib ho jae"
"1462","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi as-safar se, ash-Sha'bi se, Kharijah bin as-Salt se, apne chacha se, ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se aae aur Arab ke qabilon mein se ek qabeela ke paas se guzre, to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum is Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se aae ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han unhon ne kaha: To Kya tum koi dam karne wala hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han unhon ne kaha: To ek zanjiiron mein jakaraa aadmi laya gaya, aur qaum mein se ek aadmi ne us par subah-Sham teen martaba Ummul-Quran padhi, aur un ke liye kuch ka hukm diya gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Nahin; yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poochhein to us aadmi ne Aap se poocha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khao; meri umar ki qasam, jo batil dam se khae, Tum ne haq dam se khaya hai"
"1463","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misaara bin Habib al-jaramii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Salamah al-jaramii ne ham se bayan kiya ke un ke walid aur un ki qaum ke kuch log Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamen kaun namaz parhaaegaa — ya: Hamen kaun namaz parhaaegaa? To farmaya: Tumhen woh namaz parhaaegaa — ya: Tumhen woh namaz parhaaegaa — Jis ne tum sab zyada Quran liya ho — ya: Jis ne tum sab zyada Quran jama kiya ho unhon ne kaha: To woh aae aur kisi ko na paya jis ke paas mujh se zyada Quran ho, to Unhon ne mujhe aage kiya, aur Main ne unhen namaz padhai jabke main ladka tha aur mere paas meri ek chadar thi misaara ne kaha: To Main ne unhen namaz padhate aur un ke janaze padhte paya, koi un se jhagda na karta tha yahan tak ke guzar gaye"
"1464","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad Ibn Abi Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Amr bin Umayyah az-Zamri ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin al-Khattab Amr bin Umayyah az-Zamri ke paas aae jabke woh bazaar mein ek chadar ka mola-rate kar rahe the, to kaha: Aey Amr, Kya karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ise khareedega hun aur Sadqa karta hun to un se kaha: to tum ho unhon ne kaha: Phir chale, phir aae aur kaha: Aey Amr, chadar ne Kya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Ise khareeda aur Sadqa kiya kaha: Kis par? Unhon ne kaha: Ruqaiqaa par? Kaha: Ruqaiqaa kaun hai? Kaha: Meri biivii. kaha: Aur Tum ne Ise apni biwi par Sadqa kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Tum ne unhen kisi cheez mein diya woh tumhare liye Sadqa hai to kaha: Aey Amr, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par jhoot na karo! Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main tumhen na chhorun yahan tak ke A'ishah ke paas aao aur un se poocho! Unhon ne kaha: To donon chale yahan tak ke A'ishah ke paas dakhil hue, to Amr ne un se kaha: Aey meri Amma, yeh Umar mujh se kehte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par jhoot na karo! Main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun, Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Tum ne unhen kisi cheez mein diya woh tumhare liye Sadqa hai? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, Ji Haan; Aey Allah, Ji Han"
"1465","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Usman bin Talha se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Kaabe mein namaz padhi"
"1466","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Rabbihi bin Sa'id se, Anas Ibn Abi Anas se, Abdullah bin Nafi' bin al-amyaa se, Abdullah bin al-Haris se, Muttalib se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Namaz do-do hai, aur har do rak'aton mein tashahhud padho, aur aajizi karo, aur miskiinii dikhao, aur apna hath uthao aur kaho: Aey Allah, Aey Allah! Jo aisa na kare to woh naaqisa hai, woh naaqisa hai"
"1467","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' bin Subaih ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata Ibn Abi Rabah ko kehte suna: Jabke bin az-Zubair hamen khutba de rahe the to kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri is masjid mein ek namaz hazaar namazon se afzal hai us ke siwa jo kuch hai, siwae Masjid-haram ke; aur Masjid-haram mein ek namaz sau se rakhti hai Ata ne kaha: Goya woh ek laakha hai unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Aey Abu Muhammad, yeh fazeelat jo tum zikr karte ho, Masjid-haram mein akele ya haram mein? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, lekin haram mein; kyunke sara haram masjid hai"
"1468","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Juhaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, Aap se yeh safed hai — aur Unhon ne anafaqaa ki taraf ishara kiya unhon ne kaha: To un se kaha gaya: Us din tum kis jaise the, Aey Abu Juhaifah? Unhon ne kaha: Main teer chiilataa aur mein par karta tha"
"1469","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Qasim bin Abdur Rahman se, apne walid se, Abu Burdah se — aur woh Ibn Abi Musa nahin hain — ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Piyo aur nasha na karo"
"1470","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abdur Rahman bin uzainaa se, apne walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam khae phir us se behtar dekhe to woh kare jo behtar hai aur apni qasam ka kaffara de"
"1471","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, Abdullah bin Yasar se — aur un ki kunniyata Abu Hammam hai — Abu Abdur Rahman al-Fihri se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hunain mein the, aur Ham ne sakht garmi ke din kooch kiya, aur peron ke sae mein utre jab suraj dhalaa to Main ne apni zirah chadhi aur apna ghoda sawar hua aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke Aap apne kheme mein the to main ne kaha: Assalamu alaika ya rasuulallaaha wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh; kooch ka waqt aa gaya, Ya Rasulullah! To farmaya: Han phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Bilal! To woh babuula ke neeche se uthe goya un ka saya parinde ka saya ho, aur kaha: Labbaik wa saadaika, aur main Aap par fidaa. farmaya: Mera ghoda tayyar karo to woh khajoor ki chhaal ki do ziinaposha jane mein na ghuruura tha na takabbura. unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne apna ghoda sawar kiya, phir Ham ne apna din kooch kiya aur dushman se mile aur donon sawar aamane-samne hue, to Ham ne un se pada ki aur Musalman peeth pherakara bhaage jaisa Allah Ta'ala ne kaha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmane lage: Aey Allah ke bando, main Allah ka banda aur us ka Rasulullah hun; Aey logo, meri taraf! Main Allah ka banda aur us ka Rasulullah hun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne ghode se utre, aur Jis ne mujh se zyada qareeb tha mujhe bayan kiya ke Aap ne mitti ki ek mutthi li aur qaum ke chehron par dekha aur farmaya: Chehre bigaren. Ya'la bin Ata ne kaha: To un ke beton ne hamen apne baapon se khabar di ke unhon ne kaha: Mein se koi na bacha magar us ki aankhen-munh mitti se bhar gae, aur Ham ne aasman se jhanajhanaahata suni jaise nae tasale par loha phere, to Allah ne unhen shikast di"
"1472","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail bin Ja'far al-Madani ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Ali bin Khallad ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne walid se, apne dada se, Rifa'ah al-Badri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid mein baithe the — Rifa'ah ne kaha: Aur ham un ke paas the — ke dehati jaisa ek aadmi aaya, masjid mein dakhil hua aur namaz padhi aur apni namaz halki ki, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap salam kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wa alaika, apni namaz lautao kyunke Tum ne namaz nahin padhi to yeh logon par bhaari guzra ke jo apni namaz halki kare Us ne namaz nahin padhi to Us ne yeh do ya teen martaba kiya, har martaba Aap us se waisa hi kehte, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe dikhlaen aur sikhao, kyunke main insan hun, durust bhi karta hun aur ghalat kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye khade ho to wuzu karo jaisa Allah ne tumhen hukm diya, phir takbir kaho; agar tumhare paas Quran ho to use padho, aur agar tumhare paas Quran na ho to Allah ki tareef karo, us ki tauheed bayan karo aur us ki takabbur bayan karo jab ruku karo to ruku karo yahan tak ke itminan ho, phir apna sar uthao aur khade kar seedhe ho, phir sajdah karo aur sajde mein seedhe ho, phir apna sar uthao aur baithkar seedhe ho, yahan tak ke apni namaz poori karo agar Tum ne yeh kiya to tumhari namaz poori hui, aur agar Tum ne is mein se kuch kiya to Tum ne apni namaz mein se hi chaar to yeh logon par aasan hui; ke jo kare woh apni namaz mein se kare aur tamam na jayegi"
"1473","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Firas bin Yahya se, ash-Sha'bi se, Masrooq se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas un ki us beemari mein the jis mein Aap wafat hui, mein se ek bhi juda na hoti thi, ke Fatimah chalti hui aaeen, un ki chalna Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki chalna se kuch na hatatii thi jab Aap ne unhen dekha to farmaya: Meri beti ko khushaaamadeda. to unhen apne daayen — ya baayen — bithaya phir un se koi baat sargoshi mein kahi aur woh rone to Main ne un se kaha, main un ki biwiyon mein se akeli: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mein se tumhen sargoshi se khaas kiya aur tum rotii ho? Phir un se koi baat sargoshi mein kahi aur woh hansiin. unhon ne kaha: To Main ne un se kaha: main tumhen apne haq ki qasam deti hun — ya mere jo haq tum par hain — ke mujhe zaroor woh unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka raaz faasha karne wali nahin unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki wafat hui to Main ne un se poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Ab Haan; mera ronaa to liye tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se kaha: Jibreel har saal mujh par ek martaba Quran ka Main karte the, to is saal mujh par do martaba Main kiya; aur main nahin samajhta magar meri muddat qareeb aa gayi hai to main roii. to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Allah se daro aur sabr karo; kyunke main tumhare liye Kya hi achcha pesharau hun phir kaha: Aey Fatimah, Kya tum razi nahin ke tum jahanon ki aurton ki sardar ho — ya jahanon ki aurton ki sardar — to main hansii."
"1474","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Fatimah ne mujh se kaha: Aey Anas, Kya tumhare dilon ko achcha laga ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par mitti dalo? Sabit ne kaha: Aur Fatimah ne kaha, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) maut mein the — ya kaha jabke woh bhaari the —: Aey mere abba, Jibreel se un ki khabar dete hain; Aey mere abba, apne Rabb se kitne qareeb hain; Aey mere abba, Firdaus ke bagh un ka guzarne hain; Aey mere abba, Unhon ne Rabb ko jawab diya Jis ne unhen dawat"
"1475","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mein se ek ko hukm dete jab woh haiz mein hoti ke kapda bandhe, phir us se mubashirat karte"
"1476","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash aur Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumbe aur roghan lage bartan se mana kiya"
"1477","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor aur A'mash se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hadi ki bakriyon ke haar batatii thi, phir Aap par koi cheez haram na hoti thi"
"1478","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim ko bayan karte suna, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke balon ki mang mein khushbu ki chamak dekhta thi jabke Aap muhrim the"
"1479","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne hoti thi jabke Aap namaz padhte the; jab main uthna chahti to chupke se hijab jati"
"1480","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansoor aur A'mash ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ko suna, Aswad se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Ham A'ishah ke paas the ke ek yahan kisi insan par gira aur woh hanse, to A'ishah ne kaha: Mazaq na uraao; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi Musalman nahin jise kaanta gunahon ya us se zyada, magar Allah use is se ek darja karta hai aur us se is se ek khata mitaataa hai"
"1481","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, ke Unhon ne Barirah ko aazad karne ke liye khareedna chaha, to us ke shareekon ne us ki wala shart karna chaha; to is ka zikr Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya to farmaya: Use khareedo, kyunke wala sirf aazad karne wale ke liye hai aur unhen apne shauhar se ikhtiyar diya, jabke un ka shauhar aazad tha aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gosht laya gaya aur kaha gaya: Yeh us mein se hai jo Barirah ko Sadqa diya gaya tha to farmaya: Woh us ke liye Sadqa hai, aur hamare liye tohafaa."
"1482","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Aswad bin Yazid se, ke bin az-Zubair ne un se kaha: mujhe batao jo Ummul-Mu'minin tumhen raaz bataatii thin to Aswad ne kaha: Unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Agar tumhari qaum Jahiliyat se nai na hoti to main Ka'ba dhaa deta aur us ke do darwaze banata phir jab bin az-Zubair ko iktidaara mila to Unhon ne Ise dhaayaa aur is ke do darwaze bana"
"1483","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se poocha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne ghar mein kaise karte the? Unhon ne kaha: Woh apne gharwalon ki paas mein hote the; jab namaz aati to nikalte aur namaz padhte"
"1484","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab junub hote aur Sona ya khana chahte to wuzu karte"
"1485","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Goya main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki mang mein khushbu ki chamak dekh rahi hun jabke Aap muhrim hain"
"1486","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Aswad ko kehte suna: Main ne A'ishah se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki raat ki namaz ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Aap raat ke shuru mein sote the; jab sahar hoti to witr padhte, phir apne bistar par aate agar apne gharwalon se koi hajat hoti to un se milte, phir sote. jab pukarte sunte — aur kabhi kaha: Azan — to uchala hath, aur Unhon ne nahin kaha: Khade hue — agar junub hote to apne upar pani bahate — aur Unhon ne nahin kaha: Ghusl karte — aur agar junub na hote to wuzu karte, phir namaz ke liye nikalte"
"1487","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Aswad aur Masrooq ko suna, A'ishah se gawahi dete hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Asr ke baad mere paas na aate the magar do rak'aten padhte the"
"1488","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Teen se qalam uthaya gaya: Sone wale se yahan tak ke jage, deewane se yahan tak ke theek ho, aur bachche se yahan tak ke samajhe."
"1489","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) e'tikaf karte the, to masjid ke darwaze se apna sar nikalte aur main Ise Khatmi se dhotii jabke main haiz mein hoti"
"1490","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko goh tohfe mein di gayi aur Aap ne Ise na khaya to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya ham Ise miskeenon ko na khilaen? To farmaya: Unhen woh na khilao jo tum nahin khaate."
"1491","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne mujhe khabar di, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha bartanon se mana kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne hamen tumbe aur roghan lage bartan se mana kiya"
"1492","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab junub na hote to wuzu karte, phir do rak'aten padhte — ya'ni Fajr ki do rak'aten — phir namaz ke liye nikalte"
"1493","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ehram baandhanaa chahte to sab umdah khushbu lagate jo pate, yahan tak ke main us ki chamak un ki dadhi-sar mein dekhti"
"1494","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hadi ko haar pahnati thi, to haar chadhi hadi nikalti, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) halal rehte, apni biwiyon mein se kisi se paraheza na karte"
"1495","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Yazid ko suna, Aswad se, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jau ki roti se do din musalsal sera na hue yahan tak ke wafat paya"
"1496","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek aur Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghusl ke baad wuzu na karte the"
"1497","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar Ibn Abi Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roze ki haalat mein mere chehre se paraheza na karte the ya'ni: Unhen bosa the"
"1498","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin khaazima ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne koi wasiyat na ki"
"1499","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ash'as Ibn Abi ash-riwayat se, Aswad bin Yazid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jadra ke bare mein poocha — ya'ni Hijr — Kya woh Baitullah mein se hai? Farmaya: Han unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Unhen Ise Baitullah mein dakhil karne se Kya roka? Farmaya: Tumhari qaum kharch se aajiz rahi unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Unhon ne is ka darwaza buland kyun banaya? Farmaya: Tumhari qaum ne aisa kiya; taake jise chahen dakhil karen aur jise chahen roken. agar tumhari qaum Jahiliyat se nai na hoti, aur mujhe dar na hota ke un ke dil inkar karenge, to jo Unhon ne chhoda main dakhil karta, aur is ka darwaza zameen se mila deta"
"1500","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anas bin Malik al-quufii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin al-Aswad ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, A'ishah se, ke unhon ne kaha: Goya main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki mang mein khushbu ki chamak dekh rahi hun jabke Aap muhrim hain"
"1501","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mughirah se, Ibrahim se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne saanp-bichchu ke dam ki ruksat di"
"1502","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ko suna, Aswad se, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Aurat Musalmanon ki taraf se panah deti thi"
"1503","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Aswad se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) junub hote hue sote the, aur pani na chhute the"
"1504","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mu'az az-Dabbi ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Alqamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se poocha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume ki raat ya Jume ke din ko khaas karte the? To unhon ne kaha: Aapka amal musalsal tha; aur tum se kaun is ki taqat rakhta hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) karte the"
"1505","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Ibrahim se, ke Alqamah aur Shuraih bin artaata A'ishah ke paas the, to ek ne kaha: Un se rozedar ke bose ke bare mein poocho to ek ne kaha: Main Ummul-Mu'minin ke paas ghaflat baat na karunga to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roze ki haalat mein bosa lete the, aur woh tum sab se apne nafs ke zyada Malik the"
"1506","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih bin rustama Abu Amir al-khazzaaza ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sayyar Abu al-Hakam ne ham se bayan kiya, ash-Sha'bi se, Alqamah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham A'ishah ke paas the ke Abu Hurairah un ke paas dakhil hue, to unhon ne kaha: Aey Abu Hurairah, Kya tum ho jo bayan karte ho ke ek aurat ko us ki billi mein azab diya gaya, Us ne use bandha, na khilaya na pilaya? To Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Main ne un se suna, ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se to A'ishah ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho woh aurat Kya thi? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Woh aurat jo Us ne kiya us ke sath kaafiraa thi; mo'min Allah ke han is se izzat wala hai ke use billi mein azab de jab tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karo to dekho kaise bayan karte ho"
"1507","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Ibrahim se, ke Hammam bin al-Haris A'ishah ke mehmaan the aur unhen ehtelam hua; A'ishah ki ek bandi ne unhen janabat ke nishan ko apne kapde se dhote dekha aur A'ishah ko khabar di to A'ishah ne unhen taraf bheja: Main ne nafs ko dekha, main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kapde se Ise malne se zyada na karti thi"
"1508","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu az-Zuha ko suna, Masrooq se, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Jab Surah-Baqarah ki aakhri aayaat nazil huin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid ki taraf nikle aur unhen logon par padha, aur sharab ki tijarat haram ki"
"1509","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu az-Zuha ko suna, Masrooq se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen ikhtiyar diya aur Ham ne Aap muntakhib; Kya woh talaq tha?."
"1510","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu az-Zuha ko suna, Masrooq se, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab mareez ki iyadat karte to us ka chehra-seena ponchhte — ya kaha: Us ke seene par ponchhte — aur farmate: Takleef door kar, Aey logon ke Rabb, aur shifa de, Tu hi Shaafi hai; Teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahin, aisi shifa jo beemari na chhod unhon ne kaha: Jab Aap woh beemari hui jis mein Aap wafat hui, to main Aapka hath lekar Aap seene par rakhne lagi aur yeh baat kehne lagi, to Aap ne apna hath mere hath se kheencha aur farmaya: Aey Allah, mujhe rafiiqe-a'la mein dakhil karo"
"1511","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Jarir ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Abu az-Zuha se, Masrooq se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek raat mere paas the, to Main ne Aap na paya, aur samjha ke Aap apni kisi bandi ke paas gae hain, to raat ke andhere mein Aap talash kiya Jarir ne kaha — aur Shu'bah ne Ise na kaha — unhon ne kaha: To main Aap paas pahunchee jabke Aap sajde mein the, to Main ne apna hath Aap par rakha, aur Aap farmate suna: Aey Allah, mujhe muaf kar jo Main ne chhipaya aur jo zahir kiya"
"1512","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Maimun se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Masrooq se — ya Urwah bin al-Mughirah se — A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se andar aane ki ijazat mangi, to farmaya: Allah ka Kya hi bura banda, aur qabeela ka aae phir woh andar aaya, to Aap us ki taraf apne chehre se mutawajjah hue, goya us ke paas koi girana ho"
"1513","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ash'as Ibn Abi ash-riwayat se, apne walid se, Masrooq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke amal ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Aap sab pasandeeda amal musalsal tha main ne kaha: To Aap kis waqt uthte the? Unhon ne kaha: Jab pukaarne wale ko sunte to uthate. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ya'ni murghe ko"
"1514","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib bin Khalid aur Yazid bin zuraia ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud Ibn Abi Hind se, ash-Sha'bi se, Masrooq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se Allah Tabaraka-wa Ta'ala ke qaul ke bare mein poocha: {Aur Unhon ne use wazeh aasman par dekha} {aur Unhon ne use doosri martaba utarte dekha}. to unhon ne kaha: Main is ummat mein pehli hun Jis ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha, to farmaya: Woh Jibreel hain; Main ne unhen do martaba dekha; Main ne unhen buland aasman par dekha, aur Main ne unhen wazeh aasman par dekha"
"1515","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, ash-Sha'bi se, Masrooq se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham daswin ke baad qurbani ke gosht khate the"
"1516","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ash'as se, apne walid se, Masrooq se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dayan shuru karna pasand karte the jitna kar rakhte the; aur ek martaba kaha: Apne tamam kaam mein; apne wuzu mein jab wuzu karte, aur apni joote pahanne mein jab pehente, aur apni kanghi mein jab kanghi karte"
"1517","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ash'as se, unhon ne kaha: Apne walid ko suna, Masrooq se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Ek Yahudi aurat A'ishah ke paas mangne aai aur A'ishah se kaha: Allah tumhen qabr ke azab se panah de phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae aur A'ishah ne Aap se poocha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qabr ka azab haq hai A'ishah ne kaha: Us ke baad Main ne Aap koi namaz padhte nahin suna magar us mein qabr ke azab se panah mangte the"
"1518","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ash'as se, unhon ne kaha: Apne walid ko suna, Masrooq se, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dakhil hue jabke un ke paas ek aadmi tha goya Aap ne napasand kiya unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, woh mera razai bhai hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dekho tumhare bhai kaun hain, kyunke razat sirf bhook se hai"
"1519","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin al-Qasim se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nikle, aur woh sirf Hajj tha jab main Sarif mein thi to mujhe haiz aaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke main ro rahi thi to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Tumhen Kya rula hai? Main ne kaha: Mujhe haiz aaya, aur main chahti thi ke Main ne Hajj na kiya hota to farmaya: Allah, yeh to woh cheez hai jo Allah Tabaraka-wa Ta'ala ne Adam ki betiyon par likhi hai; tamam manasik karo, siwae is ke ke Baitullah ka tawaf na karo unhon ne kaha: Jab Makkah aae to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba se farmaya: Tum se jo chahe Ise umrah banae, siwae us ke jis ke sath hadi ho aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ki taraf se gaayen zabah kiya jab nafara ki raat hui to main pak hui, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, meri saathinen Hajj-umrah ke sath loten, aur main Hajj ke sath lautuungii. to Aap ne Ibn Abi Bakr ko mere sath bheja, aur Main ne Tan'im se umrah kiya"
"1520","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Ya'la at-taaifii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin al-Qasim ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Isha se pahle na sote the, aur us ke baad gapashapa na karte the"
"1521","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, Qasim se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Usman bin Maz'un ka bosa lete dekha jabke woh miyyat the"
"1522","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin al-Qasim se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) janabat ke ek bartan se ghusl karte the Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne kaha: Mujhe achcha hota hai; kyunke unhon ne kaha: Janabat se"
"1523","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin al-Qasim se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, ke Unhon ne Barirah ko khareed aazad karna chaha, jabke us ke shareekon ne wala shart karna chaha; to A'ishah ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use khareedo aur aazad karo, kyunke wala sirf aazad karne wale ke liye hai unhon ne kaha: Aur gosht laya gaya, to farmaya: Yeh Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh Barirah ne hamen tohfe mein diya hai, use Sadqa diya gaya tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh us ke liye Sadqa hai, aur hamare liye tohafaa. unhon ne kaha: Aur use ikhtiyar diya gaya, jabke us ka shauhar aazad tha Shu'bah ne kaha: Phir Main ne baad mein un se poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Main nahin janta woh aazad hai ya ghulam? Shu'bah ne kaha: To Main ne Simak bin Harb se kaha: Main un se sanad ke bare mein poochne se darta hun, tum poocho unhon ne kaha: Aur woh apne akhlaq mein the to Simak ne bayan ke baad un se kaha: Kya tumhare walid ne tumhen yeh A'ishah se bayan kiya? To Abdur Rahman ne kaha: Ji Han jab woh nikle to Simak ne mujh se kaha: Aey Shu'bah, Main ne tumhare liye un se pakka kar liya"
"1524","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad bin Mansoor ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un ke halal hone par aur un ke ehram par khushbu lagati thi"
"1525","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin al-Qasim se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek aurat ko istihaza hua, to use hukm diya gaya — main ne kaha: Unhen Kis ne hukm diya, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne? Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se koi cheez bayan nahin karta unhon ne kaha: To use hukm diya gaya ke Zuhr der kare aur Asr jaldi padhe, aur donon ke liye ek ghusl kare; aur Maghrib der kare aur Isha jaldi padhe, aur donon ke liye ek ghusl kare; aur Fajr ke liye ek ghusl kare"
"1526","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad bin Mansoor ne ham se bayan kiya, Qasim se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne nafs ko dekha, main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kapde se janabat malatii thi aur us ki jagah na dhotii thi"
"1527","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad bin Mansoor ne ham se bayan kiya, Qasim se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek bartan se ghusl karte the"
"1528","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Qasim bin Muhammad se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo hamare mamle mein woh kare jo jaiz nahin, woh maraduuda hai"
"1529","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin al-Qasim se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek biche kapde ki taraf namaz padhte the, hamari ek chhoti kotharii par jis mein tasweeren thin, to farmaya: Ise mujh se door karo A'ishah ne kaha: To Ham ne Ise takiya bana"
"1530","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais bin ar-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, Qasim bin Muhammad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Usman bin Maz'un ka bosa lete dekha, jabke woh miyyat the Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ash'as bin Sa'id ne is hadees mein aur is sanad mein kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh kiya to roye yahan tak ke Main ne aansu dekhe Aap rukhsaron par bahate."
"1531","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah bin Asma ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, ke Qasim bin Muhammad ne unhen khabar di, ke A'ishah ne unhen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne tasviiron wala ek gaddaa khareeda, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae aur darwaze par khade hue aur dakhil na hue; to Main ne Aap chehre par pasandeedgi pahacaanii. to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main Allah Azza-wa Jall ki taraf Tauba karti hun — do martaba — Main ne Kya kiya? Farmaya: Yeh gaddaa Kya hai? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne Ise khareeda taake Aap is par baithein aur tek Raziyallahu to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo yeh tasweeren banate hain unhen qayamat ke din azab diya jaega, aur un se kaha jaega: Zinda karo jo Tum ne paida kiya aur jis ghar mein aisi tasweeren — ya tasweer — hon, farishte us mein dakhil nahin hote"
"1532","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, sumayyaa se, A'ishah se Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur hamen Makkah walon mein se ek aadmi ne bhi bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin al-Qasim se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se kaha: Aey meri beti, aaj kaun-sa din hai? Main ne kaha: Aaj Peer ka din hai unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki wafat kis din hui? Main ne kaha: Peer ke din"
"1533","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin taliidaana ne ham se bayan kiya — Aal-Abi Bakr as-Siddiq mein se — unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin Muhammad ko suna, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Sab barkat wala nikah woh hai jis ka kharch sab kam ho to mere walid ne un se kaha: Kya A'ishah ne tumhen yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khabar di? To unhon ne kaha: Mujhe aise hi bayan kiya gaya, aur Main ne aise hi yaad kiya"
"1534","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa bin taliidaana ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim ko suna, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Taoon wala, pahlu ke dard wala, nifas wali aur pet wala shaheed hain to mere walid ne un se kaha: Kya A'ishah ne tumhen yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya? To unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne mujhe aise hi bayan kiya, aur Main ne aise hi yaad kiya"
"1535","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, Qasim bin Muhammad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne raat ke shuru mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko na paya, to samjha ke Aap apni kisi biwi ke paas gae hain; to main Aap peeche chali aur Aap Baqi' pahunche to farmaya: Assalamu alaikum, Aey mo'min qaum ke ghar, aur ham tum milne wale hain; Aey Allah, hamen un ka ajr na chheen, aur un ke baad hamen gumrah na karo phir mude aur mujhe dekha, to farmaya: Afsos us par, kaash woh woh na kare jo Us ne kiya"
"1536","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Sabit bin Ubaid se, Qasim bin Muhammad se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Mujhe jae-namaz do to unhon ne kaha: Main haiz mein hun to farmaya: Tumhara haiz tumhare hath mein nahin to Main ne woh Aap di"
"1537","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin Muhammad ko suna, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un ke halal hone par aur un ke ehram par khushbu lagati thi"
"1538","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Qasim bin Muhammad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh aayat padhi: {Muhakama aayaat hain jo Kitab ki asl hain aur doosri mutashaabiha} aayat to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza-wa Jall ne tumhare liye un ka naam batao diya hai; jab tum unhen dekho to un se hoshiyaara Hazrat Ise teen martaba kaha"
"1539","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Qasim se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is aayat ke bare mein poocha {jin ke dilon mein terha hai woh pairwi karte hain} aayat to farmaya: Allah ne tumhare liye un ka naam batao diya hai; jab tum unhen dekho to un se hoshiyaara Hazrat"
"1540","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abbad bin Mansoor ne ham se bayan kiya, Qasim se, A'ishah se, ke Abu Qu'ais ne mujh se andar aane ki ijazat mangi unhon ne kaha: To Main ne unhen ijazat dena napasand kiya phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas dakhil hue aur Main ne Aap se is ke bare mein poocha to farmaya: Unhen ijazat do; kyunke woh tumhare chacha hain to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaise, jabke mujhe sirf aurat ne doodh pilaya aur aadmi ne mujhe doodh nahin pilaya! Farmaya: To unhen ijazat do; kyunke woh tumhare chacha hain unhon ne kaha: Aur Abu Qu'ais Aflah ke bhai the, A'ishah ki daayaa ke shauhara."
"1541","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Qasim Ibn Abbas se, Abdullah bin niyaara se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Aqiq ki ek larii laya gayi aur Aap ne use aazad aur bandi ke darmiyan baantaa."
"1542","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kabhi Chasht nahin padhi, jabke main Ise padhti hun"
"1543","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere shauhar ke paas kapde ke kinare jaisa kuch nahin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum Kya chahti ho? Kya tum Rifa'ah ki taraf jana chahti ho? Nahin, yahan tak ke tum us ki usailaa cakho."
"1544","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek bartan se ghusl karte the; us pyale ko us din faraq kaha jata tha"
"1545","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, ke Zainab bint Jahsh ko saat saal istihaza raha, to Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha, to Aap ne unhen hukm diya ke ghusl karen aur namaz padhe; to woh har namaz par ghusl karti thin"
"1546","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bande Allah ke bande hain, aur zameen Allah ki zameen hain; jo zameen ke murda hisse mein se kuch zinda kare woh us ka hai, aur zalim nasla ka koi haq nahin"
"1547","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hadi ke haar batatii thi aur Aap kisi cheez se paraheza na karte the"
"1548","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Habshi masjid mein dakhil hote the aur khelte the, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mujhe parda karte the, jabke main unhen dekhta thi, kamaumra ladki hote hue phir Umar aae aur unhen mana kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chhodo, Aey Umar phir kaha: Woh arafidaa ki betiyan hain"
"1549","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki kanghi karti thi jabke Aap e'tikaf mein hote the; apna sar hujre ke darwaze ki dehleez par nikalte aur main un ki kanghi karti"
"1550","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, ke Utbah Ibn Abi Waqqas ne apne bhai Sa'd se kaha: Jab tum Makkah aao to Zam'ah ki bandi ke bete ko pakad, kyunke woh mujh se hai jab fath ka din hua to Sa'd us ke paas aae, aur Abd bin Zam'ah aae aur us ka hath roka to Sa'd ne kaha: Mere bhai ka beta! Us ne mujhe wasiyat ki thi ke woh us ka beta hai unhon ne kaha: To Abd bin Zam'ah ne kaha: Mere baap ki bandi se mera bhai, us ke bistar par paida hua unhon ne kaha: To donon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se faisla irada to Sa'd ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere bhai ne mujhe wasiyat ki thi ke jab main Makkah aaun to Zam'ah ki bandi ke bete ko pakaduun, kyunke woh us ka beta hai to Abd bin Zam'ah ne kaha: Mere baap ki bandi ka beta, mere baap ki bandi se, us ke bistar par paida hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh tumhara hai, Aey Abd; bachcha bistar ka hai aur zani ke liye pathar hai aur us se parda karo, Aey Saudah bint Zam'ah — liye jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki Utbah se hamashaklii dekhi to Unhon ne use na dekha yahan tak ke Allah se miliin."
"1551","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham Woh-dastuvaaii ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab khana hazir ho aur namaz aa jae to khane se shuru karo"
"1552","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Usman ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab miyyat mar jae to use chhod do"
"1553","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan bin Waqqas al-Ansari ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Meri walida ne mujhe bayan kiya ke woh A'ishah ke paas dakhil huin"
"1554","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur bin Fuzalah ne hamen Hasan se, A'ishah se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ek mangne wali mere paas dakhil hui aur us ke sath us ke do bete the, to Main ne us ke liye teen khajooron ka hukm diya to Us ne apne do bachchon ko ek-ek khajoor khilaaii aur ek khajoor apne munh mein daali donon bachchon ne apni do khajur khayein, phir apni walida ki taraf dekha, to Us ne khajoor apne munh se nikali aur donon ke darmiyan baantii. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas dakhil hue, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aaj Main ne munkar dekha farmaya: Woh Kya? To Main ne Aap khabar di, to farmaya: Tumhen us aurat par Kya ta'ajjub hai jise Allah ne us ke bachche par raham ki wajah se muaf kiya"
"1555","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur bahra as-saqqaa ne kaha, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, aur Unhon ne is hadees jaisa zikr kiya unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke main ro rahi thi, to farmaya: Tumhen Kya rula hai, Aey A'ishah? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, walida aur un ki rehmat — aur Main ne Aap khabar di to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mein se kisi cheez se aazmaya jae aur un ke sath achcha rahe, woh us ke liye aag se parda hongi"
"1556","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek aurat laya gayi Jis ne chori ki thi, to unhon ne kaha: Un ke paas jane ki jurrata kaun kare siwae un ke mahboob Usamah ke? To woh un ke paas aae, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Usamah, Kya tum jante ho gai Isra'il kaise halaak hue? Jab mein se shareef chori karta to kata na jata to us ka hath kata unhon ne kaha: Woh Makhzumi aurat thi"
"1557","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) paanch se witr padhte the, aur kaha: Ham Ahle-Bait hain, paanch se witr padhte hain"
"1558","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu al-Muammal se, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fajr ki do rak'aton ke baad sote the"
"1559","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih Ibn Abi al-akhazara ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye lahd khodii gayi"
"1560","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Iyas bin daghafala ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata Ibn Abi Rabah ko kehte suna: Urwah bin az-Zubair ne mujhe khabar di, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padhte the jabke main un ke aur qible ke darmiyan hoti thi"
"1561","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Zaidah bin Qudamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko teen kapdon mein kafan diya gaya, mein na qamees thi na amama"
"1562","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se nikah kiya jabke main chhe — ya saat — saal ki thi, Makkah mein; aur mujh se sohbat ki Madinah mein jabke main nau saal ki thi mere paas aurten aaeen jabke main gucchedaara balon wali ladki thi, jhoole par khel rahi thi; to Unhon ne mujhe tayyar kiya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko diya"
"1563","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, Urwah bin az-Zubair se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hua, to farmaya: Qabeela ka Kya hi bura aae unhon ne kaha: Jab woh dakhil hua to Aap ne us se narmi ki unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne aisa-aisa kaha, phir Aap ne us se narmi ki! To farmaya: Aey A'ishah, Allah ke han qayamat ke din martabe mein sab bura woh hai jis se log bacen — ya log use karen — us ki behuudagii ke dar se, ya us ki burayi ke dar se"
"1564","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Urwah bin az-Zubair ko suna, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Ham kehte the ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki wafat na hogi yahan tak ke unhen duniya-aakhirat mein ikhtiyar diya jae unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki woh beemari hui jis mein Aap wafat hui, to Aap awaz bhaari hui, aur Main ne Aap farmate suna: {Un ke sath jin par Allah ne inaama kiya, ambiya, siddiiqon, shuhada aur abraar mein se} aayat A'ishah ne kaha: To ham samjhe ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ikhtiyar diya ja raha tha"
"1565","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Urwah bin az-Zubair ko suna, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padhte the jabke main Aap samne laiti leti hoti thi Shu'bah ne kaha: Sa'd ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Jabke main haiz mein hoti thi"
"1566","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr bin Hafs se, unhon ne kaha: Urwah bin az-Zubair ko suna, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne kaha: Tum Kya kehte ho, namaz ko Kya raha hai? Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne kaha: Kutta, gadha aur aurata. to A'ishah ne kaha: Waqt to aurat bura janwar hai; Main ne nafs ko dekha, main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne laiti leti thi janaze ki tarah jabke Aap namaz padhte the"
"1567","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Muhajir aurten Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath apni ooni burdah samete namaz padhti thin, Fajr ke andhere mein pahchani na jati thin"
"1568","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tamattu kiya — ya'ni umrah ke sath — aur Main ne hadi na haankii."
"1569","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek qaayafa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hua jabke Usamah bin Zaid aur Zaid par ek qatiifaa thi, Unhon ne apne sar dhaanpe the aur un ke qadam nazar aa rahe the to qaayafa ne kaha: Yeh qadam ek-doosre mein se hain to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is se khush hue aur is ki khabar A'ishah ko di"
"1570","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi az-Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe daud ki dawat di, to Main ne Aap se daud lagai aur main jiita gayi"
"1571","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Malik bin Juraij ne ham se bayan kiya, Sulaiman bin Musa se, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wali ke baghair nikah nahin; aur jo aurat wali ke baghair nikah kare us ka nikah batil hai, batil hai, batil hai agar us ka koi wali na ho to hakim us ka wali hai jis ka koi wali na ho"
"1572","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Makhlad bin khufaafa al-Ghifari se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Abdul-Aziz ke samne ek ghulam ke bare mein jhagda kiya jo hamen dhoke se becha gaya tha, aur Ham ne us ki aamadanii mein se paya tha, jabke un ke paas Urwah bin az-Zubair the to Urwah ne unhen A'ishah se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla kiya ke Aamdani zamanat ke sath hai"
"1573","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin al-asbahaanii se, Mujahid bin Wardan se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka ek aazad-karda wafat paya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yahan us ki basti walon mein se koi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use us ki virasat di"
"1574","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Kaseer ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Kusoof ki namaz mein buland awaz se qira'at ki"
"1575","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih Ibn Abi al-akhazara ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhri ne kaha: Urwah bin az-Zubair ne mujhe khabar di, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ghaare-Hira se aae to Khadijah ke paas pahunche aur farmaya: Mujhe lihaafa orhaao, mujhe lihaafa orhaao; to lihaafa orhaayaa gaya phir kaha: Aey Khadijah, Allah ki qasam, mujhe apni jaan ka dar hua to Khadijah ne un se kaha: khushkhabri ho; Allah ki qasam, Allah tumhen kabhi zaleel na karega; tum sach jhutlate ho, sila-rehmi karte ho, mehmaan ki izzat karte ho, aur haq ki halakat mein madad karte ho chalo to woh unhen lekar Waraqah ke paas chalin, jo ek boodhe nabina shaikh the, Injeel ibraanii mein padhte the to unhon ne kaha: Aey chacha ke bete, suno jo tumhare bhai ka beta kehta hai to Waraqah ne un se kaha: Aey bhai ke bete, Kya kehte ho? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen khabar di, to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, woh naamuusa hai jo Musa par nazil hua kaash main us din zinda hota jab tumhari qaum tumhen nikaalegii; to tumhari mazboot madad karunga unhon ne kaha: Kya meri qaum mujhe nikaalegii? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan; jo bhi waisa laya jaisa tum jane ho, us se dushmani ki gayi aur use takleef di gayi kaash main us mein jawan hota"
"1576","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-waris ne ham se bayan kiya, burda Abu al-ala se, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main darwaza phailane lagti jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padhte the; to Aap qible ki taraf munh kiye aate aur mere liye karte, phir apni namaz ki taraf aate"
"1577","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih Ibn Abi al-akhazara ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Urwah ne mujhe khabar di, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aaghaaz sachche khvaabon se hui; Aap khwab mein koi khwab na dekhte the magar subah ki pau ki tarah aata tha, aur Aap tanhai mahboob ki gayi to Aap ghaare-Hira mein din theharti ibadat karte, yahan tak ke ek din haq achanak aaya jabke Aap ghaare-Hira mein the"
"1578","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi az-Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, ke Saudah ne apna din A'ishah ko diya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas apni jagah ki wajah se"
"1579","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan as-Sauri ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham bin Urwah ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Quraish kehte the: Ham Baitullah ke rehne wale hain; ham sirf Mina se utarte hain, jabke log Arafat se utarte the to Allah Tabaraka-wa Ta'ala ne nazil kiya: {Phir utren jahan se log utarte}."
"1580","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad Ibn Abi Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ham par chalis raaten aati thin, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ghar mein na diye ki aag jalatii na kisi aur ki unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Tum kis par guzara karti thin? Unhon ne kaha: Do kali cheezon par; khajoor aur paanii."
"1581","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b aur Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Urwah se, A'ishah se, ke Rifa'ah al-Qurazi ne apni biwi ko talaq di aur us ki talaq pakka ki; phir us ke baad Abdur Rahman bin az-Zubair ne us se nikah kiya to woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur zikr kiya ke woh us se sohbat nahin kar sakta, aur apne jilabaaba ke kinare ki taraf ishara kiya to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ke paas kapde ke kinare jaisa hi hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muskuraye hanste hue, phir kaha: Tum us ke liye halal na hogi yahan tak ke woh tumhari usailaa cakhe."
"1582","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab janabat se ghusl karte to shuru karte aur apne hath dhote, phir apne daayen se lekar apne baayen par dalte aur apni sharmgah dhote yahan tak ke saaf karte phir teen martaba kulli karte aur teen martaba naak mein pani carhaate, aur apna chehra teen martaba aur apni bazoo teen-teen martaba dhote, phir apne sar-mukammal par pani dalte jab farigh hote to apne qadam dhote"
"1583","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) saal mein koi Maheena roza na rakhte the siwae shaabaana ke; kyunke woh poora shaabaana roza rakhte the"
"1584","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roze ki haalat mein mera bosa lete the"
"1585","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah aur Ibn Abbas ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Makkah mein das saal thehre, Aap par Wahy nazil hoti thi, aur Madinah mein das saal"
"1586","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har nashawar mashroob haram hai"
"1587","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ko suna, bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah se poocha gaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kaun-sa amal sab pasandeeda tha? To unhon ne kaha: Sab lagaataara."
"1588","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, A'ishah se — ya Abu Hurairah se — shak Abu Dawud se nahin hai — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Amal mein se utna lo jitna saha sako."
"1589","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne mujhe bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do cheezon ke mile nabeez se mana kiya"
"1590","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Salamah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Sahar ne unhen sote ke siwa na paya — ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko"
"1591","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki raat ki namaz ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Aap terah rak'aten padhte the; aath padhte, phir witr padhte, goya nau se witr padhte, phir baithkar do rak'aten padhte jab ruku karna chahte to khade hote aur ruku karte, phir azan-iqamat ke darmiyan do rak'aten padhte — ya'ni Fajr ki namaz ki"
"1592","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Yunus se, az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, A'ishah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Gunah mein koi Nazr nahin, aur us ka kaffara qasam ka kaffara hai"
"1593","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) junub hote hue sote the? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan, aur namaz ka wuzu karte the"
"1594","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere maamuun Haris ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Salamah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chand ki taraf ishara kiya aur farmaya: Is ki burayi se Allah ki panah mango, kyunke woh chaaii andheri raat hai jab badal jae"
"1595","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, mujhe us se bayan kiya Jis ne Abu Salamah ko suna, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne khwab se jage woh apna hath apne pak pani mein na duboe yahan tak ke apne hath par teen lapen kare aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab jagte to aisa na karte the yahan tak ke apne hath par teen martaba dalte"
"1596","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Salih Ibn Abi Hassan se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Main ek majlis mein tha jis mein Ibn Abbas aur Abu Hurairah the, to Unhon ne A'ishah ki taraf bheja: Hamla apni iddat kab poori karti hai? To unhon ne kaha: Subai'ah bint al-Haris ke shauhar ki wafat hui jabke woh hamla thin, to Unhon ne wafat ke teen baad waza kiya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaeen aur Aap ne unhen nikah karne ka hukm diya"
"1597","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salt bin dinar Abu Shu'aib ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah bin suhabaana al-hunaaii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se Allah Tabaraka-wa Ta'ala ke qaul ke bare mein poocha: {Phir Ham ne Kitab ka waris banaya unhen jinhein Ham ne apne bandon mein se muntakhib} aayat to Unhon ne mujh se kaha: Aey mere bete, yeh sab jannat mein hain; aage jahan wala to woh hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein guzra, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki zindagi-rizq ki gawahi di; aur darmiyan wala to woh hai Jis ne us ke nishan par chala us ke sahaba mein se yahan tak ke us se mila; aur apne nafs par zulm karne wala to mere aur tumhare jaisa hai unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne nafs ko hamare sath ginaya"
"1598","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Naufal Ibn Abi akraba ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah se kaha gaya: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas sheir sunaya jata tha? Unhon ne kaha: Woh un ke han sab napasand baat thi"
"1599","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Naufal se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua mein se wasallam ko pasand karte the, aur us ke darmiyan ko chhod dete the"
"1600","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ko suna, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne safar mein woh sab kiya; roza rakha aur iftar kiya"
"1601","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko qurbani ke din Jamrah marne ke baad, Baitullah ka tawaf karne se pahle khushbu lagayi"
"1602","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Iyas Ibn Abi Tamimah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, ke A'ishah ke samne ek aadmi ka zikr hua aur Unhon ne use lanat ki — ya bura di — to un se kaha gaya: Woh mar chuka hai to unhon ne kaha: Main us ke liye Allah se bakhshish mangta hun to un se kaha gaya: Aey Ummul-Mu'minin, Tum ne use lanat ki phir us ke liye bakhshish mangi! To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne murdon ka zikr na karo magar bhalai se"
"1603","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Aey A'ishah, behuudagii agar aadmi hoti to bura aadmi hoti"
"1604","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main raat mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un ke bistar se na pa, aur samajhti ke Aap apni kisi biwi ke paas gae hain; to main Aap paas pahunchee jabke Aap sajde mein the, aur Aap farmate suna: Pak hai, muqaddasa hai, farishton-rooh ka Rabb hai; hamare Rabb ki rehmat us ke gusse se aage hai"
"1605","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Zurarah bin Aufa se, Sa'd bin Hisham se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne poora Maheena roza na rakha siwae Ramazan ke, aur na poori raat subah tak qiyam kiya, aur na ek raat mein poora Quran padha"
"1606","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Zurarah bin Aufa se, Sa'd bin Hisham se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fajr ki do rak'aton ke bare mein farmaya: Woh mujhe surkh oonton se zyada karti hain"
"1607","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Zurarah se, Sa'd bin Hisham se, A'ishah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Jo Quran padhe jabke woh us mein maahira hai, woh izzat wale nek likhne walon ke sath hoga; aur jo Quran padhe — Hisham ne kaha: Jabke woh us par sakht hai — Shu'bah ne kaha: Jabke woh us par mushkil hai — to us ke liye do ajr hain"
"1608","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Zurarah bin Aufa se, Sa'd bin Hisham se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab koi maamuula apanaate to use musalsal karna pasand karte; aur agar beemari ya neend ghalib aati to din mein barah rak'aten padhte"
"1609","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Zurarah bin Aufa se, Sa'd bin Hisham se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne Shihab ek ek aadmi ka zikr hua, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum Hisham ho"
"1610","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi as-safar se, ash-Sha'bi se, Abdur Rahman bin al-Haris bin Hisham se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) junub hote, phir subah karte, phir ghusl karte aur roza rakhte; phir namaz ke liye nikalte aur main Aap qira'at sunatii."
"1611","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman bin al-Haris se, apne walid se, ke unhon ne kaha: Main A'ishah ke paas dakhil hua, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah junub karte, phir ghusl karte, phir masjid ki taraf savere jate jabke un ka sar tapakataa hota, phir us din roza rakhte"
"1612","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Maimun se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne kapde se mani dhote the, phir nikalte jabke woh dhabbe-dhabbe hota tha"
"1613","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nafi' Ibn Umar al-alaihi aur Rabah Ibn Abi Ma'roof ne ham se bayan kiya, donon ne Ibn Abi Mulaikah se suna, unhon ne kaha: Main A'ishah ke paas aaya aur un se woh zikr kiya jo Ibn Umar aur Ibn Abbas ne Umar se bayan kiya tha ke miyyat ko us ke gharwalon ke rone se azab diya jata hai to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, tum mujhe us se khabar dete ho jo na jhoota hai na tohamatazadaa, lekin sunne ghalat hota hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kisi se yeh bayan nahin kiya ke Allah mo'min ko kisi ke rone se azab deta hai; lekin farmaya: Kafir ka azab us ke gharwalon ke us par rone se badhega hai aur Quran mein woh hai jo tumhen kafi hai: {Koi bojh uthane wala kisi doosre ka bojh na uthaaegaa}."
"1614","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir al-khazzaaza ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne unhen — ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko — khushbu lagai jab Unhon ne ehram bandhne ka irada kiya, apni khushbu mein se sab umdah jo main pa sakti thi"
"1615","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, A'ishah se, ke unhen haiz aaya, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tamam manasik karo siwae Baitullah ke tawaf ke"
"1616","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Aban ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Aziz bin rufaia se, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se apni us beemari mein jis mein Aap wafat hui, farmaya: Mere liye Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakr ko bulao, main Abu Bakr ke liye Kitab likhuun jis par mere baad ikhtilaf na ho phir kaha: Chhodo; Allah ki panah ke mo'min Abu Bakr ke bare mein ikhtilaf karen"
"1617","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ismail as-suddii se, Abdullah al-bahii se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ramazan mein se jo mujh par tha us ki qaza na karti thi siwae shaabaana mein, yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki wafat hui"
"1618","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abdullah al-bahii se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Mujhe masjid se jae-namaz do to unhon ne kaha: Main haiz mein hun to farmaya: Tumhara haiz tumhare hath mein nahin"
"1619","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin al-muntashira ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zuhr se pahle chaar aur Fajr ki namaz se pahle do rak'aten na chhodte the"
"1620","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Khaithamah ko suna, Abu atiyah al-vaadiiii se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Masrooq A'ishah ke paas dakhil hue — ya kaha: Ham A'ishah ke paas dakhil hue — to ham ne kaha: Aey Ummul-Mu'minin, mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se do aadmi hain; ek iftar mein jaldi karta hai aur sahar mein der karta hai, aur doosra iftar mein der karta hai aur sahar mein jaldi karta hai to unhon ne kaha: Woh kaun hai jo iftar mein jaldi karta hai aur sahar mein der karta hai? Ham ne kaha: bin masauuda. unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aise hi karte the"
"1621","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Khaithamah ko suna, Abu atiyah al-vaadiiii se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah ko kehte suna: Allah ki qasam, main janta hun Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka talbiyah kya tha phir Main ne unhen talbiyah kehte suna: Labbaik Allahumma Labbaik, Labbaik La shareeka laka Labbaik, innal-hamda vanniamataa laka."
"1622","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Miqdam bin Shuraih se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main bartan se piitii thi, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use lete aur apna munh wahin rakhte jahan mera munh hota tha; aur main haddi nocatii thi, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use lete aur apna munh wahin rakhte jahan mera munh hota tha"
"1623","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Miqdam bin Shuraih se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne mujh se kaha: jo tumhen bayan kare ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khade kar peshab kiya, use na maano; kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne peshab nahin kiya magar baithakara."
"1624","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Miqdam bin Shuraih se, apne walid se, A'ishah se, ke woh oont par thin aur use maarakara pherne mani, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey A'ishah, narmi ikhtiyar karo; kyunke woh kisi cheez mein na hui magar use khubsurat bakhshii, aur kisi cheez se na nikali gayi magar use badanumaa kiya"
"1625","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-jaunii se, Yazid bin Babnus se, unhon ne kaha: Ham A'ishah ke paas dakhil hue, aur hamare sath ek aadmi tha; to Us ne un se poocha aur kaha: Aey Ummul-Mu'minin, Iraq ke bare mein Kya kehti ho? To unhon ne kaha: Haiz? To kaha: Aey Ahle-Iraq, Kya tum waisa nahin kehte jaisa Allah Azza-wa Jall ne kaha? Phir kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mujh se mubashirat the, aur mere sar se nafa uthate the jabke main haiz mein hoti thi, aur mujh par izaar hota tha"
"1626","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Abu Malih al-Huzali se, ke himsa walon mein se — ya Sham walon mein se — kuch aurten A'ishah ke paas dakhil huin, to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum Wahy ho jin ki aurten ghuslakhaanon mein dakhil hoti hain? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi aurat nahin jo apne shauhar ke ghar ke siwa apne kapde utare, magar Us ne apne aur Allah ke darmiyan ka parda chaakon kiya"
"1627","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Khumair se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Musa an-nasarii se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne mujh se kaha: raat ka qiyam na chhodo; kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use na chhodte the, aur jab beemar hote — ya kaha: Peeth hote — to baithkar namaz padhte the"
"1628","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ubaidullah al-Jadali ko suna, kehte hue: Main ne A'ishah se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke akhlaq ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Woh ghaflat gandi, behuudagii karne wale, aur bazaron mein shora karne wale na the; burayi ka badla burayi se na dete the, lekin muaf karte aur darguzar karte the — ya kaha: Muaf karte aur bakhshate the; Abu Dawud ko shak hua"
"1629","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Maisarah se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mein se ek ko hukm dete jabke woh haiz mein hoti ke izaar bandhe, phir un ke sath un ke lihaafa mein dakhil ho"
"1630","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Sa'id bin al-Musayyab se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch fasiq maare jate hain hal-haram mein: Chuha, bichchu, cheel, katne wala kutta, aur citakabaraa kauaa."
"1631","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi az-Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ali bin Husain se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roze ki haalat mein bosa lete the"
"1632","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Talha bin Abdullah bin Auf ko suna, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) meri taraf jhuke taake mera bosa len; to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main rozedar hun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur main bhi rozedar hun phir un ka bosa liya"
"1633","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin al-Fazl ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ali se, A'ishah se, ke woh qarz leti thin, to un se kaha gaya: Aey Ummul-Mu'minin, tumhen qarz se Kya? To unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo ada karne ki niiyata kare, Allah ki madad us ke sath hoti hai; aur main us madad ko talash karti hun"
"1634","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Umarah Ibn Abi Hafsah se, Ikrimah se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne kaha: Ek tajir saaman lekar aaya, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaash Aap apne yeh do mote kapde utar den, aur falan tajir ki taraf bhejen aur woh Aap aasani tak do kapde beche? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bheja: Mujhe aasani tak do kapde bhejo. to us ne kaha: Muhammad mera maal le jana chahta hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, Unhon ne jaan liya hai ke main mein sab zyada ameen hun, aur Allah Azza-wa Jall se sab zyada darne wala hun — ya is ke tarah"
"1635","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, Abu Qilabah ko suna, Abdullah bin Yazid se — A'ishah ke razai — A'ishah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Koi aadmi nahin jis par logon ki ek jama'at namaz padhe, sab us ki shafa'at karen, magar un ki shafa'at us ke haq mein qabool hogi"
"1636","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Warqa ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ki koi namaz ho aur us par neend ghalib aae — ya us se sota rahe — to Allah us ke liye us ki namaz ka ajr likhta hai, aur us ki neend Allah ki taraf se Sadqa hai jo Us ne us par kiya"
"1637","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, aabisa bin Rabi'ah se, unhon ne kaha: Main A'ishah ke paas aaya aur kaha: Aey Ummul-Mu'minin, Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne teen din se zyada qurbani ke gosht haram kiye the? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin; mein se qurbani karne wale thode the, to hukm diya ke Jis ne qurbani ki woh use khilaya Jis ne qurbani na ki aur Main ne hamen dekha, ham qurbani ke pae chhipate the aur daswin ke baad khate the"
"1638","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran se, Talha bin Abdullah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere do padosi hain, to main kise hadiya dun? Farmaya: Mein se jis ka darwaza tum qareeb ho"
"1639","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ishaq ne ham se bayan kiya, bin Abbad se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki wafat hui aur Unhon ne Aap ghusl dena chaha, to un par neend farigh, yahan tak ke mein se har ek ka hath us ki thodhi par tha to ghar ki taraf se pukara gaya: Unhen kapdon ke upar se ghusl do A'ishah ne kaha: Agar mujhe woh ma'loom hota jo baad mein ma'loom hua, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un ki biwiyon ke siwa koi ghusl na deta"
"1640","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin al-Fazl ne ham se bayan kiya, Sumamah bin Hazn se, unhon ne kaha: Main A'ishah se mila aur un se nabeez ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumbe, roghan lage bartan, naqeer aur lakdi se mana kiya aur ek Habshi bandi ko bulaya aur kaha: Is se poocho, kyunke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye nabeez banaatii thi to us ne kaha: Main un ke liye mashkize mein nabeez banaatii thi, phir us ka munh bandhti aur latakaatii thi; jab subah hoti to Aap peete the"
"1641","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad Ibn Abi Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Amr bin Umayyah az-Zamri ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, ke woh A'ishah ke paas dakhil hue aur un se kaha: main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun, Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Tum ne unhen kisi cheez mein diya woh tumhare liye Sadqa hai? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, Ji Haan; Aey Allah, Ji Han"
"1642","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Abu Usman se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: Aey Allah, mujhe mein kar jo jab bhalai karen to khush hon, aur jab burayi karen to bakhshish mango"
"1643","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais aur Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, Amr bin Maimun al-Audi se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roze ke mahine mein bosa lete the aur Qais ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roze ki haalat mein bosa lete the"
"1644","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib bin Yazid al-anamaatii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin harima ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir bin Zaid se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Makkah mein do rak'aten padhte the — ya'ni farz — phir jab Madinah aae, aur Aap par chaar aur teen farz huin, to padhin, aur woh do rak'aten choriin jo Makkah mein padhte the, musafir ke liye poori karte hue"
"1645","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Wa'il ko suna, kehte hue: A'ishah ne kaha: Main ne kisi ko nahin dekha jis par takleef Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zyada zahir ho"
"1646","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Rashid ne ham se bayan kiya, makahuula se: A'ishah se kaha gaya: Abu Hurairah kehte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Manahuusiyata teen mein hai: Ghar mein, aurat mein aur ghode mein to A'ishah ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ne yaad na rakha; kyunke woh dakhil hue jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farma rahe the: Allah Yahud se lade; woh kehte hain: Manahuusiyata teen mein hai: Ghar mein, aurat mein aur ghode mein to Unhon ne hadees ka aakhir suna aur us ka shuru na suna"
"1647","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Malik bin urfutaa se, Abd Khair se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumbe, lakdi aur roghan lage bartan se mana kiya"
"1648","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Imran al-jaunii ne mujhe khabar di, ek aadmi se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khadijah ke sath ek Maheena e'tikaf kiya, to woh Ramazan se mila phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nikle aur suna: Assalamu alaikum unhon ne kaha: To Main ne samjha ke woh jinn ka achanak aana hai to farmaya: Khushkhabri ho; kyunke salam bhalai hai phir doosre din Jibreel ko suraj par dekha; un ka ek par Mashriq mein aur ek par Maghrib mein tha, to main un se darii. unhon ne kaha: To woh apne gharwalon ki taraf chale, aur Jibreel un ke aur darwaze ke darmiyan the unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne mujh se baat ki yahan tak ke main un se maanuusa hui, phir Unhon ne mujh se ek wa'de ka wa'da kiya unhon ne kaha: To main un ke wa'de par aai, aur Jibreel mujh par ruk gaye phir jab Unhon ne laut ka irada kiya to woh the aur miikaaiila un ke sath the to Jibreel zameen par utre, aur miikaaiila aasman-zameen ke darmiyan rahe unhon ne kaha: To Jibreel ne mujhe pakda aur gudi ki mithas ke liye cita litaya, aur mera pet kar us mein se jo Allah ne chaha nikali, phir use sone ke tasale mein dhoya, phir use us mein diya, phir mujhe bartan kiya jaise bartan bartan kiya jata hai, phir meri peeth par mohar lagai yahan tak ke Main ne mohar ka chhoone paya phir mujh se kaha: {padho apne Rabb ke naam se} — aur Main ne kabhi koi Kitab na padhi thi — to Unhon ne mera halaq pakda yahan tak ke main rone ko aai phir mujh se kaha: {padho apne Rabb ke naam se Jis ne paida kiya, insan ko aalaqa se paida kiya} us ke qaul tak Ta'ala: {Jo na janta tha}. unhon ne kaha: Us ke baad main kuch na bhuulii. unhon ne kaha: Phir mujhe ek aadmi se taula aur main bhaari rahi, phir mujhe doosre se taula aur main bhaari rahi, phir mujhe sau se taula, to miikaaiila ne kaha: Kaabe ke Rabb ki qasam, un ki ummat ne un ki pairwi ki unhon ne kaha: Phir main apne ghar aai, aur mujhe koi pathar-pera na milta tha magar kehta: Assalamu alaika ya rasuulallaaha, yahan tak ke main Khadijah ke paas dakhil huin, to unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaika ya rasuulallaaha."
"1649","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Ali bin Husain se, Zakwan se, A'ishah se, ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zul-Zulhijjah ke chaar — ya paanch — guzarne par aae, aur mere paas dakhil hue jabke gusse mein the to main ne kaha: Jis ne Aap gussa dilaya, Ya Rasulullah, Allah use aag mein dakhil kare farmaya: Kya tum nahin jaanatiin ke Main ne logon ko ek hukm diya, aur woh hicakicaa rahe hain? Hakam ne kaha: Goya woh lakariyaan hain — agar mujhe woh ma'loom hota jo baad mein ma'loom hua, to hadi na hankata yahan tak ke khareedega, phir halal hota jaise woh halal hue"
"1650","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, Khalid Ibn Abi as-Salt se, Iraq se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jab pahunchi to baithne ki jagah ka hukm diya aur use qible ki taraf kiya"
"1651","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Nafi' ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne — ya'ni un ke walid ne — mujhe khabar di, Sa'ib se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghar ke saanpon ke qatl se mana kiya — ya'ni saanpon mein se — siwae chhoti gunah wale aur do dhaariyon wale ke; kyunke woh nazar uchak lete hain, aur aurton ke peton mein hamal maar dete hain jo unhen na maare woh mein se nahin"
"1652","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Amr bin ghalib se, ke A'ishah ne Ammar se kaha: Aey Ammar, tum jaan chuke ho jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman ka khoon halal nahin siwae teen mein se ek se; ek aadmi jo Islam ke baad kufr kare, ya ihsan ke baad zina kare, ya qatl kare to qatl kiya jae"
"1653","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Azraq bin Qais se, Zakwan se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khumaraa par namaz padhte the"
"1654","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah aur mubarak bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-jaunii se, Yazid bin Babnus se, unhon ne kaha: Ham A'ishah ke paas dakhil hue aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki wafat ka zikr kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr dakhil hue aur un ke donon rukhsaron ke darmiyan bose dene lage, aur kaho rahe the: Aey mere Nabi, Aey mere baraguziidaa."
"1655","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin al-ala al-yashkurii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih bin sarja ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abdul-Qais mein se, Imran bin Hittan se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah ko kehte suna, jabke un ke samne qaaziyon ka zikr hua, to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Adil Qazi qayamat ke din laya jaega, aur hisab ki aisi sakhti paega ke tamanna karega kaash Us ne do ke darmiyan ek khajoor mein bhi kabhi faisla na kiya hota"
"1656","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin budaila al-Uqaili ne ham se bayan kiya — Basri, siqah, Urwah — apne walid se, Abu al-jauzaa se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz takbir se shuru karte the aur qira'at {sab tareef Allah ke liye jo jahanon ka Rabb hai} se jab ruku karte to sar na uthate na jhukate, lekin darmiyan mein rakhte; jab sar uthate to seedhe khade hone tak sajdah na karte; jab sajdah karke sar uthate to seedhe baithne tak sajdah na karte; aur apna baen qadam bichhate aur apna dayan qadam khada rakhte; aur har do rak'aton mein kehte: Attahiyyaata; aur shaitan ki era se aur darinde-kutte ki tarah bichane se mana karte the; aur namaz salam par khatm karte the"
"1657","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fajr se pahle do rak'aten padhte the, mein Surah-Fatiha ke andaze padhte the"
"1658","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas dakhil hue, to Main ne Aap samne gosht ya haddi pesh ki, aur kaha: Yeh us mein se hai jo Barirah hamare paas laaiin. to farmaya: Woh us ke liye Sadqa hai, aur hamare liye tohafaa."
"1659","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq bin Sa'id al-Qurashi ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin al-Aas ki aulaad mein se, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ke samne Ramazan ke mahine ke untees din ke roze ka zikr hua aur is par ta'ajjub kiya gaya, to A'ishah ne kaha: Tumhen is mein Kya ta'ajjub hai? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath untees utane nahin rakhe jitne tees rakhe"
"1660","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mu'az ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek din mere paas dakhil hue aur farmaya: Tumhare paas kuch hai? Main ne kaha: Nahin farmaya: Waqt main rozedar hun aur doosre din mere paas dakhil hue aur farmaya: Tumhare paas kuch hai? Main ne kaha: Ji Han farmaya: Waqt main iftar karta hun, chahe Main ne roza farz kiya ho"
"1661","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Imran bin Bashir se, Salim Sablan se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah ko apne bhai se kehte suna: Aey Abdur Rahman, wuzu poora karo; kyunke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Qayamat ke din Aediyon ke liye aag se halakat hai"
"1662","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin dinar ne ham se bayan kiya, Salim bin Abdullah Ibn Umar se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Mina mein Baitullah ka tawaf karne se pahle khushbu lagayi"
"1663","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Shu'aib Salt bin dinar ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Shaqeeq ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Chasht padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, siwae is ke ke apne safar se aayein"
"1664","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salt ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Shaqeeq ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do suraten milate the? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, siwae Mufassal mein se"
"1665","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se poocha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mahine ke jane-pehchane din roza rakhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han"
"1666","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Raziyallahu al-avara ne ham se bayan kiya, budaila al-Uqaili se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se, A'ishah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke Aap ne padha: {Faravhuna wa raihaana}."
"1667","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sabit Abu Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim al-Raziyallahu se, Abdullah bin al-Haris se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab namaz se salam pherte to izafa hi theharti ke kehte: Aey Allah, Tu salam hai aur tujh se salam hai; barkat wala hai Tu, Aey jalal-ikaraama len"
"1668","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Mutarrif se, A'ishah se, ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye oon ki ek kali Burdah banai, to Aap ne Ise pahna aur Aap achchi lagi; phir jab is mein pasiinaa aaya aur ooni kapde ki bu pa to Ise phenk diya"
"1669","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, apni phuphi se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh us ke liye halal na hogi yahan tak ke us ki usailaa cakhe."
"1670","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Hameed bin Jubair al-Makki ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Safiyyah bint Shaibah ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ummul-Mu'minin A'ishah ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, log do nusuk ke sath jaen aur main ek nusuk ke sath lautuun? To Unhon ne mere bhai Abdur Rahman ko hukm diya, aur Unhon ne mujhe Tan'im se umrah karaya, aur mujhe garmi raat mein oont par apne peeche bithaya to main apni dupatta se nikalne lagi, to Unhon ne apne hath ki kisi cheez se mujhe mara to main ne kaha: Kya tum kisi ko dekhte ho? Phir Main ne umrah kiya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai jabke woh apni jagah the, hue na the"
"1671","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Aal-Shaibah mein se Makki Abdul-Hameed bin Jubair se, Safiyyah bint Shaibah se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya main Kaabe mein namaz padhuun? To farmaya: Hijr mein padho, kyunke woh Kaabe mein se hai — ya kaha: Baitullah mein se"
"1672","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais bin ar-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, Bajali Ibrahim bin al-Muhajir se, Safiyyah bint Shaibah se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Falan bin falan ansaariyaa aaeen aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, janabat ka ghusl kya hai? Farmaya: Tum se ek shuru kare aur wuzu kare, apne sar ke daayen hisse se shuru kare, phir baayen se, yahan tak ke sar ki jaren saaf kare phir kaha: Kya tum janta ho sar ki jaren Kya hain? Unhon ne kaha: Khaala. farmaya: Sach kaha; phir baqi mukammal par kare unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, haiz ka ghusl kya hai? Farmaya: Tum se ek apni beri aur pani le, aur us se paki kare aur achchi paki kare, phir apne sar ke daayen hisse se shuru kare, phir baayen se, yahan tak ke sar ki jaren saaf kare, phir baqi mukammal par phenke, phir mushk laga kapda lekar us se paki kare unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main us se paki kaise karun? To Main ne un se kaha: Allah! Tum khoon ke wasallam par calogii."
"1673","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha:... ne Safiyyah se, A'ishah se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sa' se ghusl karte the, aur mudd se wuzu karte the"
"1674","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Hasan bin Muslim ko suna, Safiyyah se, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, ke Ansar mein se ek aurat ke baal jhade, to Unhon ne mein jod lagana chaha; to is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya gaya, to Aap ne baal jodne wali aur judwane wali par lanat ki"
"1675","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin bahadalaa se, riwayat bin Hubaish se, ke ek aadmi ne A'ishah se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki virasat ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Nahin; Allah ki qasam, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne na dinar chhoda na dirham, na bakri na oont, na ghulam na baandii."
"1676","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, budaila al-Uqaili se, Abdullah bin Ubaid bin Umair al-Laisi se, mein se Umm-Kulsoom ek ek aurat se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne chhe sahaba mein khana kha rahe the, to ek dehati aaya aur do luqmon mein kha gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar, agar Us ne Allah ka naam liya hota to tumhen kafi hota; jab tum se ek khae aur Allah ka naam le bhool to kahe: Bismillaahi avvalahuu wa aakhirahuu."
"1677","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin mihazama ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Karimah bint Hammam at-taaiyyaa ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ham Masjid-haram mein the aur A'ishah us mein thin, to ham un ke paas baithe to ek aurat ne un se kaha: Aey Ummul-Mu'minin, khizab mein mehndi ke bare mein Kya kehti ho? To unhon ne kaha: Mere mahboob is ki bu pasand na karte the"
"1678","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik bin Anas ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Abdullah bin Qusait se, Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Sauban se, un ki walida se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne murdaara ki khalon ki ruksat di jab dabaghat di jaen — ya kaha: Pak hon"
"1679","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabr bin Habib se, Umm-Kulsoom se, A'ishah se, ke woh namaz padh rahi thin, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Wasallam dua se dua karo jab woh farigh huin to Aap se is ke bare mein poocha, to farmaya: Kaho: Aey Allah, main tujh se tamam bhalai mangta hun, jo main janta hun aur jo nahin janta; aur Teri panah mangta hun tamam burayi se; jo main janta hun aur jo nahin janta; aur Teri panah mangta hun aag se aur jo us se qareeb kare — ya us se qareeb ho — qaul ya amal se Aey Allah, main tujh se jannat mangta hun aur jo us se qareeb kare qaul ya amal se Aey Allah, main tujh se us bhalai ki mang karti hun jo Tere bande-Rasulullah Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tujh se mangi, aur Teri panah mangta hun us burayi se jis ki Tere bande-Rasulullah Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tujh se panah mangi; aur jo faisla Tu mere liye kare — ya kaha: Jo muamla — us ka muamle mere liye hidayat karo"
"1680","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid Abi al-Azhar az-Zubai al-qassaama ar-rishka se, muaazaa al-adaviyyaa se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se kaha: Kya haizah namaz ki qaza karti hai? Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum haruurii ho? Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein haiz mein hoti thin; Kya ham qaza karti thin?."
"1681","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Muaazaa ko kehte suna: Main ne A'ishah se poocha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Chasht padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan, chaar rak'aten, aur jitna Allah chahe zyada"
"1682","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid se, muaazaa ko suna, Main ne A'ishah se kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mahine ke teen din roza rakhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Han main ne kaha: Mahine ke kis hisse se? Unhon ne kaha: Unhen parwah na thi kis se roza rakhte"
"1683","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim al-Raziyallahu se, muaazaa se, A'ishah se: Main aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek bartan se ghusl karte the, yahan tak ke farmate: Mere liye bacha, mere liye bacha"
"1684","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais bin ar-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Ishaq se, A'ishah bint Talha se, A'ishah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Ansar ka ek bachcha laya gaya taake Aap us par namaz karte to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, use Tooba ho; jannat ki ciriyon mein se ek chidiya, Jis ne kabhi burayi na ki aur na use janta to farmaya: Aey A'ishah, Kya tum nahin jaanatiin ke Allah Azza-wa Jall ne jannat paida ki, aur us ke liye log paida kiye; use un ke liye paida kiya jabke woh apne baapon ki pushton mein the aur aag paida ki, aur us ke liye log paida kiye; use un ke liye paida kiya jabke woh apne baapon ki pushton mein the"
"1685","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais bin ar-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, qaabuusa Ibn Abi zibyaana se, Umm-Ja'far se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Aap Zuhr se pahle chaar padhte the; mein qiyam lamba karte aur mein ruku-sajdah achcha karte lekin jo Aap na chhodte the; tandurusta ya beemar, hazir ya ghaaiba, woh Fajr se pahle do rak'aten hain"
"1686","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Aqeel ne ham se bayan kiya, buhayyaa se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mushrikon ke bachchon ke bare mein poocha, to farmaya: Woh aag mein hain, Aey aayashaa. main ne kaha: Musalmanon ke bachchon ke bare mein Kya kehte ho? Farmaya: Woh jannat mein hain, Aey aayashaa. main ne kaha: Kaise?! Unhon ne amal na pae, aur un par qalam na chale? Farmaya: Tumhara Rabb behtar janta hai jo woh karne wale hote"
"1687","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far bin buraida ne ham se bayan kiya — ya bin burda ne — Umm-Salim se, A'ishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi se farmaya: Tumhare ghar mein kitni barkat hai? Ya'ni ek ya do bakriyan"
"1688","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sakan bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saariyyaa ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ne hamen bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roze ki haalat mein un ka bosa lete the"
"1689","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Quriibaa ke aazad-karda Asim ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Quriibaa ko suna, A'ishah se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wisal se mana kiya unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap to wisal karte hain farmaya: Main raat guzarta hun, mera Rabb mujhe khilata-pilata hai"
"1690","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Umarah bin Umair se, apni walida se, A'ishah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Aadmi ki aulaad us ki kamai mein se hai, us ki sab umdah kamai mein se; to un ke maal mein se khao"
"1691","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman se: Amrah ko suna, A'ishah se bayan karte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Fajr nikalti to do rak'aten padhte — Shu'bah ne kaha: Mera zyada ilm hai ke unhon ne kaha: Unhen halki karte; Shu'bah ko un ke halki karne mein shak hua — A'ishah ne kaha: To main kehti hun: Mein Surah-Fatiha padhte hain"
"1692","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Amrah se, A'ishah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chor ka hath chauthai dinar aur upar mein kata jata hai"
"1693","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Amrah se, A'ishah se, ke Zainab bint Jahsh ko saat saal istihaza raha, to Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha, to Aap ne unhen hukm diya ke ghusl karen aur namaz padhe; to woh har namaz ke liye ghusl karti thin"
"1694","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Umayyah bint Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se Allah Azza-wa Jall ke qaul ke bare mein poocha: {Agar tum zahir karo jo tumhare dilon mein hai ya chipaao, Allah tum us ka hisab milayega}. aur un se Allah Azza-wa Jall ke qaul ke bare mein poocha: {Jo burayi kare us ka badla paega}. to unhon ne kaha: Tum ne mujh se aisi cheez poocha hai jo mujh se kisi ne nahin poocha jabase Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha tha to farmaya: Yeh bande se Allah Azza-wa Jall ka pakaranaa hai us par jo use pahunche; bukhar, ghum aur museebat mein se, yahan tak ke saaman jise woh apni aasteen mein rakhe aur raghbat de, phir us ke liye kar aur use apne seene mein pae; yahan tak ke banda apne gunahon se nikalta hai jaise surkh Sona bhatthii se nikalta hai"
"1695","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ummul-Mughirah ne mujhe khabar di, Ansar ki ek aazad-karda, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se resham ke bare mein poocha jo aurten pahanti hain, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein hamen kapde pehnaye jate the jinhein siiraa kaha jata tha, mein resham hota tha"
"1696","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Abu az-Zuha ko suna, shutaira bin soorat se, Hafsah se — Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi — bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roze ki haalat mein bosa lete the"
"1697","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Safiyyah bint Abi Ubaid se, Hafsah se — ya A'ishah se, ya donon se — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us aurat ke liye jo Allah-aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti hai, halal nahin ke kisi miyyat par teen din se zyada soga kare, siwae shauhar par"
"1698","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sakhr bin Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein khwab dekhte the aur Aap se bayan karte the, to Aap us mein jo Allah chahta kehte the to ek raat Main ne apne dil mein kaha: Agar tum bhalai hoti to tum bhi khwab dekhte jaise log dekhte hain phir kaha: Aey Allah, agar Tu mujh mein bhalai janta hai to mujhe dikha jab main soya to khwab mein dekha goya do farishte mere paas aae, har ek ke hath mein lohe ka hathauraa tha; woh mujhe le chale yahan tak ke mujhe jahannam par khada kiya, jabke woh mujhe bazuon se pakde the; aur jahannam lipti hui thi to main ne kaha: Main jahannam se Allah ki panah mangta hun yahan tak ke ek farishta aaya aur kaha: Tum dare nahin; tum Kya hi husn aadmi ho, agar tum zyada namaz padhte Ibn Umar ne kaha: Jab subah hui to main Hafsah ke paas savere gaya aur un se Ise bayan kiya, to Hafsah ne Ise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Abdullah nek aadmi hai Nafi' ne kaha: Us ke baad Abdullah zyada namaz padhte the"
"1699","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humaid bin Nafi' ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Zainab bint Umm-Salamah ko suna, Umm-Salamah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwiyon mein se ek aurat se bayan karte hue, ke us ka koi qareeb mara, to Us ne zard rang mangwaya aur us se ponchhne lagi, aur kehne lagi: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Us aurat ke liye jo Allah-aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti hai, halal nahin ke kisi miyyat par teen se zyada soga kare, siwae shauhar par; chaar mahine das din Malik ne Ise Abdullah Ibn Abi Bakr se, Humaid bin Nafi' se, Zainab bint Umm-Salamah se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Zainab bint Jahsh ke paas dakhil huin"
"1700","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humaid bin Nafi' ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Zainab bint Umm-Salamah ko suna, Umm-Habibah bint Abi Sufyan se bayan karte hue, ke us ka koi qareeb mara, to Us ne zard rang mangwaya aur us se ponchhne lagi, aur kehne lagi: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Us aurat ke liye jo Allah-aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti hai, halal nahin ke kisi miyyat par teen se zyada soga kare, siwae shauhar par; chaar mahine das din"
"1701","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nu'man bin Salim se: Amr bin Aws ko suna; anbasaa Ibn Abi Sufyan ko suna, Umm-Habibah se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo din-raat mein farz ke siwa barah rak'aten padhe, us ke liye jannat mein ghar banaya jayega Umm-Habibah ne kaha: Main ne us ke baad unhen na chhod anbasaa ne kaha: Main ne us ke baad unhen na chhod Amr ne kaha: Main ne us ke baad unhen na chhod Nu'man ne kaha: Aur main us ke baad shayad hi unhen deta hun"
"1702","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, ke ek aadmi Umm-Habibah ke paas dakhil hua — Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi — to Unhon ne us ke liye sattu — ya khana — mangavaayaa. phir un se kaha: Aey bhai ke bete, wuzu karo; kyunke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Wuzu us se hai jise aag ne badla — ya kaha: Jise aag ne chhua"
"1703","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Rabbihi se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah aur Ibn Abbas ko suna, us aurat ke bare mein ikhtilaf karte hue jis ka shauhar mar jae jabke woh hamla ho; Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Do muddaton mein se baad wali; aur Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Jab woh apne pet ka bachcha jana de to halal hui to Unhon ne mujhe Umm-Salamah ke paas bheja; main un ke paas aaya aur un se poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Subai'ah bint al-Haris ne apne shauhar ki wafat ke pandrah baad waza kiya, aur do aadmiyon ne unhen paigham diya, aur woh ek ki taraf kar huin; to unhen dar hua ke woh nafs faisla karengii, to unhon ne kaha: Tumhare liye shauhar halal nahin to woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaeen aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, to farmaya: Haan, tumhare liye shauhar halal hue, to jis se chaho nikah karo"
"1704","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Sabit al-Bunani ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Shahr bin Haushab se, Umm-Salamah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke Aap ne padha: {Amaluna ghairu Salih}."
"1705","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Hasan se, zabbaa bin Mihsan se, Umm-Salamah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zimmedar honge; tum pahacaanoge aur inkar karoge. jo inkar kare woh bari hua, aur jo napasand kare woh samet raha, lekin jo razi ho aur pairwi kare to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya ham un ke ashraar ko qatl na karen? To farmaya: Nahin, jab tak woh namaz karte"
"1706","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humaid bin Nafi' al-Madani ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zainab bint Umm-Salamah ko suna, apni walida Umm-Salamah se bayan karte hue, ke ek aurat ka shauhar mar gaya aur us ki aankhon ki shikayat hui; to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya: Kya woh surmaa lagae? To farmaya: Nahin; tum se ek apne shauhar ke ghar mein saal bhar thaharatii thi — ya kaha: Apne ghar ke purana saaman mein saal bhar — phir jab kutta guzarne to gobar phenkti, phir nikalatii. nahin, yahan tak ke chaar mahine das din guzaren."
"1707","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, Umm-Salamah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke ghar mein Asr ke baad do rak'aten padhin, to Unhon ne Aap se is ke bare mein poocha, to farmaya: Main Zuhr ke baad do rak'aten padhta tha, to wafd aaya aur mujhe mashghool kiya"
"1708","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub aur Khalid al-Hazza ne mujhe khabar di, Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hamari walida ne hamein khabar di, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi Umm-Salamah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ammar ke bare mein farmaya: Tumhen baghi giroh qatl karega"
"1709","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin al-Fazl ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ali se, Umm-Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hajj har kamzor ka jihad hai"
"1710","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abdullah bin Wahb se, Umm-Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein Busrah ki taraf tijarat ko nikle"
"1711","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sakhr bin Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Zaid bin Abdullah Ibn Umar se, Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakr se, Umm-Salamah se — unhon ne kaha: Umm-Salamah Abdur Rahman ki khala thin — unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo chandi ke bartan mein peeta hai, woh jahannam ki aag hi gharagaraataa hai — ya kaha: Goya woh apne pet mein jahannam ki aag gharagaraataa hai"
"1712","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin jumahaana se, unhon ne kaha: Safinah ne mujhe khabar di — Umm-Salamah ke aazad-karda — unhon ne kaha: Umm-Salamah ne mujhe aazad kiya, aur mujh par shart lagai ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki paas karun jab tak Aap zinda rahen"
"1713","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Abu Salamah se, Umm-Salamah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do mahine milaakara roza na rakhte the siwae shaabaana-Ramazan ke"
"1714","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Hindun bint al-Haris al-qurashiyyaa se, Umm-Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab namaz se salam pherte to apni jagah thodi der ke siwa na theharti yahan tak ke khade hote Zuhri ne kaha: Ham samajhte hain ke woh aurton ki wajah se tha taake woh chali jaen"
"1715","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Musa Ibn Abi A'ishah se, Umm-Salamah ke ek aazad-karda se, Umm-Salamah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Fajr padhte to farmate: Aey Allah, main tujh se nafa ilm, pak rizq aur maqbool amal mangta hun"
"1716","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Sa'id bin al-Musayyab se, Amir Ibn Abi Umayyah se — Umm-Salamah ke bhai — Umm-Salamah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah junub karte, phir ghusl karte aur roza rakhte Sa'id ne kaha: To Abu Hurairah ne apna fatwa diya"
"1717","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Ash-Sha'bi ko suna, Umm-Salamah se bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab apne ghar se nikalte to farmate: Aey Allah, main Teri panah mangta hun is se ke phisaluun, ya gumrah hun, ya zulm karun, ya mujh par zulm ho, ya jahalat karun, ya mujh par jahalat ki jae"
"1718","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ka'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Shahr bin Haushab se, unhon ne kaha: Main Umm-Salamah ke paas dakhil hua aur un se kaha: mujhe batao Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sab zyada kis se dua karte the to unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sab zyada dua thi: Aey dilon ke pherne wale, mere dil ko apne deen par Sabit rakho to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya Aap is se zyada dua karte hain? To farmaya: Adam ke bete ka dil Rahman Azza-wa Jall ki do ungliyon ke darmiyan hai; jo chahe seedha rakhe, aur jo chahe tedha kare"
"1719","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ko suna, Umm-Salamah se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, un ki wafat na hui — ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki — yahan tak ke Aap zyada namaz baithkar thi; aur Aap sab pyare amal woh the jin par hamesha kiya jae chahe thode hon"
"1720","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aamil Abu al-ala ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, Umm-Salamah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nauraa lagate the aur apni sharmgah apne hath se karte the"
"1721","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Yunus al-Qushairi se, Ubaidullah bin al-Qibtiyah se, Umm-Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ek qaum Baitullah ka qasda karti pahunchegi, yahan tak ke jab woh zameen ke Baida mein honge to mein dhansaayaa jayega to kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, mein majboor bhi hai! Farmaya: Woh apni niiyaton par uthae jayenge"
"1722","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan as-Sauri ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, Wahb se — Abu Ahmad ke aazad-karda — Umm-Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke main dupatta orha rahi thi, to farmaya: Ek palla, do pat nahin"
"1723","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Mulaikah ko kehte suna: Umm-Salamah ne A'ishah par ciikha suni, to apni bandi ko bheja: Dekho Us ne Kya kiya to woh aai aur kaha: Woh wafat pa cukiin. to unhon ne kaha: Allah un par raham kare; us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sab logon mein sab mahboob thin siwae un ke walid ke"
"1724","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad Ibn Abi Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Muttalib bin Abdullah bin Hantab se, Umm-Salamah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ki do betiyan ya do behnein ya qurbadari wali do aurten hon, aur woh un par kharch kare yahan tak ke woh unhen kafi ho, ya Allah unhen apne Fazl se ghani kare, to woh us ke liye aag se hijab hongi"
"1725","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id Ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi se, Abu Murrah se — Umm-Hani ke aazad-karda — faakhitaa se, jo Umm-Hani bint Abi Talib hain, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) fath ke din mere ghar mere paas dakhil hue, aur ghusl kiya, aur ek kapde mein namaz padhi, us mein baith hue"
"1726","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Umm-Hani ke bete Raziyallahu se, Umm-Hani bint Abi Talib se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas dakhil hue, to Main ne Aap liye mashroob mangwaya aur Aap ne piya — ya kaha: Mashroob mangwaya aur piya — phir mujhe diya aur Main ne piya aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main rozedar thi, lekin Main ne Aap hue ko lautaanaa napasand kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar Ramazan ki qaza ho to us ki jagah ek din roza rakho; aur agar nafl ho to agar chaho to qaza karo, aur agar chaho to na karo"
"1727","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak bin Harb ne ham se bayan kiya, Umm-Hani ke aazad-karda Abu Salih se, Umm-Hani se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Allah Azza-wa Jall ke qaul ke bare mein poocha: {Aur tum apni majlison mein burayi karte ho}. farmaya: Woh jo un ke paas se guzarne use kankari marte the aur us ka mazaq uraate the; Wahy burayi hai jo woh karte the"
"1728","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Quraish mein se ek aadmi hai ne mujhe khabar di, jo Umm-Hani ka beta hai, aur Simak bin Harb un se bayan karte the, kehte hain: Umm-Hani ke donon beton ne mujhe khabar di Shu'bah ne kaha: To main mein se behtar hai se mila, aur Unhon ne mujhe bayan kiya — Umm-Hani se — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke paas dakhil hue, to Unhon ne Aap mashroob diya aur Aap ne piya, phir unhen diya aur Unhon ne piya to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main rozedar thi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nafl rozedar apne nafs ka Malik hai — ya apne nafs ka ameer hai — agar chahe roza rakhe, aur agar chahe iftar kare Shu'bah ne kaha: To Main ne hai se kaha: Kya Tum ne yeh nafs Umm-Hani se suna? Unhon ne kaha: Hamare gharwalon aur Umm-Hani ke aazad-karda Abu Salih ne mujhe Umm-Hani se khabar di"
"1729","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, Abu Salih se, Umm-Hani se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka pet kabhi nahin dekha magar mujhe mude kaaghaza yaad aae, ek-doosre par"
"1730","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Laila ko kehte suna: Mujhe kisi ne yeh khabar nahin di ke Us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Chasht padhte dekha ho siwae Umm-Hani ke; kyunke Unhon ne bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) fath-Makkah ke din un ke ghar dakhil hue, ghusl kiya, aur aath rak'aten padhin; Main ne Aap koi namaz itni halki padhte nahin dekhi, siwae is ke ke Aap ruku-sajdah poora karte the"
"1731","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Warqa Ibn Umar al-yashkurii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin al-Munkadir ne ham se bayan kiya, umaimaa bint ruqaiqaa se, unhon ne kaha: Main mein thi jinhon Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bai'at ki; to Aap ne ham se liya ke ham chori na karen, poori aayat to ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham se bai'at len to farmaya: Main aurton se musafaha nahin karta; aur ek aurat se meri baat sau aurton se baat jaisi hai"
"1732","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin an-Nu'man se, Talha al-Yami se, Abdul-Qais mein se ek aurat se, Abdullah bin Rawahah ki bahan se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, farmaya: Har nasheen par nikalna wajib hai — ya'ni donon Eidain mein"
"1733","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Abu Ayyub ko suna, Juwairiyah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume ke din un ke paas dakhil hue jabke woh rozedar thin, to farmaya: Kya Tum ne kal roza rakha? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin farmaya: Kya tum kal roza rakhogii? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin farmaya: To iftar karo"
"1734","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais bin ar-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin al-Husain ne mujhe Rabi' bint muavviza ke paas bheja; un se poochne, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kasrat un ke paas wuzu karte the to main un ke paas aaya aur un se poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko wuzu karte dekha, aur Aap ne apne sar ke liye taza pani liya"
"1735","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, Maimunah bint al-Haris se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghusl kiya — ya kaha: Wuzu kiya — janabat ke un ke ghusl ke bache pani se"
"1736","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sulaiman ash-Shaibani se, Abdullah bin Shaddad bin al-Hadh se, Maimunah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khumaraa par namaz padhte the"
"1737","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Miqsam se kaha: Main teen se witr padhta hun, phir namaz ke liye nikalta hun, darte hue ke mujh se choot na jae to unhon ne kaha: Witr sirf paanch ya saat se durust hai to Main ne is ki khabar Mujahid aur Yahya bin al-Jazzar ko di, to Unhon ne mujh se kaha: un se poocho kis se? To Main ne un se poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Siqah se, siqah se, Maimunah aur A'ishah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se"
"1738","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Kuraib se, Ibn Abbas se, Maimunah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke paas ghusl kiya, to woh Aap paas ruumaala din aur Aap ne use phenk diya A'mash ne kaha: To Main ne is ka zikr Ibrahim se kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Hadees aise hi hai; aur ruumaala se ponchhne mein koi harj nahin; woh to Sallallahu hai"
"1739","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Kuraib se, Ibn Abbas se, Maimunah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ghusl karte to nahaane ki jagah se hote aur apne qadam dhote"
"1740","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr al-Huzali ne ham se bayan kiya, Amir se, Abdullah bin Shaddad se, Maimunah se, ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab mere ghar se nikalte to apna sar aasman ki taraf uthate aur farmate: Aey Allah, main Teri panah mangta hun is se ke phisaluun, ya gumrah hun, ya zulm karun ya mujh par zulm ho, ya jahalat karun ya mujh par jahalat ki jae"
"1741","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Shahr bin Haushab se, Asma bint Yazid al-Ansariyah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko padhte suna: {Beshak woh amal hai jo nek nahin}."
"1742","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak aur Kharijah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah Ibn Abi Ziyad se, Shahr se, Asma se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo apne bhai ki izzat ki himaayata kare us ki gheebat mein, to Allah par lazim hai ke use aag se aazad kare"
"1743","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Shahr se, Asma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Dajjal ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Us ke nikalne se pahle ek saal aasman apni baarish ka tihai roke, aur zameen apni uga ka tihai; aur doosre saal aasman apni baarish ke do tihai roke, aur zameen apni uga ke do tihai; aur teesre saal aasman apni baarish aur zameen apni uga rokne, yahan tak ke na dant wala bache, na khur chhae aur us ke sab bade fitne mein se hai ke woh aadmi se kehta: Agar main tumhare liye tumhari walidah-baap zinda karun, to Kya tum janoge ke main tumhara Rabb hun? To shaitan un ke hamashakla kar aayenge phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni kisi hajat ke liye nikle, phir aae jabke ghar ro rahe the to Aap ne darwaze ki donon caukhaten pakden, phir kaha: Kya hua? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne Dajjal ka zikr kiya; Allah ki qasam, mein se ek apna aataa guundhataa hai aur roti use se pahle darta hai ke fitne mein jae, jabke Aap kehte hain: Khane us tak simatenge. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us din mo'min ko Wahy kafi hoga jo farishton ko kafi hai unhon ne kaha: Farishte to na khate hain na peete hain, lekin paak bayan karte hain to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us din momineen ka khana tasbih hai; agar woh nikle jabke main tum hun, to main us ka jhagarane wala hun; aur agar woh mere baad nikle, to Allah har Musalman par mera khalifa hai"
"1744","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Makki Ubaidullah Ibn Abi Yazid se, sibaaa bin Sabit se, Umm-kurza al-kaabiyyaa se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Parindon ko un ke ghonsalon par rehne do unhon ne kaha: Ya'ni shaguna."
"1745","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Madani Abu Asim ne ham se bayan kiya — Umm-Qais bint Mihsan al-Asadi ke aazad-karda Nafi' ke aazad-karda — Nafi' se, unhon ne kaha: Umm-Qais bint Mihsan ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne nafs ko dekha, main aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) — Aap mera hath pakde the — Madinah ki kisi galii mein, jis mein koi ghar na tha; yahan tak ke ham Baqi'-gharaqada pahunche to farmaya: Aey Umm-Qais to main ne kaha: Labbaik ya rasuulallaaha wa saadaika. farmaya: Yeh qabrastan dekhta ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan, Aey Allah ke farmaya farmaya: Is se sattar hazaar uthae jaenge, un ke chehre caudahaviin ke chand jaise honge, baghair hisab jannat mein dakhil honge phir ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aur main? Farmaya: Aur tuma. phir doosra khada hua aur kaha: Aur main, Ya Rasulullah? Farmaya: Ukkashah tum aage gaya"
"1746","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Umm-Qais se, ke Unhon ne unhen khabar di ke ek bachche ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki god mein peshab kiya, jo abhi khana khane ko na pahunchi tha; to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pani mangwaya aur us par chhidka maare, aur karo na dhoyaa. Zuhri ne kaha: To sunnat jari hui ke jo bachche khana na khate hon un ke peshab par chhidka maare jaen, aur sunnat jari hui ke jo bachche khana khate hon un ke peshab ko dhoya jae"
"1747","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muslim al-qurrii se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Asma bint Abi Bakr ke paas dakhil hue aur un se aurton ke mut'ah ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein Ise kiya"
"1748","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, Fatimah bint al-Mundhir se, Asma bint Abi Bakr se, ke ek aurat ne poocha — ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se — haiz ke khoon ke bare mein jo kapde ko lage, to farmaya: Use pani se khuracho, aur jo us ke aasapaasa ho us par chhidka maro"
"1749","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Mus'ab bin Sabit bin Abdullah bin az-Zubair se, Amir bin Abdullah bin az-Zubair se, apne walid se, ke Abu Bakr ne Jahiliyat mein apni biwi qutailaa ko talaq di, jo Asma bint Abi Bakr ki walida thin; phir woh un ke paas us muddat mein aaeen jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Quraish ke kafiron ke darmiyan thi to Unhon ne Asma bint Abi Bakr ko qurta aur cheezen tohfe mein din, lekin Unhon ne un se qabool karne ko napasand kiya, yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaeen aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya to Allah Azza-wa Jall ne nazil kiya: {Allah tumhen un se nahin rokta jinhon deen mein tum pada nahin ki}."
"1750","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah ne mujhe khabar di ke Urwah bin az-Zubair ne unhen khabar di ke Asma bint Abi Bakr ne unhen khabar di ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mimbar par farmate suna: Allah Azza-wa Jall se zyada ghairat wala koi nahin"
"1751","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Naufal Ibn Abi akraba se, Asma bint Abi Bakr se, ke Unhon ne Hajjaj se kaha: Khabardar, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen bayan kiya ke Saqeef mein kazzab aur kar hoga; kazzab to Ham ne dekh liya, aur kar to main tumhen hi samajhti hun"
"1752","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Asma bint Abi Bakr ke aazad-karda Abdullah se, ke Asma Muzdalifah ki raat apne gharwalon se kehti thin: Kya chand dooba? Kya chand dooba? Jab woh kehte: Ji Haan, to farmatin: Utho; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen aise hi bhejte the"
"1753","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi az-Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, ke Asma bint Abi Bakr ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, meri walida Quraish ke ahd mein mere paas aaeen, jabke woh khvaahishamanda mushrik hain; Kya main un se sila-rehmi karun? Farmaya: Ji Haan, apni walida se sila-rehmi karo"
"1754","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khubaib se, bin maana se, Ansari Harisah bin an-Nu'man ki beti se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne hamen dekha, hamara tannuura aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka tannuura ek tha; aur Main ne Qaf — ya'ni surat Qaf — sirf Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munh se li jabke Aap khutba dete the"
"1755","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr Ibn Abi al-Jahm ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf Fatimah bint Qais ke paas dakhil hue, Aal-Zubair ki saltanat mein; to Ham ne un se teen talaq wali ke bare mein poocha, Kya us ke liye naana-nafqaa hai? To unhon ne kaha: Mere shauhar ne mujhe teen talaq din, mere liye na rehaish rakhi, na naana-nafqaa. to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaeen aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, aur kaha: Us ne mere liye na rehaish rakhi, na naana-nafqaa. farmaya: Sach kaha phir kaha: Umm-Shareek ke ghar mein iddat guzaaro. phir kaha: Muhajir un ke paas aate hain, lekin bin Umm-Maktoom ke ghar mein iddat guzaro; kyunke woh nabina aadmi hain, aur shayad tum apne kapde ya kuch kapde utaaro. unhon ne kaha: To Main ne kiya jab meri iddat guzar to Abu al-Jahm ne — Quraish mein se ek aadmi — aur Mu'awiyah Ibn Abi Sufyan ne mujhe paigham diya to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaeen aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Abu al-Jahm to aurton par sakht aadmi hain, aur Mu'awiyah to bemaala aadmi hain unhon ne kaha: Phir Usamah bin Zaid ne mujhe paigham diya, to Main ne un se nikah kiya; Allah ne mujhe Usamah mein barkat di"
"1756","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Sayyar Abu al-Hakam ne ham se bayan kiya, ash-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Fatimah bint Qais ke paas dakhil hue aur Unhon ne hamen bin Taab ek taza khajooron se nawaza, aur hamen jau ka sattu pilaya to Ham ne un se teen talaq wali ke bare mein poocha: Woh kahan iddat guzare? To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe apne gharwalon mein iddat guzare ki ijazat di — ya'ni: Muntaqil hone ki — aur us din logon mein pukara gaya: Namaz jama karne wali hai to main un aurton mein nikleen jo nikleen, aur main aurton ki agli saf mein thi, mardon ki pichhli saf ke paas to Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Tameem Woh-Dari ke chachazad samundar mein sawar hue, aur un ki kishti ne unhen samundar ke kisi kinare phenka; aur wahan ek janwar tha jise us ke baal chhipate the jab ham us par dakhil hue to us ne kaha: Main Jassasah hun phir kaha: Us khanqah mein woh hai jo tumhen dekhne ka mushtaaqa hai to ham dakhil hue, aur ek aadmi lohe mein sakhti se jakaraa tha to us ne kaha: Kya tumhara sathi nikla? Ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam). to ham ne kaha: Ji Han kaha: To un ki pairwi karo phir kaha: Mujhe baisaana ki khajooron ki khabar do, Kya woh phal deti hain? Ham ne kaha: Ji Han kaha: Mujhe tabariyaa ki jhiila ki khabar do, Kya woh zyada pani wali hai? Ham ne kaha: Ji Han kaha: Mujhe zughara ke chashme ki khabar do, Kya woh zyada pani wala hai? Ham ne kaha: Ji Han to kaha: Khabardar, agar main nikla to tamam shaharon ko raunduungaa siwae Makkah aur taibaa ke Fatimah ne kaha: To Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apni chhadi se farmate dekha: Khabardar, yeh taibaa hai — Madinah ki zameen ki taraf ishara karte hue — aur Makkah Makkah hai"
"1757","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Tau'amah ke aazad-karda Salih se, Abu Hurairah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajjat-wa'da mein apni biwiyon se farmaya: Yeh sirf ek hai, phir kapde ki peeth hai unhon ne kaha: To woh sab safar karti thin siwae Zainab aur Saudah ke; kyunke unhon ne kaha: Hamen koi sawari na hilaaegii, jabase Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna"
"1758","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib bin Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin harima se, Sa'id bin Jubair aur Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zubair bint az-Zubair ko Hajj mein shart karne ka hukm diya, to Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm se aisa kiya"
"1759","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan as-Sauri ne ham se bayan kiya, Salim Abu an-Nazr se, Ummul-Fazl ke aazad-karda Umair se, unhon ne kaha: Log Arafat mein Arafah ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke roze mein ummiyah, to Ummul-Fazl ne kaha: Main tumhare liye yeh ma'loom karungi to Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf doodh ka bartan bheja aur Aap ne piya"
"1760","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Karim al-jazarii se, bint Anas bin Malik ke bete, un ki dadi Umm-Sulaim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mashkize ke munh se peete dekha, to Main ne Ise kata aur kaha: Is ke baad is se koi na piegaa."
"1761","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Ikrimah se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas aur Zaid bin Sabit mein us aurat ke bare mein ikhtilaf hua jise haiz aaya, jabke Us ne Qurbani ke din Baitullah ka tawaf kiya tha; Zaid ne kaha: Us ka aakhri ahd Baitullah ho; aur Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Jab chahe kooch kare to Ansar ne kaha: Ham tumhari pairwi na karenge, Aey Ibn Abbas, jabke tum Zaid ki mukhalifat karte ho to unhon ne kaha: Apni biwi Umm-Sulaim se poocho to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Baitullah ka tawaf karne ke baad haiz aaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe kooch ka hukm diya; aur Safiyyah ko haiz aaya, to A'ishah ne un se kaha: Tum ne hamen roka to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen kooch ka hukm diya"
"1762","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Abdullah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Bukair bin Abdullah bin al-Ashaj se, Busr bin Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Saqafi Zainab ne mujhe bayan kiya — Abdullah bin Mas'ud ki biwi — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke jab aakhri Isha ki namaz ke liye niklen to khushbu na Raziyallahu"
"1763","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Wa'il ko suna, Amr bin al-Haris se, Saqafi Zainab se — Abdullah ki biwi — bayan karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aurton se farmaya: Sadqa karo chahe apne zevaron mein se to Zainab ne Abdullah se kaha: Kya mere liye kafi hoga ke main apna Sadqa tum par aur apne bhai ya bahan ke yateem beton par rakhun? Jabke Abdullah tangdast the to unhon ne kaha: Is ke bare mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocho Zainab ne kaha: To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaeen, aur Ansar mein se Zainab ek ek aurat thi jo Wahy poochne aai thi jo main poochne aai thi to Bilal hamare paas nikle, aur Ham ne un se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocho aur unhen na batao ham kaun hain: Kya mere liye kafi hoga ke main apna Sadqa apne bhai ke yateem beton ya apni bahan ke yateem beton par rakhun jo meri parwarish mein hain? To woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, to farmaya: Woh kaun-si Zainab hain? To unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Mas'ud ki biwi Zainab, aur Ansar mein se ek aurat zainaba. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Unhen khabar do ke un ke liye do ajr hain; qurbadari ka ajr aur sadqe ka ajra."
"1764","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Husain al-ahamasii se, unhon ne kaha: Meri dadi Umm-Husain al-ahamasiyyaa ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Agar tum par Habshi ghulam muqarrar kiya jae, jab tak woh tumhen Allah ki Kitab se chalaye, to us ki suno aur ita'at karo"
"1765","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Husain se, apni dadi se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sar mundavaane walon ke liye teen martaba aur baal kataravaane walon ke liye ek martaba dua ki"
"1766","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, az-Zuhri se, Humaid bin Abdur Rahman se, un ki walida Umm-Kulsoom bint Uqbah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh jhoota nahin jo do ke darmiyan sulah kare, aur chahiye baat kahe, ya chahiye baat pahunchaye"
"1767","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah ya Muhammad Ibn Abi Bakr bin Amr bin Hazm se, Urwah bin az-Zubair se, ke Marwan ne Busrah bint Safwan ki taraf bheja aur un se poocha; to Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya ke farmaya: Jo apni sharmgah chhue woh wuzu kare"
"1768","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anbari Abdullah bin Hassan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Meri do daadiyon — ulaibaa ki betiyan duhaibaa aur Safiyyah — ne mujhe bayan kiya, apni sautelii beti aur apne baap ki dadi Qailah bint Makhramah se, ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen Fajr padhai jab Fajr phatii thi, jabke Iza aasman mein ulajhe the, raat ke andhere mein shayad hi pehchane jate the, aur aadmi shayad hi pehchane jate the"
"1769","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id Ibn Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi se, Abdur Rahman bin bujaida se, apni dadi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mangne wala aata hai aur mere darwaze par khada hota hai, jabke mere paas woh nahin jo use dun farmaya: Use do chahe jala khur ho"
"1770","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid Ibn Abi Ziyad se, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Amr bin al-Ahwas ko kehte suna: Main ne apni dadi — ya walida — ko bayan karte suna ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jamre ke paas suna jabke log bheed mein the, to farmaya: Aey logo, apne nafs ko na maro; khadhf ki kankriyon jaisi se maro"
"1771","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khubaib bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Meri phuphi Unaisah ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bilal aur bin Umm-Maktoom Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye azan dete the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bilal raat ko azan deta hai, to khao-piyo yahan tak ke bin Umm-Maktoom azan de to ham bin Umm-Maktoom ko azan se rokte the aur kehte the: Thehre raho yahan tak ke ham sahar karen, thehre raho yahan tak ke ham sahar karen; aur un ki donon azaanon ke darmiyan sirf izafa hota tha ke yeh utre aur yeh chadhe"
"1772","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin al-Muhajir se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr bin al-Haris bin Hisham al-Qurashi ko kehte suna: Marwan bin al-Hakam ne Umm-Ma'qil ke paas bheja — Ashja' mein se ek aurat — to us aurat ne kaha: Mujh par umrah tha, aur mere shauhar ne Allah ki raah mein apna ek jawan oont diya tha; to Main ne un se manga ke mujhe den, main us par umrah karun to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ise Allah ki raah mein diya hai to main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaeen, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hajj-umrah Allah ki raah mein se hain to unhen hukm diya ke use den, woh us par umrah kare aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ramazan mein umrah Hajj jaisa hai — ya kaha: Hajj ke liye kafi hai Shu'bah ne kaha: To Abu Bishr ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Jubair se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh sirf us aurat se khaas kaha tha"
"1773","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Khabbab ki beti se, ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas bakri din, to Aap ne use pakda aur dohaa, aur farmaya: Apna sab bada bartan aao to ham Aap paas aante ka khajooren jane, aur us mein dohaa yahan tak ke bharaa. phir kaha: Piyo tum aur tumhare parosii."
"1774","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ishaq se, Zainab se, Abu Sa'id ki bahan Furai'ah se, ke un ka shauhar mazdooron ke peeche gaya aur Unhon ne use qatl kiya, jabke woh Madinah ke gaanvon mein se ek basti mein thin to woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaeen aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, aur ijazat mangi ke apni behnon ke paas kar un ke paas iddat guzaaren. to Aap ne unhen ijazat di phir unhen bulaya — ya woh Aap paas bulaya gayin — to farmaya: Us ghar mein thehro jis mein tumhare shauhar ki khabar tumhen aai, yahan tak ke Kitab apni muddat ko pahunche"
"1775","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Husain se, Abu Wa'il se, Masrooq se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ki walida Umm-ruumaana ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main baithe thi ke ek aurat mere paas dakhil hui aur kaha: Allah falan se aisa-aisa kare to main ne kaha: Use Kya hua? Us ne kaha: Us ne baat phailaaii — ya'ni A'ishah ka zikr kiya to A'ishah ne kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh suna? Us ne kaha: Ji Han unhon ne kaha: Kya Abu Bakr ne yeh suna? Us ne kaha: Ji Han to unhen kuch hua, aur woh bukhar ke siwa na uthiin. to Main ne un par apne kapde kare phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dakhil hue aur farmaya: Is ka Kya haal hai? To main ne kaha: Unhen kanpakanpii wala bukhar hua unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shayad woh kisi kahi gayi baat ki wajah se hai to A'ishah baithiin aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, agar main qasam khaauun to tum mujhe na maanoge, aur agar main kahun to tum mujh se qabool na karoge; aur meri-misaal aur tumhari misaal Yaqub aur un ke beton jaisi hi hai, {aur Allah hi madadgar hai us par jo tum bayan karte ho}. unhon ne kaha: To Allah Azza-wa Jall ne un ki bari hone ki aayat nazil ki to A'ishah ne kaha: Allah ki tareef se, na tumhari tareef se na kisi ki tareef se"
"1776","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib bin Zaid al-Ansari ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hamari Laila ek ek aazad-karda ko suna, apni dadi Umm-Umarah al-Ansariyah se bayan karte hue, ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi rozedar nahin jis ke paas khaya jae, magar farishte us par dua karte hain yahan tak ke woh sera hon aur ek martaba kaha: Yahan tak ke woh farigh hon aurton ki hadeesein ka aakhira."
"1777","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) fath ke saal rozedar nikle yahan tak ke rozedar-Ghamim aae, jabke log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath paidal-sawar the, aur woh Ramazan mein tha to kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, kuch logon par roza sakht hua, aur woh sirf Aap dekhte hain Aap ne Kya kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pani ka pyala mangwaya, use uthaya aur piya jabke log dekh rahe the to kuch logon ne roza rakha aur kuch ne iftar kiya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar di gayi ke mein se kuch rozedar hain, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh nafarman hain"
"1778","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Husain bin Ali Ibn Abi Talib mein se Ja'far bin Muhammad bin Ali bin Husain bin Ali Ibn Abi Talib bin Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah mein nau saal thehre, Hajj na kiya; phir logon ko Hajj ki ijazat di, aur mein bahut log the jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nikalna chahte the to Aap nikle, yahan tak ke jab Zul-Zulhulaifah aae to Asma bint Umais ne Abu Bakr as-Siddiq ke bete Muhammad ko janam to Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf bheja aur Aap se poocha, to farmaya: Ghusl karo aur kapda bandho, phir ehram lagao to Unhon ne kiya unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki untni ka seena khule maidan par jama to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram bandha aur Ham ne ehram bandha, Hajj ke siwa koi niiyata na karte hue Jabir ne kaha: To Main ne nazar ke phailaava tak aur apne peeche, apne daayen aur apne baayen logon ko dekha, paidal-savaara. to ham nikle, Hajj ke siwa kuch na jante the; us ke liye nikle the, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare sath the, aur Quran Aap par nazil hota tha, aur woh us ki wahi jante the, aur Aap sirf us par amal karte the jis ka Aap hukm diya jata tha yahan tak ke ham Makkah aae, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajar se shuru kiya aur us ka istilam kiya, phir saat phere kiye, mein teen mein ramal kiya aur chaar mein chale phir yeh aayat padhi: {Aur Maqam-Ibrahim ko namaz ki jagah banao}. unhon ne kaha: Do rak'aten padhin — mere walid ne kaha: Woh mein tauheed wali suraton se karna pasand karte the; {kaho Aey kaafiro} aur {kaho woh Allah ek hai} — aur Jabir ki hadees mein is ka zikr na kiya phir Jabir ki hadees ki taraf aae — unhon ne kaha: Phir rukn ke paas aae aur us ka istilam kiya unhon ne kaha: Phir Safa ki taraf nikle unhon ne kaha: Ham us se shuru karte hain jis se Allah ne shuru kiya aur kaha: {Beshak Safa-Marwah Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain}. unhon ne kaha: To Safa par chadhe yahan tak ke Baitullah nazar aaya, aur teen martaba takbir kahi aur farmaya: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, akela, us ka koi Shareek nahin; usi ki badshahat hai, aur usi ki tareef hai; woh zinda karta aur marte hai; us ke hath mein bhalai hai, aur woh har cheez par qadir hai phir us ke darmiyan dua karte unhon ne kaha: Phir utre aur chale, yahan tak ke naale ke pet mein aae, aur daud yahan tak ke naale mein qadam uthae, phir chale yahan tak ke Marwah aae, aur chadhe yahan tak ke Baitullah nazar aaya to teen martaba takbir kahi, aur farmaya: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, akela, us ka koi Shareek nahin — aise hi jaisa kiya — ya'ni Safa par — phir utre aur farmaya: Jis ke paas qurbani ka janwar na ho woh halal ho aur use umrah banae; agar mujhe woh ma'loom hota jo baad mein ma'loom hua, to use umrah banata to woh halal hue aur Yaman se Ali Ibn Abi Talib aae aur logon ko halal dekha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum ne kis cheez se ehram bandha? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Aey Allah, main us se ehram bandhta hun jis se Tere Rasulullah ne ehram bandha farmaya: Mere paas qurbani ka janwar hai, to halal na ho unhon ne kaha: To Ali Fatimah ke paas dakhil hue, jabke Unhon ne surma lagaya tha aur range kapde pahne the to Unhon ne is ka inkar kiya; aur kaha: Tumhen is ka Kis ne hukm diya? To unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe is ka hukm diya — Muhammad bin Ali ne kaha: Ali Iraq mein bayan karte the, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Fatimah ki shikayat lekar gaya us bare mein jo Unhon ne zikr kiya, to farmaya: Unhon ne sach kaha, Main ne unhen hukm diya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ise teen martaba kaha — jab Qurbani ka din hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tirsath untniyan Qurbani ki, aur Ali ne jo baciin Qurbani ki, aur woh sau untniyan thin to har untni mein se ek tukda liya, aur par, aur Unhon ne aur Ali ne khaya, aur mein mein se piya aur Suraqah bin Malik bin juushuma ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya yeh hamare is saal ke liye hai ya hamesha ke liye? Farmaya: Nahin, lekin hamesha ke liye; umrah Hajj mein dakhil hua aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni ungliyon mein ungliyan dalin"
"1779","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri shafa'at meri ummat ke Kabeera walon ke liye hai unhon ne kaha: To Jabir ne mujh se kaha: jo Kabeera walon mein se na ho use shafa'at se Kya?."
"1780","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Ansar ki ek aurat ke paas chala, to Us ne Aap liye bakri zabah ki, aur hamare paas khana laaiin. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khaya aur Ham ne khaya phir ham Zuhr ke liye khade hue, mein se kisi ne wuzu na kiya phir hamare paas bakri ka bacha laya gaya, aur Ham ne us mein se raat ka khana khaya, aur Asr aai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur ham khade hue aur Ham ne namaz padhi, mein se kisi ne pani na chhua"
"1781","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Bakr se farmaya: Tum raat mein kis waqt witr padhte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Raat ke shuru mein Isha ke baad aur Umar se kaha: Tum kis waqt witr padhte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Raat ke aakhir mein to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Bakr se farmaya: Tum ne mazboot pakad li aur Umar se kaha: Tum ne taqat li"
"1782","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hamzah ko ek kapde mein kafan diya Jabir ne kaha: Woh kapda Habarah chadar tha"
"1783","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ki wafat hui, to Ham ne use ghusl diya, khushbu lagai aur kafan diya phir ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae taake Aap us par namaz karte to Aap ne kuch qadam badhae, phir kaha: Kya us par qarz hai? Ham ne kaha: Ji Haan, do dinar farmaya: Apne sathi par namaz padho to Abu Qatadah ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ka qarz mujh par hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh tum par hain wale ke haq ke taur par, aur miyyat bari hai unhon ne kaha: Ji Han to Aap ne us par namaz padhi phir agle din un se mile aur kaha: Do deenar ka Kya hua? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, woh to kal hi mara hai phir agle din un se mile aur kaha: Do deenar ka Kya hua? To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne unhen ada kar diya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ab us ki khaal thandi hui"
"1784","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Ansar ki ek aurat ke paas chala, to Us ne un ke liye bakri zabah ki to hamare paas woh khana laya gaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare paas jannat mein se ek aadmi dakhil hoga to Abu Bakr dakhil hue phir kaha: Tumhare paas jannat mein se ek aadmi dakhil hoga to Umar dakhil hue phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare paas jannat mein se ek aadmi dakhil hoga; Aey Allah, agar Tu chahe to use Ali karo to Ali dakhil hue"
"1785","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghulam apne sardar ki ijazat ke baghair ihsan kare woh zani hai"
"1786","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi' bin Subaih ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Zul-Zulhijjah ke chaar guzarne par chauthi ki subah aae, ham sab Hajj ka ehram bandhe the to Aap ne hamen hukm diya, aur Ham ne Baitullah ka tawaf kiya, aur do rak'aten padhin, aur Safa-Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i ki phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Halal ho jao ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya halal? Farmaya: Waisa halal jaisa halal ke liye halal hai, aurton aur khushbu mein se to aurton se mile, aur khushbu ki angiithiyaan mahakiin. unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap pahunchi ke mein se kuch kehte hain: Kya mein se ek Mina jae jabke us ka zikr mani tapakaataa ho?! To Aap ne unhen khutba diya, Allah ki tareef ki aur sana ki, phir kaha: Agar mujhe woh ma'loom hota jo baad mein ma'loom hua, to hadi na hankata; aur agar hadi na hankata to main nafs halal hota; to apne manasik lo Jabir ne kaha: To qaum apne halal par thehro, yahan tak ke jab Tarwiyah ka din hua to Hajj ka ehram bandha to hadi us par thi jo pae, aur roza us par tha jo na pae aur un ki hadiyon mein un ke darmiyan Shareek kiya; oont saat ki taraf se, aur gae saat ki taraf se aur Baitullah ka un ka tawaf aur Safa-Marwah ke darmiyan un ka phera ek tawaf aur ek sa'i tha, un ke Hajj-umrah ke liye"
"1787","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik se, Ata se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Padosi apne padosi ke shuf'ah ka zyada haqdar hai; us ka intezar kiya jata hai, chahe woh ghaaiba ho, jab un ka rasta ek ho"
"1788","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabah Ibn Abi Ma'roof ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne paaltu gadhon ke gosht khane se mana kiya"
"1789","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya ke qaid ki hamla aurton se humbistari ki jae"
"1790","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Ata ko suna, Jabir se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Umrah jaiz hai"
"1791","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Ata Ibn Abi Rabah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir se kaha: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Najashi par saf bandhin? Unhon ne kaha: Ji Haan, aur main doosri saf mein tha"
"1792","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us se bayan kiya Jis ne Ata ko suna, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us shakhs ke liye talaq nahin Jis ne nikah na kiya, aur aazad nahin us ke liye jo Malik na ho"
"1793","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Laila se, Ata se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khajooron ki taraf nikle, aur Aap sath Abdur Rahman bin Auf the to apne bete Ibrahim ke paas pahunche, jabke woh jaan de rahe the to bachche ko apni god mein rakha aur roye to Abdur Rahman ne un se kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap hamen rone se mana karte hain?! Farmaya: Main ne rone se mana nahin kiya; Main ne sirf do fajir aavaazon se mana kiya; nemat par bansri ki awaz se, shaitan ki bansri aur khel se; aur museebat par awaz se, gireban ciirane aur shaitan ki ciikha se; aur yeh to rehmat hai"
"1794","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais se, Ata se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne marne se pahle Qurbani kiya farmaya: Marne karo aur koi harj nahin"
"1795","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Ata se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hajj ka ehram bandhe aae, to farmaya: Tum se jo chahe use umrah banae; aur jis ke sath hadi ho woh use umrah nahin bana sakta"
"1796","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ek aadmi ko raat mein dafan karte dekha"
"1797","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah Abdur Rahman bin Auf bin Abdur Rahman se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Umrah usi ki hai jise di gayi"
"1798","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se poocha: Kaun-sa Quran pahle nazil hua? Unhon ne kaha: {Aey chadar orhane wale}. main ne kaha: Mujhe pahunchi hai ke sab pahle nazil hua: {Padho apne Rabb ke naam se Jis ne paida kiya}. to Abu Salamah ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah se poocha: Kaun-sa Quran pahle nazil hua? To Unhon ne mujh se kaha: {Aey chadar orhane wale}. main ne kaha: Mujhe pahunchi hai ke sab pahle nazil hua: {Padho apne Rabb ke naam se Jis ne paida kiya}. to Jabir ne kaha: Main tumhen Wahy batata hun jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya farmaya: Main ne Hira mein e'tikaf kiya; jab apna e'tikaf poora kiya to chala; jab wadi mein tarah to pukara gaya to Main ne apne samne, apne daayen, apne baayen aur apne peeche dekha, aur kuch na dekha phir Main ne apna sar uthaya, aur woh aasman-zameen ke darmiyan takht par tha to main us se dahashatazadaa hua — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ya'ni main us se gir pada — unhon ne kaha: To main Khadijah ke paas aaya — ya kaha: Apne gharwalon ke paas aaya — aur kaha: Mujhe chadar orhaao, mujhe chadar orhaao. to mujhe chadar orhaaii gayi, aur mujh par thandak pani dala gaya phir mere paas aaya gaya aur kaha gaya: {Aey chadar orhane wale, khade ho aur daro, aur apne Rabb ki takabbur karo, aur apne kapde pak karo}."
"1799","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih Ibn Abi al-akhazara ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, ke Unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir Wahy rukii."
"1800","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise umrah di jae, woh us ki hai aur us ke baad us ki nasla ki"
